       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""llr-mapping"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>LLR Mapping<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#llr-mapping"" title=""Link to this"
       & " heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-ARCH-01: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">alire.toml</span></code> shall declare project metadata [HLR-ARCH]</p><"
       & "/li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-ARCH-02: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">Makefile</span></code> shall provide build, prove, fmt, lint, api-docs,"
       & " changelog targets [HLR-ARCH]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-ARCH-03: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">adacovex.gpr</span></code> shall compile all sources with <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">-gnatwa</span></code> warnin"
       & "gs [HLR-ARCH]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-SCAN-01: Scan_Project shall walk directories recursively. It shal"
       & "l skip .git and obj [HLR-SCAN]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-SCAN-02: Scan_Ads_File shall extract procedure, function, and gen"
       & "eric declarations [HLR-SCAN]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-SCAN-03: Scan_Ads_File shall find "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " HLR-XXXX tags in source [HLR-SCAN]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-SCAN-04: Scan_Ads_File shall find &#64;param, &#64;return, &#64;f"
       & "ield, &#64;formal docstring tags [HLR-SCAN]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-PROOF-01: Parse_Prove_Out shall parse gnatprove.out and extract V"
       & "C counts per check type [HLR-PROOF]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-PROOF-02: Determine_SPARK_Level shall assign level based on prove"
       & "d/unproved ratios [HLR-PROOF]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-TEST-01: Parse_Test_Result shall parse Markdown test results for "
       & "pass/fail counts [HLR-TEST]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-TEST-02: Parse_Test_Stdout shall parse raw test runner stdout for"
       & " pass/fail counts [HLR-TEST]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-DAL-01: Assess_DAL_C shall make sure that all HLRs are traced in "
       & "source [HLR-COMPLIANCE] [HLR-DAL-C]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-DAL-02: Assess_DAL_C shall find orphan tags that do not match any"
       & " HLR [HLR-COMPLIANCE] [HLR-DAL-C]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-DAL-03: Assess_DAL_C shall make sure that test results show zero "
       & "failures [HLR-COMPLIANCE] [HLR-DAL-C]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-DAL-04: Assess_DAL_C shall make sure that SPARK level is &gt;= Br"
       & "onze [HLR-COMPLIANCE] [HLR-DAL-C]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-DAL-05: Assess_DAL_A shall require SPARK Gold + tests passing + a"
       & "ll HLRs + no orphans [HLR-DAL-A]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-DAL-06: Assess_DAL_B shall require SPARK Silver + tests passing +"
       & " all HLRs + no orphans [HLR-DAL-B]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-DAL-07: Assess_DAL_D shall require tests passing + all HLRs [HLR-"
       & "DAL-D]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-DAL-08: Assess_DAL_E shall require all HLRs [HLR-DAL-E]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-RENDER-ANSI-01: Render_Summary shall output colour-highlighted te"
       & "rminal report [HLR-RENDER-ANSI]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-RENDER-SVG-01: Render_SPARK_Badge shall produce valid SVG with le"
       & "vel colour [HLR-RENDER-SVG]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-RENDER-SVG-02: Render_Tests_Badge shall show passed/failed in gre"
       & "en/red [HLR-RENDER-SVG]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-RENDER-SVG-03: Render_DO178C_Badge shall show Achieved/Unmet in g"
       & "reen/red [HLR-RENDER-SVG]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-RENDER-MD-01: Generate_Verification_Report shall write coverage, "
       & "proof, test, compliance tables [HLR-RENDER-MD]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-RENDER-MD-02: Generate_Trace_Matrix shall map each package to its"
       & " HLR tags [HLR-RENDER-MD]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-RENDER-HTML-01: Render_Dashboard shall produce self-contained HTM"
       & "L with embedded CSS [HLR-RENDER-HTML]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-RENDER-HTML-02: Render_Metrics_JSON shall produce JSON with key m"
       & "etrics [HLR-RENDER-HTML]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-SERVER-01: Start shall bind to port and serve dashboard at /, API"
       & " at /api/metrics, badges at /badge/*.svg [HLR-SERVER]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-CLI-01: Parse_CLI shall parse "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "target, "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "dal, "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "serve, "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "port, "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "emit-svg, "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "emit-markdown [HLR-CLI]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>LLR-CLI-02: Parse_CLI shall default target to the current working dir"
       & "ectory and DAL to C [HLR-CLI]</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
