       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Third-Party Notices<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#third-party-notices"" tit"
       & "le=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex itself is Apache-2.0 (see <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">LICENSE</span></code>) and depends only on the GNAT r"
       & "untime. It declares no library or tool dependencies. The following third-par"
       & "ty components are used as tools or bundled artifacts. Their own licences cov"
       & "er them.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""gnat-gnatprove-toolchain"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>GNAT / GNATprove toolchain<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#gnat-gnatprove-to"
       & "olchain"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>Component</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Version</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Licence</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Used for</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>GNAT compiler (GNAT Community / FSF GNAT)</p></t"
       & "d>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>toolchain-managed</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>GPL-3.0-or-later (with GCC Runtime Library Exception for runtime)</p>"
       & "</td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Compiling adacovex and target projects</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>GNATprove</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>toolchain-managed</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>GPL-3.0-or-later</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>SPARK proof analysis (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">covex</span> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code>)</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Python 3</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>toolchain-managed</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>PSF-2.0</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Build-time only: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">tools/gen-docs.py</span></code> bundles the offline manual into the"
       & " binary</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Python 3 is required at <strong>build time</strong> to bundle the docs in"
       & "to the binary, but the shipped binary itself has no Python dependency "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the manual is embedded as generated Ada string constants. Sphinx, MyST and "
       & "Furo (below) run inside Python to produce that manual; Python itself is not "
       & "bundled or redistributed."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "| Z3 / Alt-Ergo / CVC5 solvers | bundled with GNATprove | MIT / CeCILL-C / A"
       & "pache-2.0 respectively | Satisfying SPARK verification conditions |</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The GNAT toolchain is <strong>not</strong> embedded in the adacovex relea"
       & "se bundle. gnatprove is <strong>not</strong> a declared dependency of the <c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span></cod"
       & "e> crate. adacovex resolves gnatprove at run time. <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span> <span class=""pre"">prove</sp"
       & "an></code> prefers the own gnatprove dependency of the target project when t"
       & "he alire.toml / alire-dev.toml of the target project declares one. It runs g"
       & "natprove through <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>alr</span> <span class=""pre"">exec</span></code>. adacovex itself then requ"
       & "ires only <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</"
       & "span></code> on <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">$PATH</span></code>. If no dependency is declared, it falls back to a gnatp"
       & "rove on <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">$PATH</"
       & "span></code>. Then it falls back to a cached <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/toolchain/bin/gnatprove</span></co"
       & "de>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Finally it falls back to a platform toolchain download. This download is "
       & "a GPL-licensed GNAT/gnatprove distribution. Distributing it requires the end"
       & " user to accept the GPL for that component.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""sbom-specifications"">"
