       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/skanaar/nomnoml"">n"
       & "omnoml</a> is bundled under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">resources/nomnoml.js</span></code> (71 KB, MIT). It is inlined "
       & "into the dashboard page shell. It renders the dependency hierarchy as a UML-"
       & "style diagram. The diagram appears in the alternative view of the <strong>De"
       & "pendencies</strong> tab (Tree / Diagram toggle).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The MIT licence text is preserved in the bundle header comment.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/cytoscape/graphre"""
       & ">graphre</a> is bundled under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">resources/graphre.js</span></code> (38 KB, MIT). It is inline"
       & "d before nomnoml. It provides the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">graphre.graphlib</span></code> and Dagre layout that the "
       & "UMD wrapper (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gl"
       & "obal.graphre</span></code>) of nomnoml requires. Without it, <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">nomnoml.draw</span></code> thr"
       & "ows <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">graphlib</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">is</span> <span class=""pre"">undefined</span></code>.<"
       & "/p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The MIT licence text is preserved in the bundle header comment.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/nextapps-de/flexse"
       & "arch"">FlexSearch</a> is bundled under <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">resources/flexsearch.js</span></code> (16 KB, Apache-"
       & "2.0). It is inlined into the dashboard page shell. It provides the global se"
       & "arch box (packages, HLRs, dependencies). The search box uses an in-memory fo"
       & "rward-tokenized index.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The index loads from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">/__GRAPH_JSON__</span></code> at page load. The Apache-2.0 licence "
       & "text is preserved in the bundle header comment.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/petersolopov/yace"""
       & ">yace</a> is a tiny, zero-dependency code editor component (under 2 KB) by P"
       & "eter Solopov. adacovex vendors its <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">code()</span></code> tokenizer highlighter (<code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/highlighters/code.ts</s"
       & "pan></code>, MIT) as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">resources/yace.js</span></code>. The tokenizer logic is unchanged: rul"
       & "es are tried in order at every position, and tokens are emitted as <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;span</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">class=&quot;yace-tok</span> <span class=""pre"">yace-tok--&lt;type&g"
       & "t;&quot;&gt;</span></code> elements with no built-in colours.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The highlighter is adapted from ESM/TypeScript to a single plain-script b"
       & "inding that exposes <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">window.YaceTok</span></code>, so the dashboard can use it without a bui"
       & "ld step. The dashboard supplies the token colours via CSS. The API playgroun"
       & "d uses it to syntax-highlight the prettified JSON responses of the <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/*</span></code> end"
       & "points; a JSON-key rule (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">&quot;name&quot;:</span></code>) runs ahead of the built-in string"
       & " rule so object keys colour differently from string values. The MIT licence "
       & "text is preserved in the header comment of <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources/yace.js</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><a class=""reference external"" href=""https://chartscss.org/"">Charts.css</a"
       & "> is <strong>not</strong> bundled or redistributed with adacovex. The dashbo"
       & "ard charts were originally rendered with the vendored Charts.css framework ("
       & "1.2.0, MIT); adacovex now ships its <strong>own patched version</strong> of "
       & "those charts, hand-rolled with plain CSS and SVG and driven by the theme"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s CSS variables. Charts.css is credited for inspiration, and its MIT licence"
       & " terms are acknowledged here.</p>"
