       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Shared ANSI colour helper for adacovex stdout.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex colours its terminal output to make the important lines stand"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "out.  Colour is disabled automatically when the output would not take it:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "inside CI (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">CI</"
       & "span></code>), under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">NO_COLOR</span></code>, or with <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">TERM=dumb</span></code>.  This keeps CI"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "logs plain and machine-readable.  adacovex is NO_COLOR-clean and never"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "emits escape codes when the environment opts out."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-ANSI: Terminal colour support</p>"
