       & "          <section id=""iso-26262-asil-levels"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>ISO 26262 ASIL Levels<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#iso-26262-asil-levels"""
       & " title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>ISO 26262 defines four Automotive Safety Integrity Levels (ASIL A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "D) plus the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "quality-managed (QM) classification for road-vehicle functional safety."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex assesses compliance against all of them by re-labelling the same fo"
       & "ur"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "evidence checks it computes for DO-178C: HLR traceability, no orphan tags,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "passing tests, and a minimum SPARK proof level.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""level-definitions"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Level Definitions<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#level-definitions"" title="""
       & "Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>ASIL</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Severity</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Failure Condition</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Example</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>D</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Catastrophic</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Uncontrolled, life-threatening malfunction</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Steering/brake-by-wire, airbag deployment control</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>C</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Hazardous</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Severe injury, survival uncertain</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Stability control, adaptive cruise control</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>B</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Major</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Non-fatal injury possible</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Lane-keeping assist, headlamp control</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>A</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Minor</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>No injury; limited function loss</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Window/sunroof control, seat adjustment</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>QM</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>No effect</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>No safety effect (quality-managed)</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Infotainment, navigation</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""assessment-criteria"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Assessment Criteria<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#assessment-criteria"" tit"
       & "le=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex evaluates the same four criteria for every level; only the level"
       & " name"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the minimum proof bar change.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""hlr-traceability"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>1. HLR Traceability<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#hlr-traceability"" title="
       & """Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
