       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-cache"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Adacovex.Cache<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-cache"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Content-addressed result cache for adacovex."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The cache stores arbitrary small blobs keyed by the SHA-256 of their input"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(a source file"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s contents, a gnatprove.out, a test-result file, and more)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The key is derived from the inputs.  An unchanged input always hits the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "same cache entry.  Re-running adacovex on unchanged code serves results"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "straight from disk.  There is no re-scan, no re-parse, and (for gnatprove)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "no re-proof.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The store is split per input.  Every analysed unit is cached under its ow"
       & "n"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "key.  A one-line change only invalidates that unit"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s entry and rewrites a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "single tiny blob.  Every other unit is served from cache unchanged.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Storage is a two-level directory tree (<code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;cache&gt;/&lt;aa&gt;/&lt;aabb...&gt;</span></"
       & "code>).  A large"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "project never creates a single directory with millions of entries.  Entries"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are evicted oldest-first once the count exceeds a soft cap.  Disk usage"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stays bounded without external dependencies (pure GNAT runtime only)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-CACHE: Result caching</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>See also:</strong> <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../contrib"
       & "uting/architecture.html#result-caching""><span class=""std std-ref"">Architectu"
       & "re "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " result caching</span></a></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div><p><strong>Note:</strong> All items in this package are public.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div></blockquote>"
