       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""do-178c-dal-levels"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>DO-178C DAL Levels<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#do-178c-dal-levels"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>DO-178C defines five Development Assurance Levels (DAL A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "E) corresponding"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to the severity of failure conditions. adacovex assesses compliance against"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all five levels.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""level-definitions"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Level Definitions<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#level-definitions"" title="""
       & "Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>DAL</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Severity</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Failure Condition</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Example</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>A</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Catastrophic</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Prevents continued safe flight/landing</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Flight controls, engine FADEC</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>B</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Hazardous</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Large reduction in safety margins</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Autopilot, navigation</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>C</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Major</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Significant increase in crew workload</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Flight management system</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>D</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Minor</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Slight increase in crew workload</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Cabin pressure display</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>E</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>No effect</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>No impact on safety</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>In-flight entertainment</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""assessment-criteria"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Assessment Criteria<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#assessment-criteria"" tit"
       & "le=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex evaluates four criteria for each DAL level:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""hlr-traceability"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>1. HLR Traceability<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#hlr-traceability"" title="
       & """Link to this heading"">"
