       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The minimum levels match <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">Min_SPARK_For</span></code> in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/compliance/"
       & "adacovex-compliance-dal.adb</span></code>. Gold is the minimum compliance"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "baseline; Platinum (every functional contract proved) is a best-effort ideal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reported when achieved, not a compliance gate. Justified VCs (GNATprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pragma</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">Annotate</span></code>) count neither as proved nor unprove"
       & "d and never downgrade"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the level.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""dal-c-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>DAL-C (default)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#dal-c-default"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The default assessment level is DAL-C. To assess at a different level:</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-bash notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
