       & "Achieved/Unmet status:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-default notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span"
       & "></span><span class=""n"">Target</span> <span class=""n"">DAL</span><span class="
       & """p"">:</span> <span class=""n"">C</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Status</span><span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""n"">Achiev"
