       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Adacovex.Diff<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-diff"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Differential assessment for "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "compare-base."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It assesses a target project at a base revision.  The base revision is a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "branch, commit, rev, or tag in git, mercurial, subversion, fossil, or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "jj (see Adacovex.VCS).  It also assesses the current working tree.  It"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "then reports a side-by-side delta of docstring coverage, SPARK proof"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "level, test results, HLR traceability, and DO-178C DAL status.  The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "report helps you catch local regressions before you push."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-DIFF: Differential assessment</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>See also:</strong> <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../usage/v"
       & "cs.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">VCS support</span></a></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div><p><strong>Note:</strong> All items in this package are public.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div></blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""types"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Types<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#types"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""type-assessment-result"">"
