       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""conventions"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Conventions<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#conventions"" title=""Link to this"
       & " heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Prefix: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "--</span>&#160; </code> (two dashes + two spaces) for all doc lines. The sin"
       & "gle-space"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--</span> </cod"
       & "e> and tab-separated (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">--&lt;TAB&gt;</span></code>) comment styles are also recognised, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "generated or third-party code using those conventions counts toward coverage"
       & "."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "A bare <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--</span"
       & "></code> or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">---"
       & "</span></code> (divider) line is <strong>not</strong> a docstring.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Summary first, then tag lines, then declaration "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no blank lines.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Descriptions capitalized, end with period.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Two spaces between tag name and description (alignment padding).</p><"
       & "/li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>A plain summary line (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">--</span>&#160; <span class=""pre"">Does</span> <span class=""pre"
       & """>a</span> <span class=""pre"">thing.</span></code>) is sufficient to mark a s"
       & "ubprogram"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "as documented; tags are not required for no-param procedures.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""examples"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Examples<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#examples"" title=""Link to this headi"
       & "ng"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""c1"">-- Returns the sum of two numbers.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- @param A  First operand.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- @param B  Second operand.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- @return  Sum of A and B.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kd"">function</span> <span class=""nf"">Add</span> <span class=""p"""
       & ">(</span><span class=""nv"">A</span><span class=""p"">,</span> <span class=""nv"">"
       & "B</span> <span class=""p"">: </span><span class=""nv"">Integer</span><span class"
       & "=""p"">)</span> <span class=""kr"">return</span> <span class=""kt"">Integer</span>"
       & "<span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;paramet"
       & "er</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">&#64;returns</span></code> aliases and the common single-space style are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "equivalent:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""c1"">-- Increments the counter.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- @parameter Amount  Amount to add (alias of @param).</spa"
       & "n>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- @returns The new value (alias of @return).</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kd"">function</span> <span class=""nf"">Incr</span> <span class=""p"
       & """>(</span><span class=""nv"">Amount</span> <span class=""p"">: </span><span clas"
       & "s=""nv"">Natural</span><span class=""p"">)</span> <span class=""kr"">return</span>"
       & " <span class=""kt"">Natural</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""c1"">-- A clock timestamp with node ID.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- @field Node    Replica identifier.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- @field Time    Logical timestamp value.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kd"">type</span> <span class=""kt"">Clock_Time</span> <span class="
       & """kr"">is</span> <span class=""kr"">record</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""n"">Node</span> <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""n"">Repl"
       & "ica_Id</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""n"">Time</span> <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""kt"">Nat"
       & "ural</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kr"">end record</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""c1"">-- Generic priority queue.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- @formal Element_Type  Queue element type.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- @formal Max_Size      Maximum number of elements.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kd"">package</span> <span class=""nc"">Priority_Queue</span> <span"
       & " class=""kr"">is</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""p"">...</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kr"">end</span> <span class=""nf"">Priority_Queue</span><span clas"
       & "s=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""google-sphinx-styles"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Google / Sphinx styles<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#google-sphinx-styles"""
       & " title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The scanner also recognises the two most common non-Ada docstring convent"
       & "ions,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so the same subprogram can be documented in Ada, Google, or Sphinx style.</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""google-style"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Google style<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#google-style"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Args:</spa"
       & "n></code> or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ar"
       & "gs:</span> <span class=""pre"">...</span></code> header opens a parameter bloc"
       & "k: deeper-indented"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "following comment lines count as parameters. A <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Returns:</span></code> header marks the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "return-value description.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""c1"">-- Do something useful.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">--</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- Args:</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">--   X:  The first argument.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">--</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- Returns:</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">--   The result.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kd"">function</span> <span class=""nf"">Foo</span> <span class=""p"""
       & ">(</span><span class=""nv"">X</span> <span class=""p"">: </span><span class=""nv"""
       & ">Integer</span><span class=""p"">)</span> <span class=""kr"">return</span> <span"
       & " class=""kt"">Integer</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""sphinx-style"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Sphinx style<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#sphinx-style"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">:param</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">Name:</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">:parameter</span> <span class=""pre"">Name:</span></"
       & "code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">:type</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">Name:</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">:return:</span></code>, <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">:returns:</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">:rtype:</sp"
       & "an></code> fields are all recognised.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""c1"">-- Do something else.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">--</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- :param X: The argument.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""c1"">-- :returns: The result.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kd"">function</span> <span class=""nf"">Bar</span> <span class=""p"""
       & ">(</span><span class=""nv"">X</span> <span class=""p"">: </span><span class=""nv"""
       & ">Integer</span><span class=""p"">)</span> <span class=""kr"">return</span> <span"
       & " class=""kt"">Integer</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""coverage"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Coverage<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#coverage"" title=""Link to this headi"
