       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Adacovex.Parsers.Source<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-parsers-sou"
       & "rce"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Ada source-file scanner."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Walks a project directory tree, reads every .ads file, extracts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subprogram declarations, HLR tags, and docstring annotations."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-SCAN: Source scanning</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Supported docstring annotations (placed immediately before a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subprogram declaration, no intervening blank lines):"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "&#64;param Name  Description.       "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Document a formal parameter"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "&#64;return Description.            "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Document a function return value"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "&#64;field Description.             "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Document a record component"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "&#64;formal Name  Description.      "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Document a generic formal</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Standard tag aliases are accepted (<code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;parameter</span></code> == <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;param</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;returns</s"
       & "pan></code> == <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "&#64;return</span></code>), and the summary tags <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;brief</span></code> / <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;summary</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "mark a subprogram as documented.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Conventions (following Ada_CRDT style):"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Prefix:  "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "   (two dashes + two spaces)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Summary: Capitalized sentence ending with a period."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Alignment: Two spaces between tag name and description text."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Placement: Summary lines first, then tag lines, then declaration.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Other standard comment styles are also recognised as docstrings:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "  one-line summary (single space, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">--</span> </code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "  one-line summary (two spaces, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">--</span>&#160; </code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "  one-line summary (tab separator)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "A bare <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--</span"
       & "></code> or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">---"
       & "</span></code> divider is not a docstring.  Docstrings can"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "appear before or after the declaration.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Google style (Doxygen-free Python convention):"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "  Args:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "      X (int):  First operand."
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "  Returns:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "      The sum."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "An "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Args:"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " header opens a parameter block: deeper-indented comment lines"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "inside it count as parameter entries.  "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Returns:"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " marks a documented"
       & ASCII.LF
