       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-prove"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Adacovex.Prove<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-prove"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>GNATprove runner for the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> subcomman"
       & "d."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It resolves a gnatprove executable.  It runs it against a target"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s root .gpr file.  It leaves a fresh obj/gnatprove/gnatprove.out"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for the standard assessment pipeline to parse.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Resolution priority (lightweight: adacovex only requires <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span></code> on PATH):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>#. If the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s alire.toml or alire-dev.toml declares gnatprove as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a dependency, deploy only the gnatprove binary crate.  This crate is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a self-contained bundle with no dependencies.  Deploy it into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "~/.adacovex/toolchain via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">-n</span> <span class=""pre"">get</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">gnatprove=&lt;version&gt;</span></code>, then run"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "it directly.  This avoids the fragile <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">exec</span></code> path."
       & "  That path"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "used to compose the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s entire dev-manifest dependency set"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(covex, gnatdoc_bin, gnatformat_bin, and more).  Flaky third-party"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "downloads in CI cannot fail a proof run.  No dev-manifest swap is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ever needed.  The manifest can declare the version as a rich set"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "expression (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">^15"
       & ".1.0</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">~15.1.0</span></code>, and more).  The leading operator is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stripped to yield the bare version that alr accepts.  A"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest-declared prover is authoritative.  When it cannot be"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "deployed, the run fails instead of falling back.  A different"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove version can change which VCs are discharged.  Results must"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "always come from the pinned prover.  Priorities 2 to 5 apply only to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "projects whose manifest does not declare gnatprove.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>#. A gnatprove version pinned globally.  The pin comes from the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ADACOVEX_GNATPROVE_VERSION environment variable or the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[prove]</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">gnatprove-version</span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">&quot;16.1.0&quot;</span></code> key in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "~/.adacovex/adacovex.toml.  Run_Prove reads it and passes it in as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Pinned_Version.  The exact version is deployed via"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">-n</span> <span class=""pre"">get</span> <span class=""pre"">gnatp"
       & "rove=&lt;version&gt;</span></code> and run directly.  Like the manifest"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pin, it is authoritative.  A failure to deploy is a failure to run."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It is folded into the proof result-cache identity.  A different pinned"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "version can never reuse a stale proof.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>#. A gnatprove already on $PATH.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>#. A cached gnatprove in ~/.adacovex/toolchain/bin (download layout) or a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "previously <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr<"
       & "/span> <span class=""pre"">get</span></code>-deployed gnatprove_*/ crate under"
       & " the same dir.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>#. Last resort: a platform toolchain download.  It uses curl.  It is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "used only when no deployable, on-PATH, or cached gnatprove is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "available.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>So the order is: manifest pin &gt; global pin (config/env) &gt; PATH &gt;"
       & " cache &gt;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "download."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-PROVE: GNATprove subcommand</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>See also:</strong> <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../contrib"
       & "uting/architecture.html#gnatprove-toolchain-resolution-prove-subcommand""><sp"
       & "an class=""std std-ref"">Architecture "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " toolchain resolution</span></a></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div><p><strong>Note:</strong> All items in this package are public.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div></blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""types"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Types<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#types"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""type-prove-options"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>type Prove_Options<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#type-prove-options"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""kd"">type</span> <span class=""kt"">Prove_Options</span> <span"
       & " class=""kr"">is</span> <span class=""kr"">record</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Jobs</span>        <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""kt"""
       & ">Integer</span> <span class=""p"">:=</span> <span class=""o"">-</span><span clas"
       & "s=""mi"">1</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Level</span>       <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""kt"""
       & ">Integer</span> <span class=""p"">:=</span> <span class=""o"">-</span><span clas"
       & "s=""mi"">1</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Timeout</span>     <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""kt"""
       & ">Integer</span> <span class=""p"">:=</span> <span class=""o"">-</span><span clas"
       & "s=""mi"">1</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Steps</span>       <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""kt"""
       & ">Integer</span> <span class=""p"">:=</span> <span class=""o"">-</span><span clas"
       & "s=""mi"">1</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Memlimit</span>    <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""kt"""
       & ">Integer</span> <span class=""p"">:=</span> <span class=""o"">-</span><span clas"
       & "s=""mi"">1</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Force</span>       <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""kt"""
       & ">Boolean</span> <span class=""p"">:=</span> <span class=""kc"">False</span><span"
       & " class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">No_Inlining</span> <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""kt"""
       & ">Boolean</span> <span class=""p"">:=</span> <span class=""kc"">False</span><span"
       & " class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Suppress_Warnings</span> <span class=""p"">:</span> <span clas"
       & "s=""kt"">Boolean</span> <span class=""p"">:=</span> <span class=""kc"">True</span>"
       & "<span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Suppress_Sets</span> <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""n"
       & """>Ada</span><span class=""p"">.</span><span class=""n"">Strings</span><span clas"
       & "s=""p"">.</span><span class=""n"">Unbounded</span><span class=""p"">.</span><span "
       & "class=""n"">Unbounded_String</span> <span class=""p"">:=</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Ada</span><span class=""p"">.</span><span class=""n"">Strings</s"
       & "pan><span class=""p"">.</span><span class=""n"">Unbounded</span><span class=""p"">"
       & ".</span><span class=""n"">Null_Unbounded_String</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Cache</span> <span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""kt"">Boole"
       & "an</span> <span class=""p"">:=</span> <span class=""kc"">True</span><span class="
       & """p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
