       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Adacovex.Renderers.Man<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-renderers-ma"
       & "n"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Man-page renderer and installer."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Generates a roff (man 1) page for adacovex and installs it into the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "local man database.  <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">man</span> <span class=""pre"">adacovex</span></code> then works without"
       & " root.  The page"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "embeds the bundled binary version (in the .TH header and a VERSION"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "section).  <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adac"
       & "ovex</span> <span class=""pre"">man</span> <span class=""pre"">--check</span></c"
       & "ode> can detect that a newer man page is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "available than the one on disk.  A shell prompt hook can also detect"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "this.  The tool targets Linux and WSL.  The default install root is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "$XDG_DATA_HOME/man or ~/.local/share/man.  The database updates with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">mandb</span></c"
       & "ode> when it is present.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div><p><strong>Note:</strong> All items in this package are public.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div></blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""functions"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Functions<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#functions"" title=""Link to this hea"
       & "ding"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
