       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Returns:</strong> Default man root directory path.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""function-installed-version-man-root-standard-string-return-stan"
       & "dard-string"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>function Installed_Version (Man_Root : Standard.String) return Standard."
       & "String<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#function-installed-version-man-root-stand"
