       & "          <section id=""adacovex-renderers-sbom"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Adacovex.Renderers.SBOM<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-renderers-s"
       & "bom"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Proof-aware software bill of materials (SBOM) generator."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Produces CycloneDX 1.5 JSON and SPDX 2.3 JSON documents from the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependency graph resolved by Adacovex.Parsers.Manifest.  Only the root"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "component carries the adacovex properties.  The root component is the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "project adacovex actually assessed.  It carries adacovex:proof_level"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(Stone..Platinum), adacovex:standard ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "DO-178C"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " | "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "ISO 26262"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " |"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "IEC 62304"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & "), adacovex:dal_target (DAL-A through DAL-D), and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex:level (the standard-specific label "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "DAL-C"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " | "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "ASIL B"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " |"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Class A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ").  Dependency components report adacovex:proof_level ="
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Not proved"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ".  adacovex only proves the target itself.  It never proves"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "third-party dependencies.  Every dependency component also carries an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex:dep_scope property ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "base"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " | "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "dev"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " | "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "transitive"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " |"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "vendored"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ").  This property distinguishes publishing (alire.toml),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "development-only (alire-dev.toml), transitive, and patched-vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "packages."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-SBOM: SBOM generation</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>See also:</strong> <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../usage/s"
       & "bom.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">SBOM</span></a></p>"
