       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Multi-threaded HTTP/1.1 server built on GNAT.Sockets."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The server uses a bounded Ada task pool for concurrent request handling."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The server supports keep-alive connections. It serves the web dashboard,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the JSON API, and the SVG badge endpoints."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-SERVER: HTTP server</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>See also:</strong> <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../usage/d"
       & "ashboard.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">Web dashboard</span></a></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div><p><strong>Note:</strong> All items in this package are public.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div></blockquote>"
