       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""spark-assurance-levels"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>SPARK Assurance Levels<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#spark-assurance-level"
       & "s"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>SPARK defines five assurance levels "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Stone, Bronze, Silver, Gold, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Platinum "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " each building on the previous. Higher levels provide stronger"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "guarantees about absence of run-time errors and compliance with functional"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "specifications.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""level-objectives"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Level Objectives<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#level-objectives"" title=""Li"
       & "nk to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""stone"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Stone<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#stone"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>Criterion</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Requirement</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Valid SPARK subset</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>All source code uses SPARK-compatible constructs</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>No restricted constructs</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>No goto, no anonymous access types, no uncontrolled pointers</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Enforcement</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprov"
       & "e</span></code> runs without compilation errors</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""bronze"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Bronze<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#bronze"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>Criterion</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Requirement</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Data-flow analysis</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Every variable is assigned before use, no uninitialized reads</p></td"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>Information-flow analysis</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Depends/Global contracts match actual data dependencies</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Initialization checks</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>All objects initialized before first use</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>Enforcement</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprov"
       & "e</span> <span class=""pre"">--mode=flow</span></code> passes with 0 flow/init"
       & "ialization errors</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""silver"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Silver<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#silver"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>Criterion</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Requirement</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Absence of run-time errors (AoRTE)</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>All run-time checks proved: index bounds, overflow, division-by-zero,"
       & " etc.</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>Assertions proved</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>All user-specified <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">Assert</span></code> and pre/post"
       & "condition checks discharged</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Enforcement</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprov"
       & "e</span> <span class=""pre"">--mode=check</span></code> reports 0 unproved run"
       & "-time checks</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>Justification</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Unproved checks may be justified with <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">Annotate</span"
       & "></code> (limited to false positives)</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""gold"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Gold<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#gold"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>Criterion</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Requirement</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Functional correctness</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Key subprogram contracts proved: Pre/Post, Type_Invariant</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>Core invariants</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Critical type/system properties specified and verified</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Enforcement</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprov"
       & "e</span> <span class=""pre"">--mode=prove</span></code> reports 0 unproved fun"
       & "ctional contracts</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>Coverage</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>At minimum: all public subprograms in core packages have postconditio"
       & "ns</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""platinum"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Platinum<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#platinum"" title=""Link to this headi"
       & "ng"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>Criterion</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Requirement</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Full functional requirements</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Complete formal specification of all subprogram behaviour</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>Total correctness</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>All subprograms have complete Pre/Post contracts covering full behavi"
       & "our</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Domain properties</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Algebraic properties (commutativity, idempotence, convergence) proved"
       & "</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>Enforcement</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprov"
       & "e</span></code> reports all functional contracts proved, 0 unproved</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum is a best-effort ideal, not a DAL compliance gate. Justified VCs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pragma</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">Annotate</span></code> for decidedly unprovable checks) co"
       & "unt neither as proved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "nor as unproved and never downgrade the level; only unproved VCs do. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "minimum DAL gates are Gold (DAL-A), Silver (DAL-B), and Bronze (DAL-C/D).</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""level-attainment-in-practice"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Level attainment in practice<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#level-attainmen"
       & "t-in-practice"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Each level subsumes all lower levels (Platinum implies Gold through Stone"
       & ")."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--dal</span"
       & "></code> analysis checks for a minimum SPARK level. For DAL-C, the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "minimum requirement is Bronze (flow analysis passes).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-bash notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
       & "span><span class=""c1""># Check SPARK level of target project</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex<span class=""w""> </span>--target<span class=""o"">=</span>../Ada_CRDT<"
       & "span class=""w""> </span>--dal<span class=""o"">=</span>C"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""see-also"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>See also<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#see-also"" title=""Link to this headi"
       & "ng"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><a class=""reference internal"" href=""../usage/standards.html""><span cl"
