       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""supported-test-result-formats"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Supported Test Result Formats<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#supported-test"
       & "-result-formats"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex can parse test results in several standard formats. Parsing is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "additive and best-effort: every line is inspected for any recognised format,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so a file mixing styles (or wrapping a third-party runner"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s log) still"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "produces correct pass/fail totals.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Every format contributes to the same three outputs:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>totals</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Total_Passed</"
       & "span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "Total_Failed</span></code>, reported as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tests:</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">N</span> <span class=""pre"">passed,</span> <span class=""pre"""
       & ">M</span> <span class=""pre"">failed</span></code> and consumed by the DAL "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Tests passing"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "criterion;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>per-category metrics</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Categories</sp"
       & "an></code> (name, count, status), consumed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "by the dashboard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s Tests chart and the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">--emit-metrics</span></code> export;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>the summary lines below.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""markdown-table-native-test-runner"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Markdown Table (native test runner)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#markdown"
       & "-table-native-test-runner"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The built-in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">test_runner</span></code> executable produces this format, and any"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Markdown table with the same shape is accepted:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-default notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span"
       & "></span>  <span class=""o"">|</span> <span class=""n"">Category</span>          "
       & "  <span class=""o"">|</span>  <span class=""n"">Tests</span> <span class=""o"">|</"
       & "span> <span class=""n"">Status</span>   <span class=""o"">|</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "  <span class=""o"">|---------------------|--------|----------|</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "  <span class=""o"">|</span> <span class=""n"">Types</span> <span class=""n"">conv"
       & "ersions</span>   <span class=""o"">|</span>  <span class=""mi"">67</span> <span "
       & "class=""o"">|</span> <span class=""n"">PASS</span>     <span class=""o"">|</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "  <span class=""o"">|</span> <span class=""n"">Server</span> <span class=""n"">rou"
       & "ting</span>      <span class=""o"">|</span>  <span class=""mi"">25</span> <span "
       & "class=""o"">|</span> <span class=""n"">PASS</span>     <span class=""o"">|</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "  <span class=""o"">|</span> <span class=""n"">DAL</span> <span class=""n"">compli"
       & "ance</span>      <span class=""o"">|</span>   <span class=""mi"">2</span> <span "
       & "class=""o"">|</span> <span class=""n"">FAIL</span>     <span class=""o"">|</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "  <span class=""o"">|-----------------------------------------|--------|------"
       & "----|</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "  <span class=""n"">Passed</span><span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""mi"">92<"
       & "/span>  <span class=""n"">Failed</span><span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""m"
       & "i"">2</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""format-rules"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Format rules<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#format-rules"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Columns separated by <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">|</span></code>. The header row and <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">|---|</span></code> separator rows are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ignored (they have no numeric count cell).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Two row layouts are accepted</strong> (the count cell is dete"
       & "cted by its"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "digits in either):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>with a leading index cell: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">|</span> <span class=""pre"">-</span> <span class=""pre"">|</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">Category</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">N</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span> <span class=""pre"">PASS</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">|</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(the AUnit-report style),</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>plain: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">|"
       & "</span> <span class=""pre"">Category</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span> <span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">N</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span> <span class=""pre"">PASS</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">|</span></code> (the native <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test_runner</span></code> style).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Category</strong> cell: arbitrary text (leading/trailing spac"
       & "es are trimmed).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Tests</strong> cell: a positive integer, optionally space-pad"
       & "ded to the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "column width (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">|"
       & "</span> <span class=""pre"">67</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span></code>). Head"
       & "er and separator rows have no such cell.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Status</strong> cell: <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">PASS</span></code> (anything else counts as <code clas"
       & "s=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">FAIL</span></code>).</p><"
       & "/li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Each row ADDITIONALLY adds its count to the totals.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>A summary line containing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">Passed:</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">Failed:</span></code> followed by numbers"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>overrides</strong> the totals (the last such line wins). This is the"
       & " footer"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "of the native <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">t"
       & "est_result.md</span></code>, so files with both rows and a footer"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "report the footer"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s totals.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""tap-test-anything-protocol"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>TAP (Test Anything Protocol)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#tap-test-anythi"
       & "ng-protocol"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The protocol used by Perl"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</span><"
       & "/code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Test::Ha"
       & "rness</span></code> toolchain (also emitted"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "by many dynamic-language test frameworks):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-default notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span"
       & "></span><span class=""mf"">1..5</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">ok</span> <span class=""mi"">1</span> <span class=""o"">-</span>"
       & " <span class=""n"">add</span> <span class=""n"">works</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""ow"">not</span> <span class=""n"">ok</span> <span class=""mi"">2</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""o"">-</span> <span class=""n"">remove</span> <span class=""n"">e"
       & "dge</span> <span class=""n"">case</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">ok</span> <span class=""mi"">3</span> <span class=""o"">-</span>"
       & " <span class=""n"">merge</span> <span class=""n"">works</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">ok</span> <span class=""o"">-</span> <span class=""n"">unnamed</"
       & "span> <span class=""k"">pass</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""ow"">not</span> <span class=""n"">ok</span> <span class=""o"">-</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""n"">unnamed</span> <span class=""n"">fail</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ok</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">...</span></code> lines increment the passed counter.</p"
       & "></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">not</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">ok</span> <span class=""pre"">...</span></code> lines inc"
       & "rement the failed counter.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">1..N"
       & "</span></code> plan line and anything else are ignored.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""automake-test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Automake test-suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#automake-test-suite"" tit"
       & "le=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
