       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-timezones"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Adacovex.Timezones<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-timezones"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Timezone resolution and local-time formatting for adacovex.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex respects the operating system"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s timezone by default.  Users can"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "override it for a single invocation with "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "tz / "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "timezone.  Accepted"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "forms are a well-known IANA zone name (for example "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Asia/Singapore"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ") or a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "fixed UTC/GMT offset ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "UTC+8"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "GMT+8"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "UTC+08"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "GMT+08"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "UTC+08:30"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ").</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The crate has no library dependencies, so it ships no timezone database."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "A named zone resolves from a built-in table of common IANA names and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "their standard-time (non-DST) offsets.  A zone that may observe daylight"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "saving time (and any zone the table lacks) is probed against the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "platform tzdata "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">zdump</span></"
       & "code> + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">date</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">+%z</span></code> on Linux/WSL "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " for the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "DST-correct current offset; the table offset is the fallback when the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "probe is unavailable.  The system default offset comes from the standard"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Ada runtime (Ada.Calendar.Time_Zones.UTC_Time_Offset), which honours the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "TZ environment variable and the operating system"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s local timezone, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the default is always the operator"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s wall-clock timezone."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-TZ: Timezone resolution and local-time formatting</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div><p><strong>Note:</strong> All items in this package are public.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div></blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""types"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Types<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#types"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""type-timezone-info"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>type Timezone_Info<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#type-timezone-info"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
