       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-vcs"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Adacovex.VCS<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-vcs"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version-control-system abstraction for differential modes."
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "compare-base and "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "coverage-delta need a snapshot of a base revision"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "without disturbing the working tree.  Legacy codebases can live in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Mercurial, Subversion, Fossil, or jj rather than git.  The snapshot"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "operations are dispatched per VCS here:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>git    - <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">git"
       & "</span> <span class=""pre"">worktree</span> <span class=""pre"">add</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">--detach</span></code> in a linked worktree"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hg     - <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">hg</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">archive</span> <span class=""pre"">-r</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">REF</span> <span class=""pre"">DIR</span></code> (pure export, no worki"
       & "ng-copy change)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "svn    - <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">svn</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">info</span> <span class=""pre"">--show-item</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">url</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">svn</span> <span class=""pre"">export</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">-r</span> <span class=""pre"">REF</span> <span class=""pre"">URL</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">DIR</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "fossil - copy the repo DB and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">fossil</span> <span class=""pre"">open</span></code> it at REF "
       & "in a scratch dir"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "jj     - <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">jj</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">git</span> <span class=""pre"">export</span></code> into"
       & " the internal git store, then a git"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "worktree add against .jj/repo/store/git (jj commits ARE git"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "commits, and any change or commit id resolves)</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Detection is marker-file based (.git / .jj / .hg / .svn / .fslckout /</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>FOSSIL*), with a command probe fallback when no marker is present."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Runs only on Linux/WSL (uses sh -c for CWD-dependent tools such as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "fossil)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-DIFF: VCS abstraction for differential assessment</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>See also:</strong> <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../usage/v"
       & "cs.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">VCS support</span></a></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div><p><strong>Note:</strong> All items in this package are public.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div></blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""types"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Types<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#types"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""type-vcs-kind"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>type VCS_Kind<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#type-vcs-kind"" title=""Link to "
