       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""how-to-read-this-reference"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>How to read this reference<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#how-to-read-this-"
       & "reference"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This reference documents the Ada packages that implement adacovex."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It is generated from the source docstrings by <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">doc</span></cod"
       & "e>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>End users</strong> need the CLI reference, the dashboard guid"
       & "e, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the standards pages.  The <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../usage/cli-r"
       & "eference.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">CLI reference</span></a>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "describes every flag.  The <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../usage/stan"
       & "dards.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">standards guide</span></a>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "explains the compliance levels.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Contributors</strong> use this reference together with the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/bladeacer/adacovex/bl"
       & "ob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"">contributing guide</a>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../contributing/architecture.htm"
       & "l""><span class=""std std-doc"">architecture notes</span></a>.  The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference internal"" href=""adacovex-docstring-spec.html""><span clas"
       & "s=""std std-doc"">docstring spec</span></a> defines the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "annotation format.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Maintainers</strong> read the <a class=""reference internal"" h"
       & "ref=""../proof/index.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">proof ledger</span></a> "
       & "for the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "verified-VC history and the <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../changelog"
       & "s/index.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">changelogs</span></a>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for the release history.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Technical terms follow the controlled dictionary in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference internal"" href=""../contributing/ste100-technical-names.h"
       & "tml""><span class=""std std-doc"">STE100 Technical Names</span></a>.  All"
       & ASCII.LF
