       & "        <article role=""main"" id=""furo-main-content"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-0-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.0.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-0-0"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-07-29</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 0.1.0 -&gt; 1.0.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-strict-mode-default-relaxed-flag"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Strict mode (default) + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">--relaxed</span></code> flag<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c1"
       & "-strict-mode-default-relaxed-flag"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Strict mode is now the default: the scanner covers ALL directories (excep"
       & "t the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "always-excluded <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">.git</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">obj</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">tests</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">config</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">.adacovex</span></code>) and applies"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacovex/patch"
       & "es/</span></code> docstring overlays, ensuring full compliance coverage"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "including vendored code. The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">--relaxed</span></code> flag disables strict mode: it enables"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the directory skip list (default: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">demo,deps,examples</span></code>) and disables patch file"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "application. Use case: strict for compliance audits, relaxed for quick dev-c"
       & "ycle"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "checks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This reverses the 0.1.0 relaxed-by-default behaviour. Existing commands t"
       & "hat"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "relied on <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">demo<"
       & "/span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">d"
       & "eps</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">examples</span></code> being skipped must add <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--relaxed</span></code> (or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--skip-dir=NAME"
       & "</span></code> explicitly) to keep the old behaviour.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-skip-dir-flag"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--skip-"
       & "dir</span></code> flag<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-skip-dir-flag"" title="""
       & "Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--skip-d"
       & "ir=NAME</span></code> (repeatable) adds directory names to the scanner"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s skip"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "list, complementing the default skip list (<code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">demo,deps,examples</span></code>) for projects"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with additional third-party code. Only effective in <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--relaxed</span></code> mode.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-adacovex-patches-mechanism"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacov"
       & "ex/patches/</span></code> mechanism<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-adacovex-"
       & "patches-mechanism"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Patch files at <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">&lt;target&gt;/.adacovex/patches/&lt;relative-path&gt;</span></code> allo"
       & "w documenting"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vendored/third-party <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">.ads</span></code> files without modifying the originals. Patch files"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are valid Ada specs with docstrings, merged by subprogram name; each overloa"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "requires one patch entry, and the patch engine assigns entries to the next"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "undocumented original. The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">.adacovex</span></code> directory is always excluded from source"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scanning.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-plain-docstring-summary-detection"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Plain docstring summary detection<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-pla"
       & "in-docstring-summary-detection"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Previously only <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">&#64;param</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">&#64;return</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;field</span></code> tags counted as docstrings"
       & ". Now any"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--</span>&#160;"
       & " </code> (two dashes + two spaces) comment line before a subprogram declarat"
       & "ion"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is recognised as a docstring, even without a tag, so no-param procedures wit"
       & "h"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "only a summary line are correctly counted.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Known scanner quirks at this release: <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">(null</span> <span class=""pre"">record)</span></cod"
       & "e> typed parameters are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "still counted as parameters (benign "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " they are parameters, just"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "parameterless), and docstring detection requires the strict <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--</span>&#160; </code> prefix "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--</span> </cod"
       & "e> (one space) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">---</span></code> (three dashes) do not count.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-verbose-output"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--verbo"
       & "se</span></code> output<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c5-verbose-output"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--verbos"
       & "e</span></code> flag now produces pipeline diagnostic output to stderr: step"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "labels, package counts, SPARK level, test file path, and output paths"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(previously a no-op placeholder).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-make-bump-version-target"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">bump-version</span></code> target<a class=""headerlink"
       & """ href=""#c6-make-bump-version-target"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">bump-version</span> <span class=""pre"">VERSION=x.y.z</span>"
       & "</code> bumps the version across <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">alire.toml</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire-dev.toml<"
       & "/span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "src/adacovex.ads</span></code>, and creates/updates the changelog,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "modelled after the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Ada_CRDT</span></code> project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s bump workflow.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-make-run-ada-crdt-strict-mode"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">run-ada-crdt</span></code> strict mode<a class=""heade"
       & "rlink"" href=""#c7-make-run-ada-crdt-strict-mode"" title=""Link to this heading"""
       & ">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">run-ada-crdt</span></code> now runs in strict mode (no <co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--relaxed</span></"
       & "code>) and achieves 100%"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docstring coverage on Ada_CRDT including the vendored vt100 code via"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacovex/patch"
       & "es/demo/deps/vt100/vt100.ads</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-patch-overload-handling"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Patch overload handling<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c8-patch-overloa"
       & "d-handling"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Apply_Patche"
       & "s</span></code> now skips already-documented originals when searching for na"
       & "me"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "matches, so overloaded subprograms get correctly assigned to the next"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "undocumented overload instead of re-patching the first one.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c9-always-excluded-directories"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C9: Always-excluded directories<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c9-always-ex"
       & "cluded-directories"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">config</span"
       & "></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.a"
       & "dacovex</span></code> added to the hardcoded always-excluded directories"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(alongside <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.git"
       & "</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">obj</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">tests</span></code>): <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">config/</span></code> contains generated Alire"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "configuration, not production source, and <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacovex/</span></code> contains patch metadata"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "relevant only to the patch engine.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c10-production-scalability-unbounded"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C10: Production scalability (unbounded)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c10-"
       & "production-scalability-unbounded"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Packages and subprograms now use <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">Ada.</span> <span class=""pre"">Containers.</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">Vectors</span></code> (heap-allocated, up to <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Natural'Last</span></code> ~ 2.1B)"
       & "; the compile-time <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Max_Packages</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">Max_Subprogs</span></code> bounds are eliminated entirely,"
       & " so projects of any size are supported without recompilation. VC counts use "
       & "unbounded <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Natur"
       & "al</span></code> fields (the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">Max_VC_Count</span></code> dead type removed).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The line buffer was raised 2048 -&gt; 8192 characters with automatic trun"
       & "cation draining (silently skips remaining chars on lines &gt; 8192), the pat"
       & "h buffer 512 -&gt; 4096 (matches <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">PATH_MAX</span></code>), and the filename buffer 64 -&gt; "
       & "128 (matches Ada"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s max identifier length). A line-truncation guard detects when the buffer wa"
       & "s filled (partial read) and drains the remainder of the line, preventing str"
       & "eam desynchronisation that previously caused false subprogram declarations. "
       & "Dead code removed: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Max_Params</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">Max_VC_Count</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Badge_Path</span></code>, <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Metrics</span></code>, <code "
       & "class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Skip_Dirs</span><"
       & "/code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">VC_Info"
       & "</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">VC_Vector</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Param_Count</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c11-dal-validation"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C11: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--dal<"
       & "/span></code> validation<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c11-dal-validation"" tit"
       & "le=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--dal=Z</spa"
       & "n></code> (or any value outside A-E) now prints an error and exits with code"
       & " 1"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instead of silently defaulting to DAL-C. Related CLI caveat: a relative"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--target=PATH</"
       & "span></code> is resolved against the CWD, so behaviour depends on the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "invocation directory.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c12-post-release-alire-crate-renamed-to-covex"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C12: Post-release: Alire crate renamed to <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span></code><a class=""headerlink"" href"
       & "=""#c12-post-release-alire-crate-renamed-to-covex"" title=""Link to this headin"
       & "g"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Alire crate was renamed from <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span></code> to <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span></code> to comply with Alire"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "naming rules. The binary name stays <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">adacovex_main</span></code> via"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">project-files</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">[&quot;adacovex.gpr&quot;"
       & "]</span></code> in all manifest files."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire/releases/"
       & "covex-*.toml</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">index/ad/covex/*.toml</span></code> were created and"
