       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c13-post-release-spark-proof-restored-to-platinum-28-vcs"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C13: Post-release: SPARK proof restored to Platinum (28 VCs)<a class=""he"
       & "aderlink"" href=""#c13-post-release-spark-proof-restored-to-platinum-28-vcs"" t"
       & "itle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Restored <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pra"
       & "gma</span> <span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">(On)</span>"
       & "</code> at package level in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">adacovex-types.ads</span></code>;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vector instantiations and vector-containing types (<code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Package_Info</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Test_Summary</s"
       & "pan></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">DA"
       & "L_Assessment</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">Badge_Config</span></code>) moved into a nested"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Implementation<"
       & "/span></code> package with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">(Off)</span></code>. SPARK-clean types"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Level</s"
       & "pan></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Pr"
       & "oof_Summary</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">Docstring_Metrics</span></code>, conversion functions)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "remain in the outer <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">On</span></code> region, restoring 28 VCs. <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">(On)</s"
       & "pan></code> was"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "removed from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ad"
       & "acovex-parsers-tests.ads</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-renderers-svg.ads</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(reference vector-containing types), and <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove/gnatprove.out</span></code> was added"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to the search paths in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">Parse_Prove_From_Project</span></code> so <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">run-self</s"
       & "pan></code> finds the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof output.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-post-release-make-fmt-non-determinism"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: Post-release: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">fmt</span></code> non-determinism<a cla"
       & "ss=""headerlink"" href=""#h1-post-release-make-fmt-non-determinism"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Replaced the non-ASCII almost-equal sign (U+2248) with ASCII <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">~</span></code> in an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-types."
       & "ads</span></code> source comment. gnatformat was re-encoding the UTF-8"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "character on each run, creating an oscillating diff that never converged; th"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "format is now idempotent across repeated runs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h2-post-release-make-doc-non-determinism"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H2: Post-release: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">doc</span></code> non-determinism<a cla"
       & "ss=""headerlink"" href=""#h2-post-release-make-doc-non-determinism"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Propagated the ASCII-only fix to the generated API docs; <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">d"
       & "oc</span></code> now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "produces identical output on repeated runs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h3-post-release-compliance-dal-adb-desc-field-overflow"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H3: Post-release: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">compliance-dal.adb</span></code> <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">Desc_Field</span></code> overflow<a class=""headerli"
       & "nk"" href=""#h3-post-release-compliance-dal-adb-desc-field-overflow"" title=""Li"
       & "nk to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Append</span"
       & "></code> to the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">Failed_Reasons</span></code> vector now properly constructs a 128-char"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Desc_Field</spa"
       & "n></code> before pushing, fixing a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">Constraint_Error</span></code> on long messages.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h4-post-release-guarded-port-positive-value-crash"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H4: Post-release: guarded <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">--port</span></code> <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">Positive'Value</span></code> crash<a class=""headerlink"""
       & " href=""#h4-post-release-guarded-port-positive-value-crash"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--port</span"
       & "></code> argument parsing in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">adacovex-config.adb</span></code> now wraps <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Positive'Value</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "in an exception handler. Non-integer or zero/negative port values produce a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "clear error message instead of crashing with <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">Constraint_Error</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h5-post-release-file-descriptor-leak-protection-in-parser-read-"
       & "loops"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H5: Post-release: file-descriptor leak protection in parser read loops<a"
       & " class=""headerlink"" href=""#h5-post-release-file-descriptor-leak-protection-i"
       & "n-parser-read-loops"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>All five <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">whi"
       & "le</span> <span class=""pre"">not</span> <span class=""pre"">End_Of_File</span><"
       & "/code> read loops across the four parser units"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-parse"
       & "rs-gnatprove.adb</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">adacovex-parsers-tests.adb</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-parser"
       & "s-do178c.adb</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">adacovex-parsers-source.adb</span></code>) are wrapped in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "an inner <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">except"
       & "ion</span> <span class=""pre"">when</span> <span class=""pre"">others</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">Close(F);</span> <span class="""
       & "pre"">raise;</span></code> block: if <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">Get_Line</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "raises mid-file, the file handle is closed and the exception propagates,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "preventing FD leaks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h6-post-release-server-graceful-shutdown-and-backoff"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H6: Post-release: server graceful shutdown and backoff<a class=""headerli"
       & "nk"" href=""#h6-post-release-server-graceful-shutdown-and-backoff"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Worker tasks now check <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Svr_State.</span> <span class=""pre"">Running</span></code> at the "
       & "top of the loop and exit when <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">False</span></code>. On <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">Socket_Error</span></code>, workers increment a back"
       & "off counter and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">delay</span> <span class=""pre"">0.1</span></code>; after 100 consecutive err"
       & "ors they set <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ru"
       & "nning</span> <span class=""pre"">:=</span> <span class=""pre"">False</span></cod"
       & "e> and exit, fixing the busy-loop. The main server loop changed from <code c"
       & "lass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">delay</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">3600.0</span></code> to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">delay</span> <span class=""pre"">1.0</span></code> with `exi"
       & "t when not Svr_State.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Running<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">,</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">enabling</span> <span class=""pre"">timely</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">shutdown,</span> <span class=""pre"">and</span> </code>Running<cod"
       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">is</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">set</span></code>False<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">on</span> <span class=""pre"">any</span> <span class=""pre"">exc"
       & "eption</span> <span class=""pre"">in</span></code>Start<code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">,</span> <span class=""pre"">ensuring</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">socket</span> <span class=""pre"">cleanup</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">via</span> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">existi"
       & "ng</span> </code>Close_Socket (Listener)` handler.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h7-post-release-iterative-directory-traversal-no-recursion"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H7: Post-release: iterative directory traversal (no recursion)<a class="""
       & "headerlink"" href=""#h7-post-release-iterative-directory-traversal-no-recursio"
       & "n"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Search_Dir</"
       & "span></code> in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">adacovex-parsers-source.adb</span></code> was converted from recursive to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "iterative using an explicit <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">Dir_Stacks</span></code> vector, eliminating stack overflow"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "risk at deep directory nestings (&gt; ~1000 levels).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h8-post-release-dynamic-html-buffer-no-32kb-cap"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H8: Post-release: dynamic HTML buffer (no 32KB cap)<a class=""headerlink"""
       & " href=""#h8-post-release-dynamic-html-buffer-no-32kb-cap"" title=""Link to this"
       & " heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Render_Dashb"
       & "oard</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">Render_Metrics_JSON</span></code> in <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-renderers-html.adb</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "replaced their fixed 32768-byte and 4096-byte stack buffers with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.Strings.Unb"
       & "ounded.Unbounded_String</span></code>, so dashboard output for large"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "projects is no longer silently truncated.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
