       & "        <article role=""main"" id=""furo-main-content"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-1-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.1.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-1-0"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-07-30</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.0.0 -&gt; 1.1.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-generic-keyword-bounds-not-matching-single-line-declarations"
       & """>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: Generic keyword bounds not matching single-line declarations<a class"
       & "=""headerlink"" href=""#h1-generic-keyword-bounds-not-matching-single-line-decl"
       & "arations"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Is_Subprogra"
       & "m_Decl</span></code> in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">adacovex-parsers-source.adb</span></code> had off-by-one bounds:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&quot;genericpr"
       & "ocedure&quot;</span></code> (16 chars) was compared against a 15-char slice,"
       & " and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&quot;genericfu"
       & "nction&quot;</span></code> (15 chars) against a 14-char slice. Since Ada str"
       & "ing"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "equality requires matching lengths, both branches never fired, meaning"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">generic</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">procedure</span> <span class=""pre"">Reset;</span></code> on"
       & " a single line was invisible to the scanner.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Impact:</strong> Single-line generic subprograms were silently ex"
       & "cluded from"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "coverage tracking, docstring requirements, and subprogram counts.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Fix:</strong> Bounds corrected to <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">&gt;=</span> <span class=""pre"">16</span></code"
       & "> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&gt;=</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">15</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h2-determine-spark-level-returning-gold-for-missing-proof-data"""
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H2: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Determi"
       & "ne_SPARK_Level</span></code> returning Gold for missing proof data<a class="""
       & "headerlink"" href=""#h2-determine-spark-level-returning-gold-for-missing-proof"
       & "-data"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>When no GNATprove output exists (all fields zero), <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">0</span> <span class=""pre"">&gt;=</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">0</span></code> returned Gold"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instead of Stone, causing DAL-C assessment to pass incorrectly for projects"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with no proof data at all.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Impact:</strong> False-positive compliance pass for unproven proj"
       & "ects.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Fix:</strong> <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">Parse_Prove_Out</span></code> now sets <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Success</span> <span class=""pre"">:=</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">Summary.Total_VCs</span> <span class=""pre"">&gt;</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">0</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "matching the existing guard in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">Parse_Prove_JSON</span></code>. <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Determine_SPARK_Level</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "remains a pure function.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h3-i2s-dropping-most-significant-digit-for-10-digit-numbers"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H3: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">I2S</sp"
       & "an></code> dropping most significant digit for 10-digit numbers<a class=""hea"
       & "derlink"" href=""#h3-i2s-dropping-most-significant-digit-for-10-digit-numbers"""
       & " title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">while</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">R</span> <span class=""pre"">&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "0</span> <span class=""pre"">and</span> <span class=""pre"">Pos</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">1</span></code> in <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-renderers-svg.adb</span>"
       & "</code> exited when"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Pos</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">1</span></code> even if <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">R</span></code> still held"
       & " a digit. Numbers &gt;= 1,000,000,000 (the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "upper half of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">N"
       & "atural</span></code>"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s domain) would lose their leading digit.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Impact:</strong> Incorrect SVG badge width or test-count output f"
       & "or very large"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "values (practically unlikely but technically incorrect).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Fix:</strong> Removed <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">and</span> <span class=""pre"">Pos</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">1</span></code> condition; loop now exits when"
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">R</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">0</span></code>."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Return slice adjusted from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">Buf</span> <span class=""pre"">(Pos</span> <span class=""pre"">+</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">1</span> <span class=""pre"">..</span> <span class=""pre"""
       & ">10)</span></code> to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">Buf</span> <span class=""pre"">(Pos</span> <span class=""pre"">..</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">10)</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h4-unsynchronized-running-flag-across-server-tasks"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H4: Unsynchronized <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">Running</span></code> flag across server tasks<a class=""headerlink"" "
       & "href=""#h4-unsynchronized-running-flag-across-server-tasks"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Running<"
       & "/span></code> field in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">Server_State</span></code> was read/written by 5 tasks (1 main</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>4 workers) without synchronization. On weakly-ordered architectures,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "writes may never become visible to other tasks.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Impact:</strong> If a worker hit 100 consecutive socket errors an"
       & "d set"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Running</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">:=</span> <span class=""pre"">False</span></code>, other wor"
       & "kers and the main loop could hang indefinitely.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Fix:</strong> Extracted <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">Running</span></code> from the <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Server_State</span></code> record to a l"
       & "ocal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Boolean</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">with</span> <span class=""pre"">Atomic</span></code> variabl"
       & "e in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Start</spa"
       & "n></code>, ensuring proper visibility"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "across tasks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h5-read-request-line-buffer-overread-on-long-request-lines"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H5: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Read_Re"
       & "quest_Line</span></code> buffer overread on long request lines<a class=""head"
       & "erlink"" href=""#h5-read-request-line-buffer-overread-on-long-request-lines"" t"
       & "itle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>When 4096 bytes filled the buffer without a CRLF terminator, the last"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "two received bytes were silently discarded. The returned string could"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "contain trailing undefined buffer content.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Impact:</strong> Malformed path extraction for request URIs &gt;="
       & " 4094 bytes.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Fix:</strong> Added <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">or</span> <span class=""pre"">else</span> <span class=""pre"">La"
       & "st</span> <span class=""pre"">&gt;=</span> <span class=""pre"">Buffer'Length</sp"
       & "an></code> guard, returning <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">&quot;&quot;</span></code> on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "buffer-full without CRLF to signal a malformed request.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h6-start-search-end-search-unprotected-against-exceptions"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H6: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Start_S"
       & "earch</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">End_Search</span></code> unprotected against exceptions<a class=""head"
       & "erlink"" href=""#h6-start-search-end-search-unprotected-against-exceptions"" ti"
       & "tle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.Director"
       & "ies.Search_Type</span></code> handles could leak if <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Get_Next_Entry</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "raised (e.g., on corrupted directory entries).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Impact:</strong> OS resource leak (directory handle) during sourc"
       & "e traversal.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Fix:</strong> Wrapped <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">Start_Search</span></code> .. <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">End_Search</span></code> in a <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">begin</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">exception</span> <span class=""pre"">when</span> <span class=""pre"">others</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">End_Search</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">(Search);</span> <span class=""pre"">raise;</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">end;</span></code> block.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h7-natural-image-leading-spaces-in-user-facing-output"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H7: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Natural"
       & "'Image</span></code> leading spaces in user-facing output<a class=""headerlin"
       & "k"" href=""#h7-natural-image-leading-spaces-in-user-facing-output"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Natural'Imag"
       & "e</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">Integer'Image</span></code> in Ada prepend a space for non-negative"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "values, producing ugly output like <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">&quot;</span>&#160; <span class=""pre"">found</span>&#160;"
       & " <span class=""pre"">19</span> <span class=""pre"">packages&quot;</span></code> "
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;td&gt;<"
       & "/span> <span class=""pre"">19&lt;/td&gt;</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Impact:</strong> Cosmetic "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " extra whitespace in terminal reports and HTML dashboard.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Fix:</strong> Added local <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">Img(Natural)</span></code> helper that strips the lead"
       & "ing space."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Applied to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adac"
       & "ovex_main.adb</span></code> (terminal output) and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-render"
       & "ers-html.adb</span></code> (dashboard HTML).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h8-hlr-false-match-inside-larger-words"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H8: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">HLR-</s"
       & "pan></code> false match inside larger words<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#h8-h"
       & "lr-false-match-inside-larger-words"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Has_HLR_Tag<"
       & "/span></code> matched "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "HLR-"
       & Character'Val(226)
