       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The scanner"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Is_Subprogram"
       & "_Decl</span></code> now understands <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">overriding</span></code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">not</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">overriding</span></code> subprogram declarations in addition t"
       & "o plain, generic, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "function forms, and tab-indented declarations are handled.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-root-contributing-md"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Root CONTRIBUTING.md<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-root-contributin"
       & "g-md"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The contribution guide moved to a root-level <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">CONTRIBUTING.md</span></code> so GitHub"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "renders its contributing link; the changelog format and unit-test catalogue "
       & "live"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "there.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-adacovex-status-subcommand"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacove"
       & "x</span> <span class=""pre"">status</span></code> subcommand<a class=""headerli"
       & "nk"" href=""#c5-adacovex-status-subcommand"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A new <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacov"
       & "ex</span> <span class=""pre"">status</span></code> subcommand reports the tool"
       & "chain + platform state"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "without running an assessment and without downloading or deploying anything:"
