       & "the CI binary is Linux x86-64 only.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-platform-support-documentation"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: Platform-support documentation<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c6-platfo"
       & "rm-support-documentation"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A new <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/p"
       & "latforms.md</span></code> page documents the supported platforms (Linux as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "primary, macOS/FreeBSD/Windows from source), the CPU core-count detection"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "order (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/proc/cp"
       & "uinfo</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
