       & ASCII.LF
       & "CI detection, prove parallelism resolution, and the Linux-only release binar"
       & "y.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-dedicated-per-standard-level-flags-and-standard-all"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: Dedicated per-standard level flags and <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard=all</span></code><a class=""header"
       & "link"" href=""#c7-dedicated-per-standard-level-flags-and-standard-all"" title="""
       & "Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The shared <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">-"
       & "-dal=LEVEL</span></code> tier is complemented by dedicated level flags that"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "spell each standard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s integrity level in its own naming: <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">--asil=LEVEL</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">A|B|C|D|QM</sp"
       & "an></code>, ISO 26262) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">--class=LEVEL</span></code> (<code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">A|B|C</span></code>, IEC 62304). Each sets"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "both the compliance standard and the shared tier, so <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--asil=B</span></code> is the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unambiguous spelling of "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "assess at ASIL B"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " (tier C) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">-"
       & "-class=A</span></code> of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "assess at safety Class A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ". <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard=al"
       & "l</span></code> runs one assessment at the shared"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tier and emits badges for every standard (<code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">do178c.svg</span></code>, <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">iso26262.svg</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">iec62304.svg</s"
       & "pan></code>) plus a per-standard breakdown in the ANSI report, HTML"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard, JSON API, and Markdown report, without re-scanning or re-proving."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The CLI parser"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s argument loop was extracted into a testable <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Parse_Args</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "entry point (a plain argument vector, no <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.Command_Line</span></code> access) so the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "last-write-wins precedence across <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">--dal</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">--asil</span></code> / <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--class</span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard</spa"
       & "n></code> is covered by unit tests.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-standard-aware-sbom-and-renderers"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Standard-aware SBOM and renderers<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c8-sta"
       & "ndard-aware-sbom-and-renderers"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The proof-aware SBOM now records the assessment standard and its native l"
       & "evel"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "label alongside the shared tier: the root component carries"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex:standa"
       & "rd</span></code> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">DO-178C</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">ISO</span> <span class=""pre"">26262</span></code> / <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">IEC</span> <span class=""pre"""
       & ">62304</span></code>) and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex:level<"
