       & "DAL-C</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">ASIL</span> <span class=""pre"">B</span></code> / <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Class</span> <span class=""pre"">A</sp"
