       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c10-sbom-emits-every-standard-under-standard-all"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C10: SBOM emits every standard under <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard=all</span></code><a class=""headerlink"" "
       & "href=""#c10-sbom-emits-every-standard-under-standard-all"" title=""Link to this"
       & " heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The proof-aware SBOM is now fully standard-aware end to end. A single"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "standard writes <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">adacovex:standard</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">adacovex:level</span></code> for just that standard"
