       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Class</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">A</span></code>). Under <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">--standard=all</span></code> the same two propertie"
       & "s carry the joined"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "values for every standard "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex:stand"
       & "ard</span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">DO-178C,</span> <spa"
