       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Standard_Le"
       & "vel_Name</span></code> now posts its tight 1..8 length bound.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c11-ci-feature-parity-with-the-multi-standard-set"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C11: CI feature parity with the multi-standard set<a class=""headerlink"" "
       & "href=""#c11-ci-feature-parity-with-the-multi-standard-set"" title=""Link to thi"
       & "s heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The composite action gained <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">standard</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">asil</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">class</span></code> inputs (threaded"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "through to the assessment as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">--standard</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">--asil</span></code> / <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--class</span></code>, with"
