       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">QM</span></code>, or <code c"
       & "lass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Class</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">X</span></code>) instead of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "only <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">DAL-X</spa"
       & "n></code>. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ci.y"
       & "ml</span></code> now runs three jobs: an <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard=all</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "self-assessment, the native test suite and a push-only <code class=""docutils"
