       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-scanner-false-positives-on-identifier-prefixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: Scanner false positives on identifier prefixes<a class=""headerlink"" "
       & "href=""#h1-scanner-false-positives-on-identifier-prefixes"" title=""Link to thi"
       & "s heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Is_Subprogra"
       & "m_Decl</span></code> matched <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">procedure</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">function</span></code> as a bare prefix, so a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "line such as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">fu"
       & "nctionality</span> <span class=""pre"">:</span> <span class=""pre"">Integer</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">:=</span> <span class=""pre"">0;</span></code> was counte"
       & "d as a subprogram"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "declaration. Keyword matching now requires a word boundary, so identifiers"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that merely begin with a keyword no longer inflate subprogram and docstring"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "counts.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h2-subprogram-names-merged-with-return"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H2: Subprogram names merged with <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">return</span></code><a class=""headerlink"" href=""#h2-su"
       & "bprogram-names-merged-with-return"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The name extractor stripped all blanks, so a parameterless function like"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">function</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">Value</span> <span class=""pre"">return</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">Integer;</span></code> recorded the name <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Valuereturn</span></code>. Name"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "extraction now works on the raw line and stops at the keyword boundary,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "producing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Value"
       & "</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
