       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>501 tests (was 395). The types category gained 23 checks for the dedicate"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "level parsers (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
