       & "standard-parameterized <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">Render_Compliance_Badge</span></code>; the SBOM category gained 29"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "checks (18 for the single-standard standard/level properties plus 11 for the"
