       & "(17 checks) covers standard-aware dashboard, JSON, and Markdown output."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Total categories: 10 (was 9).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""proof-results"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Proof Results<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#proof-results"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 401/401 VCs proved across 44 analysed units (was 343 at 1.9.0)."
