       & "o-the-installation-method"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">--version</span></code> prints the bundled version (<c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">vX.</span> <span class=""pre"">Y.</span> <span class=""pre"">Z<"
       & "/span></code>) and exits. The version"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s source depends on how the binary was installed: a new <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-version.py</span></code> "
       & "(pure stdlib, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">a"
       & "rgparse</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">pathlib</span></code>, typed) resolves it from the first available of"
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ADACOVEX_VERSI"
       & "ON</span></code> (release builds "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the release workflow and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">release</span> <span class=""pre"">VE"
       & "RSION=x.y.z</span></code> set it from the `vX.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Y. Z<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tag,</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">and</span> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">action's</span> <span class=""pre"">build</span> <span class=""pre"">step</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">regenerates</span> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">version</span> <span class=""pre"">file</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "from</span> <span class=""pre"">it,</span> <span class=""pre"">so</span> <span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">shipped</span> <span class=""pre"">bin"
       & "ary</span> <span class=""pre"">always</span> <span class=""pre"">reports</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">exactly</span> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">tag</span> <span class=""pre"">it</span> <span class=""pre"">was</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">built</span> <span class=""pre"">from),</span></code>alire/alire"
       & "-dev.toml<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">(sourc"
       & "e</span> <span class=""pre"">checkouts),</span> <span class=""pre"">or</span></c"
