       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-man-subcommand-with-a-versioned-man-page"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">man</sp"
       & "an></code> subcommand with a versioned man page<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#"
       & "c2-man-subcommand-with-a-versioned-man-page"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">man</span></code> installs the man page into the <stro"
       & "ng>local man database</strong> (Linux/WSL, no root): the default root is <co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">$XDG_DATA_HOME/man"
       & "</span></code> or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">~/.local/share/man</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">--dir=PATH</span></code> overrides it, and the index i"
       & "s refreshed with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>mandb</span></code> when present. The page is generated by a new <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.</span> <span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Renderers.</span> <span class=""pre"">Man</span></code> package and"
       & " embeds the binary version (in the `.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>TH<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">header</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">and</span> <span class=""pre"">a</span></code>VERSION<co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">section).</span></"
       & "code>adacovex man "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
