       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-multi-vcs-differential-modes-mercurial-subversion-fossil-jj"""
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Multi-VCS differential modes (Mercurial, Subversion, Fossil, jj)<a c"
       & "lass=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-multi-vcs-differential-modes-mercurial-subversio"
       & "n-fossil-jj"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--compare-ba"
       & "se</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">--coverage-delta</span></code> no longer require git. A new <code clas"
       & "s=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">VCS</span></code> package detects the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s VCS by marker file (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">.git</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">.jj</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">.hg</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">.svn</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">.fslckout</span></code> / <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">_FOSSIL_</span></code>, with a comma"
       & "nd-tool probe fallback) and snapshots a base revision without touching the w"
       & "orking tree: git <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>worktree</span> <span class=""pre"">add</span> <span class=""pre"">--detach</s"
       & "pan></code>, hg <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">archive</span> <span class=""pre"">-r</span></code>, svn <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">info</span> <span class=""pre"">--sho"
       & "w-item</span> <span class=""pre"">url</span></code> + <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">export</span> <span class=""pre"">-r</spa"
       & "n></code>, fossil <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">open</span></code> on a copied repo DB, and jj via <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">jj</span> <span class=""pre"">git</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">export</span></code> into its internal git store followe"
       & "d by a git worktree against <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">.jj/repo/store/git</span></code> (jj commits are git commits). "
       & "All snapshot commands run through <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">sh</span> <span class=""pre"">-c</span></code>, so the feat"
       & "ure works on Linux and WSL.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>For VCS whose snapshot UX is poor "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Subversion (no local history, network-dependent checkouts) and Fossil (nich"
       & "e tooling) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " adacovex prints a note recommending the developers convert the repository t"
       & "o git (or a git-compatible VCS); git and jj (colocated jj+git resolves as gi"
       & "t) give the best experience.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-adacovex-status-reports-vcs-availability"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacove"
       & "x</span> <span class=""pre"">status</span></code> reports VCS availability<a c"
       & "lass=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-adacovex-status-reports-vcs-availability"" title="
       & """Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">status</span></code> now has a <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vcs:</span></code> section listing whi"
       & "ch VCS command-line"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tools are available on PATH for the differential modes "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " git, mercurial"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">hg</span></cod"
       & "e>), subversion (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>svn</span></code>), fossil, jj, and the man-page tool (<code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">mandb</span></code>) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plus the VCS detected for the target repository. When the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s VCS tool is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "missing from PATH, status prints a note that <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">--compare-base</span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--coverage-delt"
       & "a</span></code> will need it. The exit code remains prove-toolchain-driven;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the VCS report is informational.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-markdown-summaries-on-every-ci-run-with-loud-threshold-failu"
       & "res"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Markdown summaries on every CI run, with loud threshold failures<a c"
       & "lass=""headerlink"" href=""#c5-markdown-summaries-on-every-ci-run-with-loud-thr"
       & "eshold-failures"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Every CI run now leaves a Markdown summary at the bottom of the job page."
       & " The composite action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s assessment step writes an <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">##</span> <span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">a"
       & "ssessment</span></code> table (target, bundled version, compliance label, SP"
       & "ARK level, tests, coverage) with a PASSED/FAILED verdict, and a new <code cl"
       & "ass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">if:</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">always()</span></code> <strong>Write run summary</strong> step appends"
       & " a run-overview table on success and failure. The <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ci.yml</span></code>, <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pr-check.yml</span></code>, and <c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">release.yml</span"
       & "></code> workflows each gained a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">summary</span></code> job (<code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">if:</span> <span class=""pre"">always()</span></"
       & "code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">needs:</"
       & "span></code> all other jobs) that aggregates every job result into one table"
       & ". Threshold failures fail loudly at every layer: unmet <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--require-*</span></code> gates exit"
       & " non-zero, are re-surfaced as GitHub <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">::error::</span></code> annotations, are listed in the"
       & " FAILED summary, and the workflow <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">summary</span></code> job exits <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">1</span></code> when any of its dependen"
       & "cies failed.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s build step also verifies the downloaded/built binary with <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--version</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-man-db-mandb-detection-in-man-and-status"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: man-db (mandb) detection in <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">man</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">status</span></code><a class=""headerlink"" href="""
       & "#c6-man-db-mandb-detection-in-man-and-status"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">man</span></code> now tells the user when man-db is mi"
       & "ssing instead of silently"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "skipping the database refresh: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">Update_Database</span></code> returns whether mandb was"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "found and exited 0, and a missing/failed mandb prints a warning that the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "page is still installed and readable via <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">man</span> <span class=""pre"">-l</span></code>. <co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">status</span></code> gained a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "note in the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vcs"
       & ":</span></code> section explaining that <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">man</span></code>"
       & " cannot refresh the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "man database when mandb is absent from PATH, so users know up front.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-make-check-quality-gate-single-source-crate-description"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">check</span></code> quality gate + single-source crat"
       & "e description<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c7-make-check-quality-gate-single-"
       & "source-crate-description"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A new <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">check</span></code> target runs the full quality gat"
       & "e in one command "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " build,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "native tests, SPARK proof, SVG badges, API docs, SBOM, ASCII, changelog"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "format, and description sync "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " and the obsolete <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">dev-setup</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">prod-setup</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stubs were removed. The crate description now has a single source of truth:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire/descripti"
