       & "s=""pre"">alire/long-description.txt</span></code>, propagated to every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire"
       & ".toml</span></code>, release manifests, index entries) by a new"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/update-de"
       & "scription.py</span></code> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">description</span></code>, <code "
       & "class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">CHECK=1</span></code>"
