       & "version. Build/dev prerequisites now list <strong>Python 3</strong> for the "
       & "pure-stdlib"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/*.py</spa"
       & "n></code> scripts.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-result-caching-extended-to-hlr-llr-parses-the-sbom-graph-and"
       & "-diffs"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Result caching extended to HLR/LLR parses, the SBOM graph, and diffs"
       & "<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c8-result-caching-extended-to-hlr-llr-parses-th"
       & "e-sbom-graph-and-diffs"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The on-disk result cache now also covers the DO-178C HLR.md/LLR.md parses"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">hlr:</span></c"
       & "ode>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">llr:</span"
       & "></code> keys, served into the DAL assessment), the resolved SBOM"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependency graph (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">graph:</span></code> key over the manifests, lockfile, every .gpr file,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacov"
       & "ex/patches/</span></code> dir), and the <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">--compare-base</span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--coverage-delt"
       & "a</span></code> source scans (via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">Scan_Project_Cached</span></code>), so unchanged"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "inputs are not re-parsed across runs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c9-sbom-subcommand-is-standard-aware-and-defaults-to-all-standa"
       & "rds"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C9: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</s"
       & "pan></code> subcommand is standard-aware and defaults to all standards<a cla"
       & "ss=""headerlink"" href=""#c9-sbom-subcommand-is-standard-aware-and-defaults-to-"
       & "all-standards"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</sp"
       & "an></code> subcommand accepts the standard flags (<code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard</span></code>, <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--dal</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--asil</span></"
       & "code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--class<"
       & "/span></code>) and <strong>defaults to all standards</strong>: without an ex"
       & "plicit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "standard flag the SBOM carries the joined DO-178C / ISO 26262 / IEC 62304"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "properties at the shared DAL tier; <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">--standard=iso26262</span></code> / <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--asil=B</span></code> narrows"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "it to ISO 26262 at ASIL B, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">--class=A</span></code> to IEC 62304 at Class A. The usage,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "man page, README, and CLI reference document the new form.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c10-serve-dashboard-is-standard-aware-with-light-dark-themes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C10: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serv"
       & "e</span></code> dashboard is standard-aware with light/dark themes<a class="""
       & "headerlink"" href=""#c10-serve-dashboard-is-standard-aware-with-light-dark-the"
       & "mes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The served dashboard (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">--serve</span></code>) is standard-aware like the <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subcommand: without an explicit <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">--standard</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">--asil</span></code> / <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--class</span></code> it"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "renders every standard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s compliance level (DAL-C, ASIL B, Class A) at the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "shared tier, and an explicit standard flag narrows it to that single"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "standard. The dashboard page also supports <strong>light and dark themes</st"
       & "rong>: colors"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are driven by CSS custom properties, the initial theme follows the browser"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prefers-color-s"
       & "cheme</span></code>, and a header button toggles between light and dark"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(persisted in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">l"
       & "ocalStorage</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Test Suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#test-suite"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>616 tests (was 501), across 12 categories (was 10). The CLI-config catego"
       & "ry"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "covers <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--versio"
       & "n</span></code>, the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">man</span></code> subcommand and its <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">--check</span></code> / <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--dir</span></code> flags,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the standard-awareness defaults for the <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</span></code> subcommand and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span><"
       & "/code> dashboard (all standards by default, narrowed by <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard</span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--asil</span></"
       & "code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--class"
       & "</span></code>); the HTML/Markdown renderers category covers the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "standard-aware dashboard with the light/dark theme toggle,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prefers-color-s"
