       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-12-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.12.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-12-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-18</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Version bumped 1.11.0 -&gt; 1.12.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-theme-name-flag-and-a-light-dark-system-theme-dropdown"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--theme"
       & "=NAME</span></code> flag and a light/dark/system theme dropdown<a class=""hea"
       & "derlink"" href=""#c1-theme-name-flag-and-a-light-dark-system-theme-dropdown"" t"
       & "itle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</spa"
       & "n></code> gains a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">--theme=NAME</span></code> flag (<code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">system</span></code> | <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">light</span></code> | <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">dark</span></code>, default"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">system</span></"
       & "code>) that sets the dashboard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s initial theme. The header control is now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a <strong>dropdown with three options "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " light mode, dark mode, and system theme</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " instead of a two-state button. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">system</span></code> follows"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prefers-color-s"
       & "cheme</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-contextual-help-keyword-with-flag-subcommand-topics"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: contextual <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">help</span></code> keyword with flag/subcommand topics<a class=""headerli"
       & "nk"" href=""#c2-contextual-help-keyword-with-flag-subcommand-topics"" title=""Li"
       & "nk to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">help</span><"
       & "/code> is now a subcommand-like keyword that prints <strong>contextual help<"
       & "/strong> for a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "single flag or subcommand instead of the full usage. The topic is matched"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "case-insensitively with an optional leading <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">--</span></code>, and may appear on either"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "side of the keyword: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">help</span> <span class=""pre"">serve<"
       & "/span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">help</span> <span class=""pre"">--serve</spa"
       & "n></code>, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">--serve</span> <span class=""pre"">help</span></code> all p"
       & "rint the serve-specific help. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">help</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(with no topic) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">--help</span></code> print the full usage. Unknown topics print the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "full usage with an "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Unknown topic"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " notice.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-save-settings-button-with-cli-overrides-persisted-theme-prio"
       & "rity"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Save settings button with CLI-overrides-persisted theme priority<a c"
       & "lass=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-save-settings-button-with-cli-overrides-persiste"
       & "d-theme-priority"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Theme persistence moved from automatic (saving on every dropdown change) "
       & "to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "an explicit <strong>Save settings</strong> button next to the dropdown, whic"
       & "h writes the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "current selection to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">localStorage</span></code> (with a brief "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Saved"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " confirmation)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Theme resolution on page load is now: an explicit CLI theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--theme=light<"
       & "/span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">--theme=dark</span></code>) always wins; otherwise the saved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">localStorage</s"
       & "pan></code> choice if one was saved; otherwise the system"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prefers-color-s"
       & "cheme</span></code>. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">--theme=system</span></code> (or no flag) leaves the browser"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "saved choice in control.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-man-page-rendering-fixed-no-more-runaway-gaps"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: man page rendering fixed (no more runaway gaps)<a class=""headerlink"""
       & " href=""#c4-man-page-rendering-fixed-no-more-runaway-gaps"" title=""Link to thi"
       & "s heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Two roff bugs made the man page render with broken spacing. The SYNOPSIS "
       & "used the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">RI</span></code> macro with separate arguments, which g"
       & "roff concatenates without spaces (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">[--format=FMT][--out=PATH]</span></code>), and long optio"
       & "n lines interleaved with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">.br</span></code> caused groff"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s terminal output to pad the paragraph with tab stops (<code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex&lt;big</span> <span class="""
       & "pre"">gap&gt;sbom</span></code>). Each SYNOPSIS line is now a single quoted `"
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>B` argument, and every MODES / EXIT-STATUS description is a single logica"
       & "l line that groff wraps with the proper hanging indent, so the page renders "
       & "cleanly.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
