       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-13-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.13.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-13-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-18</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Version bumped 1.12.0 -&gt; 1.13.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-man-force-and-the-options-wrap-fix"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">man</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">--force</span></code> and the OPTIONS wrap fix<a class"
       & "=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-man-force-and-the-options-wrap-fix"" title=""Link to t"
       & "his heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The man renderer"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s OPTIONS descriptions carried a leading tab that misaligned"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "every wrapped continuation line (groff placed the first line at the <code cl"
       & "ass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.TP</span></code> tab"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stop but wrapped lines at the paragraph indent). Descriptions are now emitte"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "as single logical lines so groff wraps them with the proper hanging indent "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the whole page (SYNOPSIS, MODES, OPTIONS, ENVIRONMENT, EXIT STATUS) renders"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cleanly. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">man</s"
       & "pan></code> also gains <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">--force</span></code>: normally <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">man</span></code>"
       & " skips"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "re-installing when the installed page already matches the binary, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--force</span><"
       & "/code> always overwrites (useful to repair a corrupted page or re-run"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">mandb</span></c"
       & "ode>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-unknown-flags-rejected-with-a-did-you-mean-suggestion"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: unknown flags rejected with a "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "did you mean"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " suggestion<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-unknown-flags-rejected-with-a-did"
       & "-you-mean-suggestion"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>An unknown <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">-"
       & "-flag</span></code> now fails with exit code 1 and prints "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Unknown option"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plus a suggestion of the closest known flag (edit distance &lt;= 2), so a ty"
       & "po"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "like <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--target=."
       & "</span> <span class=""pre"">--theme=dar</span></code> or <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--srev</span></code> is caught inste"
       & "ad of silently"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ignored. Known flags are unaffected and <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">help</span></code> topics still resolve for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unknown-but-fuzzy-matching inputs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-doc-sync-tools-scan-the-whole-tree-no-hardcoded-file-lists"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: doc-sync tools scan the whole tree (no hardcoded file lists)<a class"
       & "=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-doc-sync-tools-scan-the-whole-tree-no-hardcoded-file"
       & "-lists"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/update"
       & "-proof-status.py</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">tools/update-test-count.py</span></code> previously"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rewrote a hardcoded list of docs, which let stale metrics live in any file"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "not on the list (e.g. the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">601/601</span></code> test count in <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire/long-description.txt</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "re-propagated to every manifest by the next <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">description</span"
       & "></code>). Both tools"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now share <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools"
       & "/live_files.py</span></code>, which derives the file set from the tree:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "every text file is scanned except generated outputs (docs/api-docs,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docs/badges, docs/test_result.md, sbom.json, the generated Ada specs),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "historical records (past-release changelogs and past proof ledgers keep"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "their release-time numbers), and the tools themselves. Both also gained a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--check</span><"
       & "/code> mode that fails when any live file carries a stale metric, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/update-do"
       & "c-links.py</span></code> gained the same. The stale pre-1.12.0 VC counts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "in CONTRIBUTING.md and the crate-description proved/total phrasing are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "covered by new anchored patterns, as are the JSON API sample fields"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&quot;total_vc"
       & "s&quot;</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">&quot;proved_vcs&quot;</span></code> / <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&quot;tests_passed&quot;</span></code> / <c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&quot;tests_faile"
       & "d&quot;</span></code> in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "README and CLI reference) and the Makefile help"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Platinum, N VCs"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " comma"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "form "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " so every number in the docs is anchored to generated artifacts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">obj/gnatprove/"
       & "gnatprove.out</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">docs/test_result.md</span></code>) rather than a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hand-written claim.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-make-check-gate-ordering-tree-wide-count-sync-checks"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">check</span></code> gate ordering + tree-wide count-s"
       & "ync checks<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-make-check-gate-ordering-tree-wide"
       & "-count-sync-checks"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">check</span></code> now runs cheap static gates first (asc"
       & "ii, spark-off, changelog,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "version source, doc links) so a formatting or sync problem fails before the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "expensive build + SPARK proof, then build / test / prove / doc / sbom, then"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the count-sync checks (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">test-count</span> <span class=""pre"">--check</span></code>, <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">proof-status</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">--check</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">description</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">--check</span></code>) so a stale metric anywhere in t"
       & "he tree fails the gate"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "loudly instead of silently drifting into the next release. The README"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Makefile-targets section, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">help</span></code>, and the AGENTS."
       & "md table were updated"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "accordingly.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-readme-slimmed-433-lines-was-508"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: README slimmed (433 lines, was 508)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c5-r"
       & "eadme-slimmed-433-lines-was-508"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Detail duplicated from the docs was trimmed and pointed at its canonical"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "page: the VCS snapshot table (now one line, pointing at cli-reference"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s VCS"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "section), the compliance-artifacts-identical paragraph (pointing at"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "standards.md), the full Makefile-targets table (pointing at AGENTS.md), the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "install/bundle instructions (condensed with the attestation + Linux-x86-64"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "notes kept), and the trust section (tightened). The JSON API section, flag"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "table, and examples remain in the README.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-ai-llm-usage-documented-on-a-dedicated-page"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: AI/LLM usage documented on a dedicated page<a class=""headerlink"" hre"
       & "f=""#c6-ai-llm-usage-documented-on-a-dedicated-page"" title=""Link to this head"
       & "ing"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Ken Thompson <em>Reflections on Trusting Trust</em> reference, the AI"
       & " assistance"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "disclosure, and the "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "why should I trust your code"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " argument moved out of the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "README into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">doc"
       & "s/llm-usage.md</span></code>, which also documents how LLM agents are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "expected to work on the tree under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">AGENTS.md</span></code> (match conventions, zero"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "library dependency, SPARK discipline, <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">check</span></code> as "
       & "the contract,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "regenerate generated files rather than hand-editing them) and how every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "number in the docs is anchored to generated artifacts via the tree-wide sync"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tools rather than a written claim. The README now links to the page.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-unknown-flags-with-no-suggestion-print-the-full-usage"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: unknown flags with no suggestion print the full usage<a class=""heade"
