       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The bundled dashboard template (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">resources/dashboard.html</span></code>) wrapped its"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">__CARDS__</span"
       & "></code> placeholder in an HTML comment (<code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;!--__CARDS__--&gt;</span></code>), and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "renderer substituted only the placeholder text "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " so the served page kept"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the comment markers and the browser treated the entire cards block as a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "comment. Running <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code> showed the page ti"
       & "tle, the theme"
       & ASCII.LF
