       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/badge/*.svg</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "endpoints were unaffected because they are served separately.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The placeholder is now a bare <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">__CARDS__</span></code> marker (no comment wrapper), so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the substituted cards render as live elements. The renderer tests gained a"
