       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dashboard template package (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads</span></code>) is"
       & ASCII.LF
