       & "/adacovex-*.md</span></code> to the versions between the previous release"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tag and the released version. The upper-bound filter compared the maximum of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the changelog version and the released version against the changelog version"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " inverted "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " so every changelog below the released version was skipped and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the release notes listed only the current version"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s changelog. The comparison"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now keeps every available changelog strictly above the previous release tag"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and at or below the released version, so a release that spans multiple"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "versions links all of them (derived from the entries actually present in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tree).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h2-cached-scans-leaked-another-tree-s-absolute-path-differentia"
       & "l-modes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H2: cached scans leaked another tree"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s absolute path (differential modes)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#h2-cached-s"
