       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-15-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.15.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-15-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-18</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Version bumped 1.14.0 -&gt; 1.15.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-docs-cross-linking-audit-and-generator-owned-api-doc-links"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: docs cross-linking audit and generator-owned API-doc links<a class="""
       & "headerlink"" href=""#c1-docs-cross-linking-audit-and-generator-owned-api-doc-l"
       & "inks"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The docs were audited for misplaced and missing cross-links. The README"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "compliance bullet now leads with the general standards page instead of the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "DO-178C-only DAL page, and its ISO 26262 / IEC 62304 links point at the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dedicated ASIL / Class level pages; the "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Compliance levels"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " section links"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all three per-level pages. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">docs/target-projects.md</span></code>"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s HLR-format reference"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now points at the docstring spec"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s HLR-tags section instead of the DAL"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "criteria page, and the plain-text doc references in CONTRIBUTING.md,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "llm-usage.md, installation.md, platforms.md, and standards.md became real"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "links (dashboard.md and sbom.md gained standards links too, and llm-usage.md"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "carried a stale 653/653 test count, now corrected to 666/666).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The six hand-written reference pages (docstring spec, test formats, SPARK"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "levels, DAL/ASIL/Class levels) gained reciprocal "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "See also"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " sections. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "generated api-docs cross-links live in <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">tools/rst2md.py</span></code> so they survive"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">doc</span></code> regeneration: <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GUIDE_PAGES</span></code> adds a "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Guides"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " section to the API"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "index, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">PACK"
       & "AGE_GUIDES</span></code> renders a "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "See also"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " line on 13 package pages"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(parsers, compliance, types, prove, cache, diff, vcs, cpus, renderers,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "server) pointing at their reference pages "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " gnatdoc drops markdown link"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "URLs from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ads<"
       & "/span></code> comments, so the links cannot live in source docstrings."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "AGENTS.md"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s Documentation block (via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">tools/doc-links.map</span></code>) and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "developer-guide now document the pattern.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-badges-sized-per-glyph-instead-of-a-flat-7px-per-character-e"
       & "stimate"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: badges sized per-glyph instead of a flat 7px-per-character estimate<"
       & "a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-badges-sized-per-glyph-instead-of-a-flat-7px-"
       & "per-character-estimate"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Every SVG badge sized its label and value segments as <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">chars</span> <span class=""pre"">*</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">7</span> <span class=""pre"">+</span> <span class=""pre"
       & """>10</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pixels and centered the text, so the visible side padding was whatever the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "flat estimate left over. Uppercase-heavy text (SPARK, DO-178C, ISO 26262,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "IEC 62304) renders wider than 7px per glyph at the badge font"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s 11px size"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and came out nearly flush against the segment edge, while narrow"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "lowercase/digit text (docs, 100%, Platinum) came in well under the estimate"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and carried visibly extra padding.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Badge_SVG</s"
       & "pan></code> now measures each segment as the sum of per-glyph advance"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "widths "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a DejaVu Sans metric table at 11px, rounded to the pixel, with a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "7px fallback for unknown characters "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " plus a fixed 20px total padding, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "every badge carries the same 10px side padding regardless of its letters:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the Platinum value segment is 66px (46px text + 20) and the DAL-C PASS"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "segment 82px (62 + 20), the docs label 46px (26 + 20) and the 100% value"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "50px (30 + 20). Segments that were flush before (SPARK, ISO 26262,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "IEC 62304) now carry the same generous 10px margin as the rest. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard and server-served badges (<code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">/badge/*.svg</span></code>) use the same renderer,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so they pick up the fix automatically; the six <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/badges/*.svg</span></code> files"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are regenerated by <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> / <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">run-s"
       & "elf</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-spark-mode-on-expansion-across-pure-computation-helpers"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: SPARK_Mode On expansion across pure computation helpers<a class=""hea"
       & "derlink"" href=""#c3-spark-mode-on-expansion-across-pure-computation-helpers"" "
       & "title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>GNATprove analysed only a handful of explicitly-annotated subprograms; mo"
       & "st"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pure helpers were plain and so carried no proof obligations. <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></code> (with Pre/Post contrac"
       & "ts) was added where the computation is pure and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the types are SPARK-clean, expanding the proved surface from 408 to 433"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "VCs with zero unproved:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">renderer"
       & "s-svg</span></code>: the per-glyph helpers <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">Glyph_Width</span></code> / <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Text_Width</span></code>, the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "palette functions <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">Badge_Text_Color</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">Spark_Color</span></code> / <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Spark_Text_Color</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(the latter two were already On), and the integer-to-string <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">I2S</span></code> all"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "prove; the string-assembly (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">Badge_SVG</span></code> and the <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">Render_*</span></code> badges) stays"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plain "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " concat-chain bounds blow the solver budget, matching the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "existing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">render"
       & "ers-sbom</span></code> convention, and the <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">Render_Tests_Badge</span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Render_Complian"
       & "ce_Badge</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">Render_DO178C_Badge</span></code> functions take types"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from the non-SPARK <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Types.Implementation</span></code> container package, so they"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cannot be analysed.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">complian"
       & "ce-dal</span></code>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">Min_SPARK_For</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">Need_Tests</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the two pure"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "helpers at the heart of the DAL assessment "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " are now On with contracts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pinning their result ranges (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">Need_Tests</span></code> &lt;= 3, <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Min_SPARK_For</span></code> maps"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "every DAL level into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">Stone</span></code>..<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">Platinum</span></code>). <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">Is_DAL_Achieved</span></code> takes a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">DAL_Assessment<"
       & "/span></code> from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
