       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-16-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.16.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-16-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-19</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Version bumped 1.15.0 -&gt; 1.16.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-proof-patches-prove-spark-contracts-over-vendored-dependenci"
       & "es"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: proof patches prove SPARK contracts over vendored dependencies<a cla"
       & "ss=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-proof-patches-prove-spark-contracts-over-vendored-"
       & "dependencies"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Vendored dependencies can now participate in the SPARK proof without"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "modifying their sources. The same <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">.adacovex/patches/&lt;relative-path&gt;</span></code> fil"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that overlays docstrings can carry <strong>proof aspects</strong>: a patch c"
       & "ontaining any"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</"
       & "span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">P"
       & "re</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span></code>, <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Post</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span>"
       & "</code>, or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Glo"
       & "bal</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span></code> is detected by the new"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.Prove_"
       & "Patch.Has_Proof</span></code> and becomes a <em>proof patch</em>; a docstrin"
       & "g-only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "patch keeps working as a pure overlay and never engages the proof machinery."
       & "</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</s"
       & "pan></code> subcommand merges proof patches before running gnatprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Run_Prove</spa"
       & "n></code> integration in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">adacovex-prove.adb</span></code>):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Count_Pr"
       & "oof_Patches</span></code> scans <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/.adacovex/patches/</span></code> for <code c"
       & "lass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ads</span></code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adb</span></co"
       & "de> patch files; a target with no proof patches is proved against its"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "own tree exactly as before.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Build_Pa"
       & "tched_Copy</span></code> copies the target tree (excluding <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.git</span></code>, <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">obj</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacovex</"
       & "span></code>) into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">&lt;target&gt;/obj/adacovex-proof/</span></code> and overwrites each"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof-patched source with its merged form "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " package-level aspects"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "spliced onto the package declaration line (a <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">package</span> <span class=""pre"">body</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">...</span> <span class=""pre"">is</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "declaration included), and each aspect-carrying subprogram declaration"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "replaced by the patch"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s declaration block. The merge engine (<code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">Apply</span></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "matches on name <strong>and</strong> normalised parameter profile, so an ove"
       & "rloaded"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subprogram patches its exact signature and never a same-named sibling;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the default <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">in<"
       & "/span></code> mode is equivalent to a bare mode (<code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"">out</span></co"
       & "de> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">out</sp"
       & "an></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stay distinct). Spec declarations terminate at their <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">;</span></code>, body"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "declarations at their <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">is</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a patched body declaration is replaced"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "without touching the body proper. An unmatched patch reference fails"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "loudly instead of being silently dropped.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>gnatprove runs against the copy"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s root project and the resulting"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove.out</"
       & "span></code> is copied back to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/obj/gnatprove/gnatprove.out</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for the assessment pipeline. The copy lives under the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">obj/</span></"
       & "code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so it is excluded from scanning, manifest graphs, and the prove input"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hash. The originals are never touched.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Proof-patch contents are folded into the prove result-cache key, so a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "patch edit invalidates the cached proof and forces a re-prove.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The two patch shapes: a <strong>spec patch</strong> (<code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ads</span></code>) re-declares the"
       & " vendored spec with contracts; a <strong>body patch</strong> (<code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adb</span></code>) opts the "
       & "vendored body into the proof "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " gnatprove analyses a unit"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s body only when the body itself declares <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">On</span></code>, so a SPARK-clean vendored body needs bot"
       & "h. Where the body is SPARK-clean and opted in, gnatprove proves the patched "
       & "contracts (the documented <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Vecmath.</span> <span class=""pre"">Clamp</span></code> worked exam"
       & "ple proves its <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "Post</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">Clamp'Result</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"">Lo</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">..</span> <span class=""pre"">Hi</span></code> outright "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all of its VCs proved, none unproved); where it is not (e.g. bodies that ca"
       & "ll `Ada.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Text_IO<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">,</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">which</span> <span class=""pre"">is</span> </code>SPARK_"
       & "Mode Off`), gnatprove skips the I/O bodies by design and reports the unit ou"
       & "t of proof scope "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a proof patch never drags the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s proof level down.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Ada_CRDT dogfood target proves the mechanism end to end: its"
