       & "AGENTS.md"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s patch-directory section.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-server-routes-made-testable"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: server routes made testable<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-server-ro"
       & "utes-made-testable"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.Ser"
       & "ver.HTTP</span></code> now exposes the request-path mapping as a pure,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "SPARK-analysed function: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
