       & ASCII.LF
       & "route mapping carries a full characterization postcondition, so the server"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "badge surface is provable rather than only exercised.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The new <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Serv"
