       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-documentation-a-dedicated-proving-guide-hlr-llr-links-and-fu"
       & "ll-cli-coverage"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: documentation "
