       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs. The proof-patch machinery extends the existing <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">HLR-PROVE</span></code> tag "
