       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-17-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.17.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-17-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-22</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Version bumped 1.16.0 -&gt; 1.17.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-full-spark-proof-re-verification-pass-platinum-held"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: full SPARK proof re-verification pass (Platinum held)<a class=""heade"
       & "rlink"" href=""#c1-full-spark-proof-re-verification-pass-platinum-held"" title="
       & """Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A full <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--for"
       & "ce</span></code> SPARK proof re-run on the current tree re-confirms adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own proof discipline end to end. gnatprove 16.1.0 (<code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--steps=10000</span></code>, the <code"
       & " class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Build_Option_String<"
       & "/span></code> default since 1.10.0) reports <strong>487 total checks "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " 487 proved (112 flow + 375 by prover), 0 justified, 0 unproved</strong> acr"
       & "oss 48 analysed units, i.e. <strong>Platinum</strong> unchanged from 1.16.0."
       & " The 196 skipped units are all default-off <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">Off</span></code> I/O- and container-heavy bodies (file I"
       & "/O, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">Containers</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.</span> <span class=""pre"">Text_IO</span></"
       & "code>) that are out of proof scope by design "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">spark-off-"
       & "check</span></code> gate still passes (no explicit <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mo"
       & "de</span> <span class=""pre"">(Off)</span></code> in <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/</span></code> outside `Types.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Implementation`, the one non-formal container package SPARK forbids analy"
       & "sing). No source changes were needed to hold the proof; this release records"
       & " that the 1.16.0 proof surface reproduces on the current HEAD.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-ada-crdt-dogfood-regression-re-verified-platinum-held"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Ada_CRDT dogfood regression re-verified (Platinum held)<a class=""hea"
       & "derlink"" href=""#c2-ada-crdt-dogfood-regression-re-verified-platinum-held"" ti"
       & "tle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">run-ada-crdt</span></code> dogfood regression and a fr"
       & "esh <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--force</sp"
       & "an></code> proof of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">../Ada_CRDT</sp"
       & "an></code> via the sibling adacovex binary both re-confirm the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Platinum proof: gnatprove 16.1.0 reports <strong>576 total checks "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " 576 proved (109"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "flow + 467 by prover), 0 justified, 0 unproved</strong> across 48 analysed u"
       & "nits, with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the vendored VT100 demo dependency exercised through the 1.16.0 proof-patch"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pipeline (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK"
       & "_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></cod"
       & "e> on the package, the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">Scroll_Screen</span> <span class=""pre"">(From,</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">To)</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scroll-region contract merged into the patched tree copy). The 100 skipped u"
       & "nits"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are the expected platform/generics/I/O exclusions (HLC wall-clock, RNG, stre"
       & "am"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "I/O, test harness). 100% docstring coverage (225/225) and 10290/10290 tests "
       & "hold."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "DAL-C Achieved. This is the Ada_CRDT 1.11.0 verified state.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-skipped-units-proof-audit"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: skipped-units proof audit<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-skipped-uni"
       & "ts-proof-audit"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A full audit of all 196 gnatprove-skipped units in adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove.out"
       & "</span></code> confirms that every skipped body is either genuinely I/O-boun"
       & "d (calls <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">Text_IO</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.</span> <span class=""pre"">Directories</s"
       & "pan></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GN"
       & "AT.</span> <span class=""pre"">OS_Lib</span></code>, `Ada.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Environment_Variables<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">,</span> <span class=""pre"">or</span> <span class=""pre"">spawns</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">external</span> <span class=""pre"">processes</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">--</span> <span class=""pre"">none</span> <span class=""pre"">of</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">which</span> <span class=""pre"">are</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">SPARK-analyz"
       & "able</span> <span class=""pre"">subset)</span> <span class=""pre"">or</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">a</span> <span class=""pre"">default-off</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">pure-logic</span> <span class=""pre"">body</span> <span class=""pre"">whose</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">proof</span> <span class=""pre"">would</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">introduce</span> <span class=""pre"">residual</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">init/termination/array-index</span> <span class=""pre"">VCs</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">that</span> <span class=""pre"">break</span> <span class=""pre"">the</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">Platinum</span> <span class=""pre"">gate.</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">The</span> <span class=""pre"">20</span> <span class=""pre"">candid"
       & "ate</span> <span class=""pre"">pure-logic</span> <span class=""pre"">functions</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">across</span> </code>adacovex-parsers-source.adb<cod"
       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">(10),</span></code>"
       & "adacovex-config.adb<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">(6),</span></code>adacovex-cpus.adb<code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">(2),</span> <span class=""pre"">and</span></code>adaco"
       & "vex-vcs.adb<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">(2)<"
       & "/span> <span class=""pre"">were</span> <span class=""pre"">opted</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"">with</span></code>Pre<code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/</span></code>Post<code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/</span></code>Global =&gt; "
       & "null<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">contracts:<"
       & "/span> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">attempt</span> <span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">generated</span> <span class=""pre"">125+</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "new</span> <span class=""pre"">VCs</span> <span class=""pre"">(487</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">-&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">612</span> <span class=""pre"">tota"
       & "l),</span> <span class=""pre"">but</span> <span class=""pre"">10-60</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">residual</span> <span class=""pre"">VCs</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "remained</span> <span class=""pre"">unproved</span> <span class=""pre"">(loop</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">termination</span> <span class=""pre"">without</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">a</span> <span class=""pre"">dischargeable</span></code>Loop_"
       & "Variant`, array-index checks in loops where cursor bounds depend on same-ite"
       & "ration guards). The attempt was</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>reverted</strong> to preserve the clean 487-VC / 0-unproved Plati"
       & "num gate; the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "findings are documented in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">docs/proof/16.1.0-ledger.md</span></code> ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Skipped-units"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "audit"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ") as tracked proof-debt for future contract-engineering work. No"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "source changes remain "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the audit is documentation-only.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-proof-surface-expansion-9-additional-pure-functions-proved-4"
       & "87-720-vcs-platinum-held"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: proof surface expansion "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
