       & ASCII.LF
       & "prove at the default <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">--steps=10000</span></code> budget, preserving the clean"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>Platinum (720 VCs, 0 unproved, 0 justified)</strong> gate across the"
       & " same 48"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "analysed units.  The increase is <em>analysis</em> coverage, not new code "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "functions existed, they were just previously skipped:</p>"
