       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-18-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.18.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-18-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-23</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Version bumped 1.17.0 -&gt; 1.18.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-quiet-by-default-prove-output-quiet-and-suppress-warnings-se"
       & "ts"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: quiet-by-default prove output "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--quiet</span>"
       & "</code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--s"
       & "uppress-warnings=SETS</span></code><a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-quiet-by-"
       & "default-prove-output-quiet-and-suppress-warnings-sets"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</s"
       & "pan></code> subcommand"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s stdout is now <strong>quiet by default for local runs</strong>:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GNATprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s benign informational messages (the default suppression set "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the loop-unrolling/inlining notice blocks) are filtered out of the replayed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "output, so a local <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> no longer prints t"
       & "he purely-informational"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">cannot</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">unroll</span> <span class=""pre"">loop</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">(too</span> <span class=""pre"">many</span> <span class=""pre"">loop</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">iterations)</span> <span class=""pre"">[info-unrolling-inlini"
       & "ng]</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "notices. The filter drops whole message blocks (tag line, <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">info:</span></code>/<code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--&gt;</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "header, and any <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">+</span></code> sub-message in the in-instantiation shape) while every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "other gnatprove line "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " checks, warnings, and the summary "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " passes through"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "untouched. The proof outcome is never affected: the notices are informationa"
       & "l"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "only.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Three ways to control it:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--quiet<"
       & "/span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " explicit request for the default suppression set (which is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "already the default, so this is the documented spelling of the default"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "behaviour). Keep it for CI-adjacent scripts that want to say what they mean."
       & "</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--suppre"
       & "ss-warnings</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " alias of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--qui"
       & "et</span></code>, kept for compatibility with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "1.17.0.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--suppre"
       & "ss-warnings=SETS</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " suppress a custom comma-separated list of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove info tags: a set name <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">S</span></code> suppresses blocks tagged <code class=""docut"
