       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-19-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.19.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-19-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-23</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Version bumped 1.18.0 -&gt; 1.19.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-dashboard-charts-powered-by-charts-css"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: dashboard charts powered by Charts.css<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c"
       & "1-dashboard-charts-powered-by-charts-css"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve<"
       & "/span></code> dashboard now renders four live charts (vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://chartscss.org/"">Charts.css v1.2."
       & "0</a>, MIT):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>SPARK proof donut</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " proved vs unproved VCs;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Test results</strong> bar chart "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " per-category pass counts;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Proof check-types</strong> bar chart "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " proved checks per check kind;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Docstring coverage</strong> bar chart "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " documented vs undocumented"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subprograms per unit.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Charts.css is vendored as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">resources/charts.min.css</span></code> and <strong>inlined int"
       & "o the self-contained dashboard template</strong> (<code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources/dashboard.html</span></code>), "
       & "so the dashboard keeps its zero-dependency, single-file, offline-serving pro"
       & "perty "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no CDN, no network. The chart cards are generated by the new <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Renderers.</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">HTML.</span> <span class=""pre"">Render_Charts</span></code> and inject"
       & "ed through the template"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">__CHARTS__</s"
       & "pan></code> placeholder.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Charts update live with the metrics (the JSON API below feeds the same da"
       & "ta the dashboard shows). See <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../usage/da"
       & "shboard.html#metrics-charts""><span class=""std std-ref"">docs/dashboard.md</sp"
       & "an></a> and <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.html"""
       & "><span class=""std std-doc"">docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</span></a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-dependency-graph-rest-api-json-metrics-export"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: dependency graph "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " REST API + JSON metrics export<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-dependency-gr"
       & "aph-rest-api-json-metrics-export"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dependency graph the SBOM builds is no longer locked inside <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom.json</span></code>:"
       & "</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "GET</span> <span class=""pre"">/api/deps</span></code></strong> on the <code c"
       & "lass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code> "
       & "dashboard returns the full dependency"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "graph as JSON (name, version, scope, parent, purl, kind), matching the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "existing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/m"
       & "etrics</span></code> endpoint style.  The server state now carries the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "resolved graph, populated once in serve mode.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "--emit-metrics=PATH</span></code></strong> writes a combined machine-readabl"
       & "e export after"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the assessment:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">{&quot;metrics&"
       & "quot;:</span> <span class=""pre"">{...},</span> <span class=""pre"">&quot;depend"
       & "encies&quot;:</span> <span class=""pre"">{...}}</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the same JSON the dashboard"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "API serves, on disk for scripting, dashboards, or archiving.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Both are wired end to end: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">emit-metrics</span></code> action input, docs/ci-cd.md row,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the action-parity gate.  <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">--emit-metrics</span></code> output is uploaded as a CI"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "artifact (see C7).  One new server-routing test pins the <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/deps</span></code> route.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-shell-auto-completion-adacovex-completion"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: shell auto-completion "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">completion</span></code><a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-"
       & "shell-auto-completion-adacovex-completion"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">completion</span></code> (alias <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--completion[=SHELL]</span></code>) p"
       & "rints a static"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "completion script for <strong>bash</strong>, <strong>fish</strong>, <strong>"
       & "zsh</strong>, or <strong>pwsh</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SHELL</span></"
       & "code> auto-detected from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">$SHELL</span></code>; unknown shells fall back to bash)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The scripts complete the subcommands and every long flag from the binary"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "own <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Known_Flags"
       & "</span></code> table, so the completion set cannot drift from the CLI:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-bash notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
       & "span><span class=""nb"">eval</span><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""s2"">""<"
       & "/span><span class=""k"">$(</span>adacovex<span class=""w""> </span>completion<sp"
       & "an class=""k"">)</span><span class=""s2"">""</span><span class=""w"">           </s"
       & "pan><span class=""c1""># bash (default) / auto-detected</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""nb"">source</span><span class=""w""> </span>&lt;<span class=""o"">(<"
       & "/span>adacovex<span class=""w""> </span>completion<span class=""w""> </span>zsh<"
       & "span class=""o"">)</span><span class=""w"">       </span><span class=""c1""># zsh<"
       & "/span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex<span class=""w""> </span>completion<span class=""w""> </span>fish<span "
       & "class=""w""> </span><span class=""p"">|</span><span class=""w""> </span><span clas"
       & "s=""nb"">source</span><span class=""w"">       </span><span class=""c1""># fish</s"
       & "pan>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex<span class=""w""> </span>completion<span class=""w""> </span>pwsh<span "
       & "class=""w""> </span><span class=""p"">|</span><span class=""w""> </span>Invoke-Exp"
       & "ression<span class=""w"">   </span><span class=""c1""># PowerShell</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Zero dependencies: bash uses <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">compgen</span></code>, zsh <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">_arguments</span></code>, fish a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">complete</span>"
       & "</code>-based function, pwsh <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">Register-ArgumentCompleter</span></code>.  The scripts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "complete the current word with a prefix filter against the flag list and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subcommand names, appending nothing for bare-flag completion.  The new"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.Comple"
       & "tion</span></code> package (spec + body, docstring-complete, no SPARK"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "aspects "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " pure string emission) is covered by 13 new CLI-config tests"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(script presence per shell, embedded flag-list check, unknown-shell"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "fallback).  <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">com"
       & "pletion</span></code> is deliberately a <strong>CLI-only</strong> early-exit"
       & " mode in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the action-parity allow-list (like <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">status</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">man</span></code> / <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</span></code>): CI does not"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "need an interactive shell.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-system-tool-probe-cache-sbom-speedup"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: system-tool probe cache (SBOM speedup)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c"
       & "4-system-tool-probe-cache-sbom-speedup"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The SBOM"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s dev-scope dependency scan probes every referenced system tool"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "version by spawning <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">&lt;tool&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;flag&gt;</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " tens of milliseconds per tool.  The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "result is now cached on disk under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">&lt;cache-root&gt;/probes/&lt;tool&gt;</span></code> wit"
       & "h a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>7-day TTL</strong>, so unchanged toolchains stop paying the spawn co"
       & "st on every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "run.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Measured on an 11-tool toolchain (self-assessment, this repo):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p></p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>before</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>after</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>cold full pipeline</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>~490 ms</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>~490 ms</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>warm full pipeline</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>~430 ms</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p><strong>~310 ms</strong></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>system time (warm)</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>~40 ms</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p><strong>~8 ms</strong></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--no-cache</"
       & "span></code> disables the probe cache too (it lives under the cache root)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The TTL means a toolchain upgrade shows up in the SBOM within a week even on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "machines that never re-probe explicitly.  See"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference internal"" href=""../contributing/perf.html#probe-cache""><"
       & "span class=""std std-ref"">docs/perf.md</span></a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-make-bench-hyperfine-timings-binary-size"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">bench</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " hyperfine timings + binary size<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c5-make-bench-h"
       & "yperfine-timings-binary-size"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A new <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">bench<"
       & "/span></code> target times the assessment pipeline with <strong>hyperfine</s"
       & "trong> when"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "installed (bash <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">time</span></code> fallback: no tooling required), measuring cold"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(fresh result + probe cache) and warm (populated caches) runs, and reports"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the <strong>binary size</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " raw and stripped (strip measured on a <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">/tmp</span></code> copy, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the build output is never modified).  Numbers are machine-dependent on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "purpose: the target is a deterministic <em>recipe</em>, and it is intentiona"
       & "lly"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<em>not</em> part of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">check</span></code> (a slow CI runner mu"
       & "st not fail a build)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Documented in <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../contributing/perf.html"""
       & "><span class=""std std-doc"">docs/perf.md</span></a>.  Binary size check on th"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "current build: 7.1 MiB, 3.1 MiB stripped (-57%).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-cyclomatic-complexity-gate-no-god-objects"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: cyclomatic-complexity gate "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no god objects<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c6-cyclomatic-complexity-gate-no"
       & "-god-objects"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">complexity-check</span></code> static gate (native Ada"
       & " implementation), wired into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">check</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">ci.yml</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">pr-check.yml</span></code>, and <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">release.yml</span></code>:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>per-file source LOC cap (2000) and a <strong>percentage-of-codebase c"
       & "ap</strong> (10%)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no file may dominate the tree (god objects);</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>per-subprogram <strong>cyclomatic complexity</strong> cap (50 decisio"
       & "n points) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " god"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "functions are flagged as refactor candidates;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>per-file total decision-point cap (300).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The gate shipped with the refactors it enforces: the DO-178C markdown"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scanner"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s file-reading loop was extracted into a shared generic line-parser"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(one file-read skeleton, two entry types) and its in-line table parsing into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Parse_Table_Row"
       & "</span></code>; the test-result parser"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s big loop was split into six"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "line-style handlers (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">Passed</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">Failed</span></code>, TAP, Automake, Surefire, Unity)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plus the category-helper; and the source scanner"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s file-name extraction"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "became a helper.  Worst function complexity fell from 57 to 49, and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "highest-complexity file dropped under the file cap. All thresholds are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "configurable flags and are documented in the tool"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s module docstring.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6b-test-summary-tables-now-parse-in-both-layouts-incl-the-nati"
       & "ve-one"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6b: test-summary tables now parse in both layouts (incl. the native one"
       & ")<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c6b-test-summary-tables-now-parse-in-both-layo"
       & "uts-incl-the-native-one"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Markdown-table parser only accepted the AUnit-report layout with a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "leading index cell (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">|</span> <span class=""pre"">-</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">Category</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span> <span class=""pre"">N</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">|</span> <span class=""pre"">PASS</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">|</span></code>); the native"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test_runner</sp"
       & "an></code> layout (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">|</span> <span class=""pre"">Category</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">N</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span> <span class=""pre"">PASS</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">|</span></code>, no index cell) and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "space-padded count cells (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">|</span> <span class=""pre"">67</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span></"
       & "code>) were silently skipped, so the new"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard Tests chart was empty for the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test_resu"
       & "lt.md</span></code>."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Parse_Table_Row"
       & "</span></code> now detects the numeric count cell by its digits in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "either layout, trims column padding from the count and category cells, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "keeps the existing footer-overrides-totals semantics. Seven new"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Test-result-parser tests pin the plain layout (with header and separator"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rows). This makes the <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../api-docs/adacov"
       & "ex-test-format.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">test format spec</span></a>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the single source of truth for what every format "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Markdown tables (both"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "layouts), TAP, Automake, Maven Surefire, Unity and AUnit reports "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " looks"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "like and which line wins when formats mix.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-ci-less-brittle-better-debugging-output"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: CI "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " less brittle, better debugging output<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c7-ci-les"
       & "s-brittle-better-debugging-output"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>the composite action folds the assessment output into a <strong>log g"
       & "roup</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">::group::</spa"
       & "n></code>) so the step result never hides the debug detail;</p></li>"
