       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">::notice::</span></code> annotations</strong"
       & ">;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>a new <strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">adacovex-assessment</span></code> artifact</strong> (uploaded <code cl"
       & "ass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">if:</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">always()</span></code>, success"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "or failure) carries the full untruncated assessment log "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--emit-metrics<"
       & "/span></code> JSON export when requested "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " so a flaky or unmet gate"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "never requires re-running locally to reproduce;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>a standalone <strong>complexity-gate job</strong> runs in <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ci.yml</span></code> and <"
