       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""traceability"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Traceability<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#traceability"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs. The new surface extends three existing tags with CLI-relevan"
       & "t"
       & ASCII.LF
