       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-20-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.20.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-20-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-23</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.19.0 -&gt; 1.20.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-dashboard-tabs-with-dependency-tree-and-charts-css-fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Dashboard tabs with dependency tree and Charts.css fixes<a class=""he"
       & "aderlink"" href=""#c1-dashboard-tabs-with-dependency-tree-and-charts-css-fixes"
       & """ title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve<"
       & "/span></code> dashboard is now organised into clickable tabs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(Overview / Proof / Tests / Compliance / Dependencies / Charts) instead of a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "single card stack.  The new <strong>Dependencies</strong> tab renders the re"
       & "solved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.toml</spa"
       & "n></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ali"
       & "re.lock</span></code> graph as a collapsible <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;details&gt;</span></code> tree with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scope badges (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">b"
       & "ase</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">dev</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">transitive</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">vendored</span></code>), child counts, and a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "client-side name filter.  The same graph is already served at <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GET</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "/api/deps</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--emit-"
       & "metrics</span></code>, so the tab is a view, not a new data source.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Charts.css rendering is fixed: bar sizes are now emitted as <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">0..1</span></code> fractions"
       & " (not <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">0..100</s"
       & "pan></code>) so <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">charts.css</span></code> scales correctly, and the SPARK donut now shows pr"
       & "oved vs <em>unproved</em> slices (previously proved vs total duplicated the "
       & "proved arc and hid regressions). Test-category bars are normalised to the la"
       & "rgest category (previously every bar was <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">100%</span></code>). The template (<code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources/dashboard.html</span"
       & "></code>) is now a centered <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">max-width:1180px</span></code> layout with a sticky tab bar, <c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">localStorage</spa"
       & "n></code>-persisted active tab, and hash-routing (<code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">#deps</span></code>, <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">#proof</span></code>, etc. compose "
       & "with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">?</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">theme=</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Ada side (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>Renderers.</span> <span class=""pre"">HTML</span></code>) is split into <cod"
       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Render_Dashboard_In"
       & "ternal</span></code> with per-tab builders, a new <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Render_Deps_HTML</span></code> tree build"
       & "er, and a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Rende"
       & "r_Charts</span></code> overload that takes the graph for future scope pies. "
       & "The bundled template is regenerated via <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-dashboard.py</span></code> as before. See"
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/dashboard"
       & ".md</span></code> (tabs, Dependencies, Charts) and <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</span></code"
       & ">.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-make-targets-grouped-and-a-sync-alias"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Make targets grouped and a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">sync</span></code> alias<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-"
       & "make-targets-grouped-and-a-sync-alias"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">help</span></code> now groups targets (<code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Core</span></code>, <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Assessment</span></code>, <co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Docs</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">&amp;</span> <span class=""pre"">sync</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Gates</span></c"
       & "ode>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Release</"
       & "span></code>) instead of a flat list.  A new <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">sync</span></cod"
       & "e> alias runs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the four doc-sync targets that previously had to be invoked individually:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">agents-tree</sp"
       & "an></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pr"
       & "oof-status</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">test-count</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">doc-links</span></code> + <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">description</span></code>."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The grouping mirrors the pipeline order (<code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">check</span></code> is still the full gate, now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "explicitly listed as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">Core</span></code>).  No target semantics changed; <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">chec"
       & "k</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "still runs the same cheap-first gates, build+test+prove+doc+sbom, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "count-sync checks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-ci-less-brittle-with-timeouts-and-clearer-debugging-output"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: CI less brittle with timeouts and clearer debugging output<a class="""
       & "headerlink"" href=""#c3-ci-less-brittle-with-timeouts-and-clearer-debugging-ou"
       & "tput"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ci.yml</span"
       & "></code> now sets <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">concurrency.cancel-in-progress</span></code> and <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">timeout-minutes</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(25 for self-assessment, 15 for tests/consumer, 10 for coverage-gate),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adds <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">fetch-tags"
       & ":</span> <span class=""pre"">true</span></code> to the coverage-gate checkout "
       & "(previously"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">fetch-depth:</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">0</span></code> alone could miss tags on shallow clon"
       & "es), and keeps the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "existing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">action"
       & "s/cache</span></code> for both the toolchain and the result cache.  The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docs (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/ci-c"
       & "d.md</span></code>) add a <strong>Debugging guide</strong> table that maps e"
       & "very"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">CI</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">GATE:</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">WARNING</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">Skipped_Ct</span></code> / <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">result</span> <span class=""pre"">cac"
       & "he:</span></code> line to its meaning"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the action to take, and spells out the three artifacts that are always"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "available without re-running: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">::error</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">::notice</span></code> annotations, the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">##</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">assessment</span></code> summ"
       & "ary, and the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ad"
       & "acovex-assessment</span></code> artifact"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(full log + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ada"
       & "covex-metrics.json</span></code> when <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">emit-metrics</span></code> is set).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-completion-exposed-as-adacovex-completion-command"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Completion exposed as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
