       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-21-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.21.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-21-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-23</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.20.0 -&gt; 1.21.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-fix-raw-css-rendered-as-text-in-serve-dashboard"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Fix raw CSS rendered as text in <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code> dashboard<a class=""headerlink"
       & """ href=""#c1-fix-raw-css-rendered-as-text-in-serve-dashboard"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dashboard page shell (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">resources/dashboard.html</span></code>) had a duplicated"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;/style&gt;<"
       & "/span></code> tag: the custom dashboard CSS was closed, the vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">charts.min.css<"
       & "/span></code> was then inlined <em>outside</em> any <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;style&gt;</span></code> block, and "
       & "a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "second <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;/sty"
       & "le&gt;</span></code> closed the head.  Browsers rendered the entire vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "CSS as literal text at the top of the page.  The template is now a single"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;style&gt;</"
       & "span></code> block (custom CSS + vendored Charts.css + a single <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;/style&gt;</span></code"
       & ">)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "regenerated via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">tools/gen-dashboard.py</span></code>, so the page is self-contained and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "valid HTML again.  No visual change beyond the bug being gone.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-dependency-tree-text-spacing-scope-filtering-and-overview-co"
       & "llation"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Dependency tree text spacing, scope filtering, and overview collatio"
       & "n<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-dependency-tree-text-spacing-scope-filterin"
       & "g-and-overview-collation"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The tree"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s typography is tightened: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">line-height</span></code> 1.5 -&gt; 1.65, node margins 4px -&gt;"
       & " 6px, leaf padding 6x8 -&gt; 8x12, gaps 8px -&gt; 10px, and a hover <code cl"
       & "ass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">border-color:</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">var(--accent)</span></code> transition. Every <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;li</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">class=&quot;dep-node&quot;&gt;</span></code> now carries <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">data-scope</span></code> (<code"
       & " class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">base</span></code> /"
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">dev</span></co"
       & "de> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">transitiv"
       & "e</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">vendored</span></code>) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">data-name</span></code>, and the toolbar gains four scope ch"
       & "eckboxes (base, dev, transitive, vendored "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all checked by default) plus <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">Expand</span> <span class=""pre"">all</span></code> / <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Collapse</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">all</span></code>. A new <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">filterByScope()</span></code> JS function composes the n"
       & "ame filter and the scope filters so <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">dev</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">vendored</span></code> deps can be hidden withou"
       & "t losing the hierarchy (and re-renders the nomnoml diagram when visible). Th"
       & "e <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">dep-filter</s"
       & "pan></code> input is now visually consistent with the global search box (<co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">padding:7px</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">12px;</span> <span class=""pre"">border-radius:8px;</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">font-size:.88rem</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <strong>Overview</strong> tab is also more useful: after the Source O"
       & "verview / Quick Stats grid it now shows a collation <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">chart-grid</span></code> with three min"
       & "i visuals (SPARK donut, Tests pie, Docs bar) so the key pies/bars are visibl"
       & "e without leaving the overview. The same <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">data-scope</span></code> attribute drives the scop"
       & "e pie in C3.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-charts-pie-bar-line-area-and-scope-aware-extras-where-suitab"
       & "le"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Charts "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " pie, bar, line, area and scope-aware extras where suitable<a class=""headerl"
       & "ink"" href=""#c3-charts-pie-bar-line-area-and-scope-aware-extras-where-suitabl"
       & "e"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Renderers.HT"
       & "ML.Render_Charts</span></code> now has a graph-aware overload"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">(Doc,</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">Proof,</span> <span class=""pre"">Tests,</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">Graph)</span></code> (the old 3-arg form remains as a wrapper) and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "emits four new visuals in the <strong>Charts</strong> tab (now 8 cards total"
       & "):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Tests Pass/Fail</strong> pie "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " passed vs failed slice (previously only the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "per-category bar existed, so a single failing test was easy to miss);</p></l"
       & "i>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Dependencies by Scope</strong> pie "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " counts of base / dev / transitive /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vendored components from the resolved graph (skipped when the graph is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "empty);</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Proof (line)</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">charts-css</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">line</span></code> variant of the proof categories,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "same data as the column chart but as a line, for trend-appropriate"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "comparison;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Docs Area</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
