       & "h-vendored-nomnoml-and-graphre"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <strong>Dependencies</strong> tab gains a second view: <strong>Tree</"
       & "strong> (default) vs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>Diagram (nomnoml)</strong>.  The diagram is rendered with vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/skanaar/nomnoml"">nomn"
       & "oml 1.7.0</a> (MIT, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">resources/nomnoml.js</span></code>, 71 KB) plus its layout engine <a cl"
       & "ass=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/cytoscape/graphre"">graphre"
       & " 0.1.3</a> (MIT, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>resources/graphre.js</span></code>, 38 KB, inlined before nomnoml as <code"
       & " class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">global.graphre</span"
