       & " class=""pre"">nomnoml.draw</span></code> throws <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">graphlib</span> <span class=""pre"">is</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">undefined</span></code> (the UMD wrapper <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">require('graphre')</span></code>"
       & " expects <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">global"
