       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ADACOVEX_GRAPH.depe"
       & "ndencies</span></code> and from rendered <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">data-name</span></code> attributes.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Queries are served from the index (20-hit limit) with a DOM fallback, and"
