       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-22-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.22.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-22-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-24</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.21.0 -&gt; 1.22.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-charts-page-has-six-distinct-chart-types-and-pies-render-cor"
       & "rectly"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Charts page has six distinct chart types and pies render correctly<a"
       & " class=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-charts-page-has-six-distinct-chart-types-and-p"
       & "ies-render-correctly"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <strong>Charts</strong> tab now shows six cards, each a different typ"
       & "e: SPARK proof"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "donut, proof check types column, test results by category bar, docstring"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "coverage radial gauge, tests pass/fail pie, and the dependencies-by-scope"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "polar ring.  The duplicated proof line/area variants are gone and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docstring coverage visual is back on the Charts tab as a half-circle radial"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gauge.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The long-standing "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "pie &lt;U+2260&gt; pie"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " bug is fixed at the root: Charts.css"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--start</span><"
       & "/code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--end</s"
       & "pan></code> are unitless <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">0..1</span></code> turn fractions, but every pie/donut"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "slice was fed <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">0"
       & "..100</span></code> percentages, so each slice rendered as a full circle"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(and stacked opaque over the previous one).  All pie values now go through a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Frac</span></co"
       & "de> helper that clamps to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">0..1</span></code>, and the donut hole is a pure-CSS"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.charts-css.pie"
       & ".donut::after</span></code> circle instead of an invalid <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">donut</span></code> class.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-overview-at-a-glance-robustness-radar-with-a-tier-rating"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Overview at a glance - robustness radar with a tier rating<a class="""
       & "headerlink"" href=""#c2-overview-at-a-glance-robustness-radar-with-a-tier-rati"
       & "ng"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Overview tab now leads with a <strong>Robustness</strong> radar spide"
       & "r and a tier"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rating (S / A / B / C / D) computed as the average of five <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">0..100</span></code> axes:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Docstrings (coverage), Proof (VCs proved), Tests (pass rate), Compliance"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(gate achieved), and Deps (non-vendored share of the graph).  The tier chip"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is colour-coded per theme, the legend lists each axis with its percentage,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the thresholds (S &gt;= 90, A &gt;= 80, B &gt;= 65, C &gt;= 50, D &lt; 5"
       & "0) plus axis"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "definitions are documented in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">docs/dashboard.md</span></code> and shown in the card.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The per-check-type <strong>SPARK radar</strong> moved from the Charts tab"
       & " to the Overview"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(miniature), the tests visual is now a donut, and the doc-coverage gauge"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "completes the collation.  All overview visuals are inline SVG/CSS with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "integer math (no floating point in the renderer) and follow the active"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "light/dark theme.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-dashboard-footer-with-version-licensing-and-credits"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Dashboard footer with version, licensing and credits<a class=""header"
       & "link"" href=""#c3-dashboard-footer-with-version-licensing-and-credits"" title="""
       & "Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The single-line footer is now a semantic <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;footer</span> <span class=""pre"">class=&quot"
       & ";footer&quot;&gt;</span></code> grid with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "three sections: copyright + license + repository + the injected"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v1.22.0</span><"
       & "/code> version, the third-party credits summary (Charts.css, nomnoml, graphr"
       & "e, FlexSearch)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "linking to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs"
       & "/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</span></code>, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the API endpoints (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">/api/metrics</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">/api/deps</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">/badge/*.svg</span></code>).  The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "version is injected next to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">__THEME__</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">__GRAPH_JSON__</span></code> by the Ada"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "renderer from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">A"
       & "dacovex.Version</span></code>, so the footer always matches the binary.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-nomnoml-diagram-top-to-bottom-and-theme-aware"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: nomnoml diagram top-to-bottom and theme-aware<a class=""headerlink"" h"
       & "ref=""#c4-nomnoml-diagram-top-to-bottom-and-theme-aware"" title=""Link to this "
       & "heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dependency diagram now lays out with <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">#direction:</span> <span class=""pre"">down</span"
       & "></code> (a vertical"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tree that stays within the page width on wide dep graphs) and reads the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "page"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s CSS custom properties (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">--card</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">--border</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">--fg</span></code>) at draw time,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "re-rendering on theme change so the box/arrow colours always match.  The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "canvas is sized to its container and deep graphs scroll inside"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.nomnoml-wrap</"
       & "span></code> instead of overflowing the layout.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-dependency-tree-spacing-and-theme-aware-scope-badges"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Dependency tree spacing and theme-aware scope badges<a class=""header"
       & "link"" href=""#c5-dependency-tree-spacing-and-theme-aware-scope-badges"" title="
       & """Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Node text now carries explicit spacing in the markup (no more"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex1.21.0tran"
       & "sitive...</span></code> when CSS is slow or copying), and the scope badges"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "use <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--scope-*</"
       & "span></code> CSS variables with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">color-mix</span></code> backgrounds: dark-theme-safe"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "purple for <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">dev<"
       & "/span></code>, muted for <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">transitive</span></code>, vendored in the danger colour,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "base in the accent colour.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-scope-checkboxes-styled-with-inline-svg-pictograms"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: Scope checkboxes styled with inline SVG pictograms<a class=""headerli"
       & "nk"" href=""#c6-scope-checkboxes-styled-with-inline-svg-pictograms"" title=""Lin"
       & "k to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The four scope checkboxes are custom-styled accessible checkboxes (hidden"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "native input + styled <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">.box</span></code> with a checkmark SVG) and each has a small"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "inline SVG pictogram "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " info circle for base, wrench for dev, layers for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "transitive, warning triangle for vendored "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " used sparingly next to the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "text labels (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ar"
       & "ia-hidden</span></code>, focus-visible rings preserved).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-language-agnostic-vendored-dependency-discovery-with-sbom-la"
       & "nguages"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: Language-agnostic vendored dependency discovery with SBOM languages<"
       & "a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c7-language-agnostic-vendored-dependency-discove"
       & "ry-with-sbom-languages"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dependency graph now discovers vendored components beyond Alire/GPR:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">node_modules</s"
       & "pan></code> (npm, shallow: one component per top-level <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">package.json</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pkg:npm/...&#64"
       & ";version</span></code>), <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">vendor</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">third_party</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">deps</span></code>, <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">submodules</span></code>, etc."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "carrying <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Cargo."
       & "toml</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Cargo.lock</span></code> (pkg:cargo), <code class=""docutils literal notr"
