       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-23-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.23.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-23-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-24</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.22.0 -&gt; 1.23.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-dashboard-search-indexes-all-tab-content-and-restyled-as-but"
       & "ton"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Dashboard search indexes all tab content and restyled as button<a cl"
       & "ass=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-dashboard-search-indexes-all-tab-content-and-rest"
       & "yled-as-button"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The header search box now indexes <strong>full text content across every "
       & "tab</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(Overview, Proof, Tests, Compliance, Dependencies, Charts) instead of only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependency names.  Search hits show a context snippet and a tab badge, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "clicking a hit navigates to the correct tab.  The search input is wrapped in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.search-wrap</s"
       & "pan></code> with a magnifying-glass icon and a clear button, styled to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "match the existing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">.theme-toggle</span></code> button family so it no longer reads as a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bare <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;input&"
       & "gt;</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-compliance-status-shows-target-level-and-percentage-achieved"
       & """>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Compliance status shows target level and percentage achieved<a class"
       & "=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-compliance-status-shows-target-level-and-percentage-"
       & "achieved"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Compliance tab now leads with a gauge that displays the <strong>targe"
       & "t level</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(e.g. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Target:</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">DAL-C</span></code>) and the <strong>achieved percen"
       & "tage</strong> (weighted average of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR traceability, tests passing, and SPARK level met).  The SVG arc reflects"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the actual percentage, and the breakdown (<code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">HLR</span> <span class=""pre"">85%</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">/</span> <span class=""pre"">Tests</span> <span class=""pre"">100%</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">/</span> <span class=""pre"">SPARK</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">100%</span></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is shown below the gauge.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-overview-tab-visualises-tests-with-column-chart"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Overview tab visualises tests with column chart<a class=""headerlink"""
       & " href=""#c3-overview-tab-visualises-tests-with-column-chart"" title=""Link to t"
       & "his heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Overview tab now includes a <strong>test category column chart</stron"
       & "g> alongside the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "existing collation cards.  Each category is a vertical bar proportional to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "its test count, with the raw number displayed below the label and colour-cod"
       & "ed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "by pass/fail status.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-charts-tab-adds-polar-ring-and-stacked-bar-for-dependency-sc"
       & "opes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Charts tab adds polar ring and stacked bar for dependency scopes<a c"
       & "lass=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-charts-tab-adds-polar-ring-and-stacked-bar-for-d"
       & "ependency-scopes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Charts tab now includes two new chart cards:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Dependencies by Scope</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a polar ring (conic-gradient pie with CSS"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "centre hole) coloured by base/dev/transitive/vendored, with a centre badge"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "showing the total dependency count.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Scope Breakdown</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a stacked horizontal bar with percentage labels and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a legend showing raw counts per scope.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Both cards include raw numbers alongside the visual so the charts never f"
       & "eel"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "made up.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-dependency-tree-spacing-checkbox-size-and-icon-scale-fixed"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Dependency tree spacing, checkbox size, and icon scale fixed<a class"
       & "=""headerlink"" href=""#c5-dependency-tree-spacing-checkbox-size-and-icon-scale"
