       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-cyclomatic-complexity-checker-ported-to-ada"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Cyclomatic complexity checker ported to Ada<a class=""headerlink"" hre"
       & "f=""#c8-cyclomatic-complexity-checker-ported-to-ada"" title=""Link to this head"
       & "ing"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">complexity</span></code> subcommand now runs cyclomat"
       & "ic-complexity analysis"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "directly inside the adacovex binary (previously a standalone Python script)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The checker scans <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">src/*.ads</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">src/*.adb</span></code>, attributes decision points to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "top-level subprograms, and enforces the same gates as <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/check-complexity.py</span></cod"
       & "e>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(max-file-loc, max-file-pct, max-fn-complexity, max-file-complexity).  Exit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "code is 1 when any gate is violated.  <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">complexity-check</span>"
       & "</code> now invokes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">./bin/adacovex<"
       & "/span> <span class=""pre"">complexity</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c9-dependency-detection-expanded-for-more-languages"">"
