       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-24-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.24.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-24-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-24</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.23.0 -&gt; 1.24.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-complexity-module-docstrings-and-spark-mode-alignment"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Complexity module docstrings and SPARK mode alignment<a class=""heade"
       & "rlink"" href=""#c1-complexity-module-docstrings-and-spark-mode-alignment"" titl"
       & "e=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex"
       & ".</span> <span class=""pre"">Complexity</span></code> package now carries a pa"
       & "ckage-level docstring and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">&#64;brief</span></code> tags on every public subprogram, and all"
       & " body subprograms have docstrings. The package-level <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">SPARK_"
       & "Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">(Off)</span></code> remains necessary because "
       & "it instantiates the non-formal `Ada. Containers.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Vectors`; the exception is now documented consistently across AGENTS.md, "
       & "the Makefile, and the proof-status ledger.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-complexity-gate-ci-provisions-alire-before-build"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Complexity gate CI provisions Alire before build<a class=""headerlink"
       & """ href=""#c2-complexity-gate-ci-provisions-alire-before-build"" title=""Link to"
       & " this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">complexi"
       & "ty-gate</span></code> jobs in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">ci.yml</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">pr-check.yml</span></code> now run"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire-project/s"
       & "etup-alire</span></code> before <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">complexity-check</span></code"
       & ">, so the gate no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "longer fails with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">/bin/sh:</span> <span class=""pre"">alr:</span> <span class=""pre"">not</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">found</span></code> on a fresh runner.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-temp-directory-and-shell-abstraction-for-non-linux-platforms"
       & """>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Temp directory and shell abstraction for non-Linux platforms<a class"
       & "=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-temp-directory-and-shell-abstraction-for-non-linux-p"
       & "latforms"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Hardcoded <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/t"
       & "mp/</span></code> paths in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">adacovex-cpus</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-vcs</span></code>, <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-prove</span></code>, <code c"
       & "lass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-renderers-man"
       & "</span></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">adacovex-parsers-manifest</span></code> are replaced by <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.</span> <span class="""
       & "pre"">CPUs.</span> <span class=""pre"">Get_Temp_Directory</span></code>, which "
       & "honours <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">TMPDIR<"
       & "/span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">TEMP</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">TMP</span></code> environment variables and falls back to <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/tmp</span></code>. The sh"
       & "ell executable is similarly abstracted through `Adacovex.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>CPUs. Get_Shell_Command`.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-gnat-v16-1-0-toolchain-rollout"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: GNAT v16.1.0 toolchain rollout<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-gnat-v"
       & "16-1-0-toolchain-rollout"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The composite action default, CI workflow pins, and documentation now all"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "target <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnat_nat"
       & "ive=16.1.0</span></code> (previous default was <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">15.2.1</span></code>).  The action"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "input default, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "ci.yml</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">pr-check.yml</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">release.yml</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/ci-cd.md</span></code>, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/architectu"
       & "re.md</span></code> are updated so consumers do not inherit a stale"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "toolchain pin.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-documentation-tier-separation-clarified"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Documentation tier separation clarified<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#"
       & "c5-documentation-tier-separation-clarified"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">AGENTS.md</s"
       & "pan></code> now explicitly defines the two documentation tiers: <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/</span></code> (user"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "documentation: install, CLI, dashboard, SBOM, VCS, standards, CI/CD, proving"
       & ","
       & ASCII.LF
       & "architecture, changelogs, HLR/LLR, performance) for end users and safety"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "engineers; and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "docs/api-docs/</span></code> (generated gnatdoc reference, docstring spec,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "test format, SPARK/DAL/ASIL/class levels) for contributors and auditors.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-hlr-index-completeness"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: HLR index completeness<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c6-hlr-index-comp"
       & "leteness"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">HLR-COMPLEXI"
       & "TY</span></code> is added to both <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">docs/HLR.md</span></code> and <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/compliance/HLR.md</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "closing the gap between the tag used in source docstrings and the published"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR index.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-complexity-check-target-no-longer-drifts-from-native-impleme"
       & "ntation"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: Complexity-check target no longer drifts from native implementation<"
       & "a class=""headerlink"" href=""#h1-complexity-check-target-no-longer-drifts-from"
       & "-native-implementation"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Makefile target description and help text now correctly state that"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
