       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-25-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.25.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-25-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-24</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.24.0 -&gt; 1.25.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-complexity-checker-warning-hygiene"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Complexity checker warning hygiene<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-co"
       & "mplexity-checker-warning-hygiene"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-com"
       & "plexity.adb</span></code> now returns <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">Result</span></code> explicitly from the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Analyze_File</s"
       & "pan></code> exception handler, eliminating the GNAT missing-return warning,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the spurious <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">Unreferenced</span></code> on <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Print_Report</span></code> "
       & "thresholds has been"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "removed so the gate parameters are no longer flagged as unreferenced.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-playwright-acknowledged-as-a-development-dependency"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Playwright acknowledged as a development dependency<a class=""headerl"
       & "ink"" href=""#c2-playwright-acknowledged-as-a-development-dependency"" title=""L"
       & "ink to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/THIRD_P"
       & "ARTY_NOTICES.md</span></code> and the dashboard Credits tab now list"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Playwright (Apache-2.0) as a development dependency used for end-to-end"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard layout tests (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">e2e</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-dependency-tree-filter-state-preservation"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Dependency tree filter state preservation<a class=""headerlink"" href="
       & """#c3-dependency-tree-filter-state-preservation"" title=""Link to this heading"""
       & ">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">filterBy"
       & "Scope</span></code> JavaScript function now uses <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Map</span></code> instead of a plain"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "object to snapshot and restore <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">details</span></code> open states, fixing the bug where"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "DOM-element keys were stringified to <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">[object</span> <span class=""pre"">HTMLLIElement]</span>"
       & "</code> and caused the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tree to collapse irrecoverably after filtering.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-spark-proof-radar-on-overview-matches-robustness-styling"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: SPARK proof radar on Overview matches Robustness styling<a class=""he"
       & "aderlink"" href=""#c4-spark-proof-radar-on-overview-matches-robustness-styling"
       & """ title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The per-check-type SPARK proof radar on the Overview tab now uses the sam"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "split layout, tier badge, and legend structure as the Robustness radar,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "making both charts visually consistent.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-overview-chart-types-updated"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Overview chart types updated<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c5-overview"
       & "-chart-types-updated"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Test categories on the Overview tab now render as a Charts.css column cha"
       & "rt"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instead of a custom CSS grid, and docstring coverage uses a radial chart"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "styled consistently with the other quality gauges.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-charts-page-theme-awareness"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: Charts page theme awareness<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c6-charts-pa"
       & "ge-theme-awareness"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>All chart colours on the Charts tab now use CSS custom properties (<code "
       & "class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">var(--accent)</span><"
       & "/code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">var(--fg)</span"
       & "></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">var(-"
       & "-border)</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">var(--card)</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">var(--muted)</span></code>) so they"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adapt automatically to light, dark, and system themes.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-nomnoml-diagram-inherits-dashboard-theme-colours"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: nomnoml diagram inherits dashboard theme colours<a class=""headerlink"
       & """ href=""#h1-nomnoml-diagram-inherits-dashboard-theme-colours"" title=""Link to"
       & " this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The nomnoml renderer now reads <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">--card</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">--fg</span></code> from the dashboard theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "variables, so the dependency diagram background and arrow colours match the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "active light/dark/system theme.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h2-standards-all-badge-set-includes-all-three-standard-families"
       & """>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H2: Standards=all badge set includes all three standard families<a class"
       & "=""headerlink"" href=""#h2-standards-all-badge-set-includes-all-three-standard-"
       & "families"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>When <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--stand"
       & "ard=all</span></code> is selected the overview now emits badges for DO-178C,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ISO 26262, and IEC 62304 at their target tiers (DAL-C, ASIL B, Class A),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rather than only the single active standard.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Test Suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#test-suite"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>900 tests passing across 14 categories.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""proof-results"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Proof Results<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#proof-results"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 720/720 VCs proved under gnatprove 16.1.0.  0 unproved, 0 justi"
       & "fied.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""traceability"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Traceability<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#traceability"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs.  Coverage:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">HLR-COMP"
       & "LEXITY</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
