       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-26-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.26.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-26-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-24</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.25.0 -&gt; 1.26.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-perf-bench-target-wired-to-makefile"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: perf-bench target wired to Makefile<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-p"
       & "erf-bench-target-wired-to-makefile"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/perf-b"
       & "ench.py</span></code> is now exposed as <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">perf-bench</span></co"
       & "de>, providing a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dedicated perf/strace profiling target alongside the existing <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">bench</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hyperfine target.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-spark-mode-off-restricted-to-documented-exceptions"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: SPARK_Mode Off restricted to documented exceptions<a class=""headerli"
       & "nk"" href=""#c2-spark-mode-off-restricted-to-documented-exceptions"" title=""Lin"
       & "k to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Verified that <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">(Off)</span></code> and <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">Off</span></code> appear only in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "three documented exception packages: <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-complexity</span></code> (non-formal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Ada.Containers), <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>adacovex-types</span></code> (Subprogram_Vectors container), and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-cpus.G"
       & "et_Temp_Directory</span></code> (Ada.Environment_Variables).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-dedicated-credits-file"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Dedicated credits file<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-dedicated-cred"
       & "its-file"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Added <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/C"
       & "REDITS.md</span></code> as the dedicated acknowledgements file. It lists"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex credits and points to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</span></code> for full"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "third-party license details.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-requirements-table"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Requirements table<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-requirements-table"
       & """ title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Added <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/r"
       & "equirements.md</span></code> with a table that categorises dependencies as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Core, Development, or Good to have. Alire-managed dependencies are listed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "under their Alire crate names.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-docs-rewritten-in-asd-ste100"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Docs rewritten in ASD-STE100<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c5-docs-rew"
       & "ritten-in-asd-ste100"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>User documentation now follows ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English ru"
       & "les:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "short sentences, active voice, one instruction per sentence, consistent"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "terminology, and no AI-slop hedging. See"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "https://github.com/AminBlg/SimpleEnglish for the skill reference.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-simpleenglish-skill-reference-in-agents-md"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: SimpleEnglish skill reference in AGENTS.md<a class=""headerlink"" href"
       & "=""#c6-simpleenglish-skill-reference-in-agents-md"" title=""Link to this headin"
       & "g"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>AGENTS.md now references the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/AminBlg/SimpleEnglish"
       & """>AminBlg/SimpleEnglish</a> skill for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "technical writing guidance.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-british-english-in-inline-source-comments"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: British English in inline source comments<a class=""headerlink"" href="
       & """#c7-british-english-in-inline-source-comments"" title=""Link to this heading"""
       & ">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>British English now also covers inline (non-docstring) source comments"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "across the Ada sources.  This completes the spelling pass: docstrings"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "were already converted, and the remaining American spellings (analyse,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "colour, normalise, synthesise, licence, honour, centre, and friends)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "were updated to match the AGENTS.md technical-writing convention.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-hardened-ascii-and-link-checks-skills-directory-excluded"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Hardened ASCII and link checks; skills directory excluded<a class=""h"
       & "eaderlink"" href=""#c8-hardened-ascii-and-link-checks-skills-directory-exclude"
       & "d"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ascii-ch"
       & "eck</span></code> makefile target was rewritten to be less brittle: it now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "runs a single recursive grep with explicit include and exclude patterns"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instead of a nested find loop over extensions, and it no longer relies on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tab escapes inside bracket expressions.  The vendored <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">skills/</span></code> directory"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is excluded from the ASCII check (its skill files legitimately carry"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "non-ASCII punctuation such as em-dashes).  The link checker now also"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "skips <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">skills/</"
       & "span></code>, so vendored third-party content is never gated by our"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "repo checks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>None.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Test Suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#test-suite"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>968 tests passing across 14 categories.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""proof-results"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Proof Results<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#proof-results"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 722/722 VCs proved under gnatprove 16.1.0. 0 unproved, 0 justif"
       & "ied.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""traceability"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Traceability<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#traceability"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs. Coverage:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">HLR-ARCH"
       & "</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C1 perf-bench Makefile target, C2 SPARK_Mode Off audit,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "C3 credits file, C4 requirements table, C5/C6 ASD-STE100 docs and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "SimpleEnglish skill reference, C7 British English in inline source"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "comments, C8 hardened ASCII/link checks with skills directory"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "exclusion.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>See <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/cli"
       & "-reference.md</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">docs/ci-cd.md</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/architecture.md</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
