       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.27.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-27-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-24</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.26.0 -&gt; 1.27.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-prove-run-no-longer-emits-gnat-temp-files"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Prove run no longer emits GNAT-TEMP files<a class=""headerlink"" href="
       & """#c1-prove-run-no-longer-emits-gnat-temp-files"" title=""Link to this heading"""
       & ">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--suppre"
       & "ss-warnings</span></code> output capture used <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GNAT.</span> <span class=""pre"">OS_Lib.</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">Create_Temp_File</span></code>, which writes a <code clas"
       & "s=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GNAT-TEMP-XXXXX.</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">TMP</span></code> file into the current directory.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>An interrupted run left that file in the project tree, and the <code clas"
       & "s=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.gitignore</span></code> "
       & "entry <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">*.tmp</sp"
       & "an></code> is case-sensitive, so the <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">.</span> <span class=""pre"">TMP</span></code> suffix sh"
       & "owed up in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">git<"
       & "/span> <span class=""pre"">status</span></code>. The capture file now lives in"
       & " the system temp directory (`Adacovex. CPUs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Get_Temp_Directory<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">)</span> <span class=""pre"">under</span> <span class=""pre"">a</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">PID-suffixed</span> <span class=""pre"">name,</span> <span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">following</span> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">exis"
       & "ting</span> <span class=""pre"">VCS</span> <span class=""pre"">snapshot</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">convention.</span> <span class=""pre"">A</span> <span class="""
       & "pre"">defensive</span> </code>.gitignore<code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">entry</span> <span class=""pre"">for</span></code><em>"
       & ". TMP<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">and</span>"
       & "</code>GNAT-TEMP-</em>` was added as well.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-ste100-technical-names-dictionary"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: STE100 Technical Names dictionary<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-ste"
       & "100-technical-names-dictionary"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Added <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/s"
       & "te100-technical-names.md</span></code>, the controlled list of Technical"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Names (non-STE words) for the adacovex domain, per ASD-STE100 Section 1"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Words"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ". The dictionary organises entries into the four STE categories"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(Hardware and System Entities, Ada Language Constructs, Domain and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Mathematical Terms, Code Identifier Names). Every entry carries the five"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "required fields: approved word, part of speech, approved meaning,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "non-approved alternatives, and an example sentence.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-ste100-rewrite-audit-of-docs-and-api-reference"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: STE100 rewrite audit of docs and API reference<a class=""headerlink"" "
       & "href=""#c3-ste100-rewrite-audit-of-docs-and-api-reference"" title=""Link to thi"
       & "s heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Audited the STE100-rewritten user documentation and the generated API"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reference for dropped jargon. All important technical terms survived the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rewrite (Alire, gnatprove, GNAT, manifest, SBOM, CycloneDX, SPDX, DAL,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ASIL, HLR, LLR, verification conditions, pragma, aspect, contract,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subprogram, and friends). One garbled sentence in <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/architecture.md</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "was corrected.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-documentation-index-pages-for-docs-and-every-docs-subdirecto"
       & "ry"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Documentation index pages for docs and every docs subdirectory<a cla"
       & "ss=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-documentation-index-pages-for-docs-and-every-docs-"
       & "subdirectory"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Added <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/i"
       & "ndex.md</span></code> (the top-level documentation landing page) and index p"
       & "ages for the subdirectories that lacked one: <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/proof/index.md</span></code> (proof recor"
       & "ds), <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/compl"
       & "iance/index.md</span></code> (VERIFICATION.md, TRACE.md, and the HLR/LLR ind"
       & "exes), and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs"
       & "/badges/index.md</span></code> (the SVG badge set). Every index states that "
       & "the documentation uses British English and ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical E"
       & "nglish and points at the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">docs/ste100-technical-names.md</span></code> dictionary. The gener"
       & "ated API reference index (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">docs/api-docs/index.md</span></code>) now opens with a "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "How to read this reference"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " section written for end users, contributors, and maintainers; it links the "
       & "CLI reference, the standards pages, the contributing guide, the architecture"
       & " notes, the proof ledger, the changelogs, and the STE100 dictionary. The API"
       & "-docs reader guide lives in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">tools/rst2md.py</span></code> so <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">doc</span></cod"
       & "e> regenerates it instead of overwriting a hand-edited file.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/do"
       & "c-links.map</span></code> and the AGENTS.md documentation block now list the"
       & " new index pages.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-sbom-system-tool-scan-rewritten-as-a-single-pass-word-scan"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: SBOM system-tool scan rewritten as a single-pass word scan<a class="""
       & "headerlink"" href=""#c5-sbom-system-tool-scan-rewritten-as-a-single-pass-word-"
       & "scan"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Discover_Sys"
       & "tem_Dev_Deps</span></code> matched every line against every system tool with"
       & " a per-tool substring loop (60 tools x line length). It dominates the whole "
       & "warm assessment pipeline: profiling showed 76% of warm-path CPU in <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Line_Refers_To</span></c"
       & "ode> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Match_At"
       & "</span></code>. The replacement walks each line once, extracts maximal <code"
       & " class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[a-z0-9_-]</span></c"
       & "ode> words, and compares each word against the tool table by length first. M"
       & "atch semantics are identical and the cmp is per-word, so <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span></code> still matches i"
       & "n <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">build</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">Makefile</span></code> still does not match (capital "
       & "M), and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">python<"
       & "/span></code> still does not match in <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">python3</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Warm self-assessment dropped from ~1021 ms to ~63 ms (16x) on the benchma"
       & "rk machine.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-tool-output-directories-excluded-from-both-tree-walks"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: Tool-output directories excluded from both tree walks<a class=""heade"
       & "rlink"" href=""#c6-tool-output-directories-excluded-from-both-tree-walks"" titl"
       & "e=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The SBOM dev-dependency walk and the source scan walked every directory"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "except the blacklist. A <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">gnatprove/</span></code> output directory (thousands of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "files after a proof run) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">__pycache__</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">node_modules</span></code>, <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.headroom</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.lccst</spa"
       & "n></code> directories were therefore enumerated and cleaned on every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "run. All five names are now skipped by both walks; the remaining syscall"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "noise on warm runs is glibc hwcaps startup probing, not adacovex code.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-cache-eviction-batched"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: Cache eviction batched<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c7-cache-eviction"
       & "-batched"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Put_Cached</"
       & "span></code> ran <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>Evict_If_Needed</span></code> after every store; <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Evict_If_Needed</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "walks the whole cache tree (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">readdir</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">stat</span></code> per entry). A cold run"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that stores one blob per source file therefore walked the cache once per"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "file. Eviction now runs every 32 stores, so a bounded overshoot of at"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "most 31 entries is the steady state and a cold run walks the tree once or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "twice. This is part of the cold-run improvement (~1.4 s to ~0.55 s).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-cpus-get-temp-directory-and-spark-mode-off-exceptions"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">CPUs.Ge"
       & "t_Temp_Directory</span></code> and SPARK Mode Off exceptions<a class=""header"
       & "link"" href=""#c8-cpus-get-temp-directory-and-spark-mode-off-exceptions"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>1.26.0 restricted <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">(Off)</span></code> to three docum"
       & "ented exceptions. Each"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "was re-verified against gnatprove 16.1.0 with minimal scratch units:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>A <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_"
       & "Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></code"
       & "> unit instantiating non-formal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">Containers.</span> <span class=""pre"">Vectors</span></code> is"
       & " rejected by flow analysis: it says the instantiation is "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "not allowed in SPARK (due to entity declared with SPARK_Mode Off)"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ". The `Adacovex.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Types. Implementation<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">and</span></code>Adacovex. Complexity<code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">container</span> <span class=""pre"">packages</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">are</span> <span class=""pre"">therefore</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">two</span> <span class=""pre"">irredu"
       & "cible</span> <span class=""pre"">exceptions,</span> <span class=""pre"">and</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">Makefile</span></code>spar"
       & "k-off-check` gate now allows exactly those two.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.Envi"
       & "ronment_Variables</span></code> reads were never SPARK-blocked. A"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></code> functio"
       & "n calling <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Exist"
       & "s</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">Value</span></code> proves clean,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[assumed-g"
       & "lobal-null]</span></code> warnings because the runtime has no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Global contracts. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">CPUs.Get_Temp_Directory</span></code> therefore returned to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></code> with <c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Global</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">null</span></code> (spec and b"
       & "ody), and its"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docstring in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">do"
       & "cs/</span></code> was corrected. The full proof now reports 724"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "VCs, 0 unproved, 0 justified (Platinum), with the ledger listing the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "six <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[assumed-gl"
       & "obal-null]</span></code> warnings.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The evidence and the skipped-units audit are recorded in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/proof/16.1"
       & ".0-ledger.md</span></code> (the 16.1.0 ledger).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/arc"
       & "hitecture.md</span></code>: corrected the garbled STE100 rewrite sentence.</"
       & "p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/llm"
       & "-usage.md</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">docs/developer-guide.md</span></code>: updated the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "SPARK_Mode-Off exception list from three packages to two.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Test Suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#test-suite"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>968 tests passing across 14 categories.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
