       & "pre"">grep</span> <span class=""pre"">-P</span></code>; tab and LF are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "allowed, CR still fails, so CRLF line endings are caught).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/sp"
