       & """>sed</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">sort</span> <span class=""pre"">-V</span></code> in <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">release</span></code>, <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test-publish</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">coverage-gate</"
