       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-system-tool-probes-moved-to-a-stable-machine-level-store"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: system-tool probes moved to a stable machine-level store<a class=""he"
       & "aderlink"" href=""#c6-system-tool-probes-moved-to-a-stable-machine-level-store"
       & """ title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The cold-path profile showed the SBOM system-tool version probes (each a "
       & "subprocess; node/hg/mandb boot an interpreter) dominating cold runs. They we"
       & "re cached under the result cache, so wiping the cache or pointing <code clas"
       & "s=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--cache-dir</span></code>"
       & " elsewhere re-probed every tool. They now live in <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/probes/</span></code> (7-day "
       & "TTL) outside the result cache, and the referenced-tools cache blob stores ea"
       & "ch tool"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s probe result so a cache hit rebuilds the SBOM tool edges without PATH look"
       & "ups, probe reads, or spawns. Cold on a warm-probe machine dropped from ~658 "
       & "ms to ~86 ms (7.7x); warm from ~39.8 ms to ~34.6 ms.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The blob layout is names-<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">|</span></code>-version-pairs and <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Cache_Schema</span></code> was bumped to s6 "
       & "so names-only blobs from the earlier layout are never served as complete.</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-dashboard-dependency-graph-versions-direct-links-real-packag"
       & "es"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: Dashboard dependency graph: versions, direct links, real packages<a "
       & "class=""headerlink"" href=""#c7-dashboard-dependency-graph-versions-direct-link"
       & "s-real-packages"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dashboard dependency graph (and the SBOM that shares it) no longer"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "lists things that are not packages, and every listed package carries a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "version and a direct registry link:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The four vendored dashboard libraries (FlexSearch, nomnoml, graphre,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Charts.css) are now versioned (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">0.7.31</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">1.7.0</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">0.1.3</span></code> / <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">1.2.0</span></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pkg:npm</s"
       & "pan></code> PURLs.  adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own dashboard sources"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources/dash"
       & "board.*</span></code>) are not a package and never become"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "components.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">node_mod"
       & "ules</span></code> scanning resolves scoped packages"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">node_modules/&"
       & "#64;scope/pkg</span></code> becomes <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">&#64;scope/pkg&#64;&lt;version&gt;</span></code> from i"
       & "ts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">package.json</s"
       & "pan></code>, so the e2e fixture yields <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">&#64;playwright/test&#64;1.62.1</span></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and skips pnpm"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s virtual store and shim dirs (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">.pnpm</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">.bin</span></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "entirely.  <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.pnp"
       & "m</span></code> is not a dependency; the <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">pnpm</span></code> binary is, and stays"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the dev tool.  The SBOM and the dashboard now render the same list.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The dep-details Link row builds direct GitHub / GitLab / Bitbucket /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "npm / crates.io / PyPI / pkg.go.dev / Alire links from the PURL"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(scoped npm names included) and no longer falls back to a GitHub"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "search URL for unknown ecosystems.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-proof-categories-match-gnatprove-s-summary-table"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Proof categories match gnatprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s summary table<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c8-proof-categories-match-gnatpr"
       & "ove-s-summary-table"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>gnatprove 16 reports flow analysis as "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Data Dependencies"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
