       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c10-makefile-orchestration-moved-to-dedicated-python-tools"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C10: Makefile orchestration moved to dedicated Python tools<a class=""hea"
       & "derlink"" href=""#c10-makefile-orchestration-moved-to-dedicated-python-tools"" "
       & "title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Beyond the pure parsing ports in C5, every multi-step <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span></code> recipe now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "delegates to a dedicated stdlib-Python script, so the Makefile is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "declarative and each flow is individually testable:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/bu"
       & "ild.py</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the build flow (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>gen-version</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">gen-dashboard</span></code> +"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">build</span></code> with the SFrame log filter + the <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span></code> syml"
       & "ink).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/de"
       & "v-cmd.py</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the alire-dev.toml swap behind <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">doc</span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">fmt</span></code>, restored unconditionally (including on Ctr"
       & "l-C / SIGTERM)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The swap uses a fresh-mtime copy: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">exec</span></code> re-synchr"
       & "onises the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "workspace only when <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">alire.toml</span></code> is strictly newer than"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire/alire.loc"
       & "k</span></code>, so a metadata-preserving copy silently skipped the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "sync and gnatdoc / gnatformat never reached the exec PATH.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/be"
       & "nch.py</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the cold/warm hyperfine (or measured) benchmark"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plus the stripped-binary-size report.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/co"
       & "verage-gate.py</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the release-tag docstring delta in a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "temporary worktree, removed even when the assessment fails.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/ru"
       & "n.py</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the single owner of the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">prove</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">run-self</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "/ <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">run-ada-crdt<"
       & "/span></code> invocation shape (SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH + acceptance"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gates); <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">run.py<"
       & "/span> <span class=""pre"">assess-args</span></code> feeds the release flow, s"
       & "o the gate flags"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "live in exactly one place.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/re"
       & "lease.py</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the whole release flow (prove, build, validate,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "coverage gate, changelogs, bundling, attestation, manifest bumps,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tag/push), with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">make</span> <span class=""pre"">release</span> <span class=""pre"">DRY_RUN=1</s"
       & "pan></code> running everything except the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "irreversible commit/tag/push.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/te"
       & "sts.py</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a stdlib-<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">unitt"
       & "est</span></code> suite over the tools"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & " pure"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "logic (26 tests), wired into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">check</span></code> as the <code"
       & " class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools-check</span></"
