       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The ASCII gate now skips the gitignored generated Playwright output"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tests/e2e/play"
