       & "un.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c11-gnatprove-run-is-warning-free"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C11: gnatprove run is warning-free<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c11-gnatp"
       & "rove-run-is-warning-free"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The six <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[ass"
       & "umed-global-null]</span></code> warnings from"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">CPUs.Get_Temp_D"
       & "irectory</span></code>"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.Environme"
       & "nt_Variables</span></code> reads are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "silenced in the source: the function scopes a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pragma</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">Warnings</span> <span class=""pre"">(Off,</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">&quot;no</span> <span class=""pre"">Global</span> <span class=""pre"">cont"
       & "ract</span> <span class=""pre"">available&quot;)</span></code> around itself"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(re-enabled immediately after), which gnatprove honours by message"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "prefix.  The proof surface is unchanged "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " still 724/724 VCs, 0"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unproved, 0 justified.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c9-dashboard-chart-filter-diagram-and-credits-fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C9: Dashboard chart, filter, diagram and credits fixes<a class=""headerli"
       & "nk"" href=""#c9-dashboard-chart-filter-diagram-and-credits-fixes"" title=""Link "
       & "to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Pie/donut data numbers are upright: Charts.css rotates each slice"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "value by its midpoint angle, so a full proved ring (0..1 turn)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rendered the "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "724 VCs"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " number rotated 180 degrees.  Overridden to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">transform:</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">none</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The test-category bar chart is sized to its category count (<code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--rows</span></code>),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so a 14-category suite no longer clips its last rows; column charts"
       & ASCII.LF
