       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-29-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.29.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-29-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-26</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.28.0 -&gt; 1.29.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-dev-dependency-metadata-resolved-from-alr-show-into-the-sbom"
       & "-and-dashboard"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Dev-dependency metadata resolved from <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">show</span></cod"
       & "e> into the SBOM and dashboard<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-dev-dependency"
       & "-metadata-resolved-from-alr-show-into-the-sbom-and-dashboard"" title=""Link to"
       & " this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Manifest-declared dependencies "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " dev deps from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "alire-dev.toml</span></code> and base deps"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that no lockfile or GPR with-clause resolved "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " previously appeared name-only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with an empty version and licence and no source link. adacovex now invokes t"
       & "he"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tool-specific <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">a"
       & "lr</span> <span class=""pre"">show</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;crate&gt;</spa"
       & "n></code> (which answers from Alire"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s local index, no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "network access) and parses the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">License:</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">Version:</span></code> and <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Website:</span></code> fields."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The metadata is filled onto the freshly appended entry or, when the crate wa"
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "already resolved from the lockfile (so it keeps its solved identity), patche"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "onto the existing entry when those fields were empty.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The SBOM spec output carries the source reference in all three formats:</"
       & "p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>CycloneDX 1.5: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">externalReferences</span></code> (type <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">website</span></code>) with the source URL.</"
       & "p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>SPDX 2.3: the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">homepage</span></code> field.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Markdown: a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Source</span></code> column in the dependencies table (and a <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">|</span> <span class=""pre"""
       & ">Source</span> <span class=""pre"">|</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "row for the root project).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No garbage links are produced: a URL is only ever taken from the release"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "metadata, never guessed from a PURL. The dashboard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/deps</sp"
       & "an></code> JSON now also"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ships a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">website"
       & "</span></code> field per component.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-dependency-source-links-prefer-the-resolved-repository"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Dependency source links prefer the resolved repository<a class=""head"
       & "erlink"" href=""#c2-dependency-source-links-prefer-the-resolved-repository"" ti"
       & "tle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dep-details Link row picks the resolved <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">website</span></code> when it is a genuine"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">http(s)</span><"
       & "/code> URL, and only falls back to a PURL-derived registry link for the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "well-known registries. The old generic GitHub-search fallback for unknown"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ecosystems is gone, because a search URL for a system or generic dependency "
       & "is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "noise.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-dependency-split-layout"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Dependency split layout<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-dependency-sp"
       & "lit-layout"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Collapsed (no detail selected) the dependency tree and the nomnoml diagra"
       & "m fill"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the full container width. Selecting a dependency activates a split layout: t"
       & "he"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tree/diagram docks to the left column and the detail card slides into a righ"
       & "t"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "column (stacked on small screens). The detail panel moved out of the tree ca"
       & "rd"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so it serves both the Tree and the Diagram views alike.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-diagram-contrast-and-clickable-boxes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Diagram contrast and clickable boxes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-"
       & "diagram-contrast-and-clickable-boxes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>nomnoml draws node titles in the <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">stroke</span></code> colour, which the previous theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "binding set to the muted border (light grey in light mode, near-black in dar"
       & "k"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "mode) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " poor reading contrast on the card fill. The stroke/text now follows the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "primary text colour in both themes. nomnoml renders to a single <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;canvas&gt;</span></code"
       & ">, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "each box is hit-tested against the layout rectangles returned by the draw an"
       & "d a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "click on a box opens its dependency detail panel.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-chart-text-is-upright-bounded-and-readable"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Chart text is upright, bounded and readable<a class=""headerlink"" hre"
       & "f=""#c5-chart-text-is-upright-bounded-and-readable"" title=""Link to this headi"
       & "ng"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Pie/donut labels and values no longer rotate with each slice.  Charts"
       & ".css"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rotates custom properties by the slice midpoint angle, which flipped numbers"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "in large or non-half slices upside down.  They now render with no transform."
       & "</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Horizontal bar category labels are width-bounded with an ellipsis and"
       & " the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rows have a minimum height, so long test-category names no longer clip or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "spill off the left edge of the dashboard.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Dependencies by Scope"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " polar centre now sits on a card-coloured disc, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the centre figure no longer draws directly on the vivid scope gradient (the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "grey <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">9</span></"
       & "code> that was hard to read in the middle of the ring).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-compliance-tab-is-standards-aware"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: Compliance tab is standards-aware<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c6-com"
       & "pliance-tab-is-standards-aware"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Compliance section now renders one achievement gauge per standard"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(DO-178C, ISO 26262, IEC 62304) with that standard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s target integrity level,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "achieved percentage and status "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " whether one standard or all are targeted."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The table lists every standard and its level and status, and highlights the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "targeted standard(s) with a chip and outline. The served dashboard targets a"
       & "ll"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "standards by default, and this brings the compliance chart in line with the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "badges row (which already listed every standard under <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard=all</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-detailed-proof-guidance"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: Detailed proof guidance<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c7-detailed-proo"
       & "f-guidance"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Proof tab gains a "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "How to proceed (Proof Guidance)"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " card that turns the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove unproved counts into concrete next steps per category: Global /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "initialises aspects, initialisation at declaration, loop invariants and rang"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "preconditions, strengthened Pre/Post contracts, Postconditions for functiona"
       & "l"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "checks, and Measure / Decreasing clauses for termination.  When every VC is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proved it reads "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "No unproved VCs "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the proof is complete."
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & "  It reminds the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reader that a justified VC (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">Assume</span></code>) never cou"
       & "nts as proved.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-duplicate-charts-removed-dry"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Duplicate charts removed (DRY)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c8-duplic"
       & "ate-charts-removed-dry"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Charts gallery no longer repeats information shown on the Overview,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Proof and Tests tabs: the SPARK-proof donut (duplicated the Overview radar),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the tests pass/fail donut (duplicated the Overview Tests donut and the Tests"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gauge), the scope stacked bar (duplicated the polar ring) and the docstring"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "radar (duplicated the Overview coverage donut).  Every chart in the dashboar"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now displays a distinct view of the data.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c9-terminal-colour-suppressed-in-ci"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C9: Terminal colour suppressed in CI<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c9-term"
       & "inal-colour-suppressed-in-ci"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>ANSI colour was enabled whenever <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">NO_COLOR</span></code> was unset, so colour escapes cou"
       & "ld"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "garble logs on CI runners, which set <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">CI=true</span></code> but not <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">NO_COLOR</span></code>. Terminal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "colour now additionally requires that <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">CI</span></code> is unset.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c10-american-english-in-live-docs-corrected"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C10: American English in live docs corrected<a class=""headerlink"" href="""
       & "#c10-american-english-in-live-docs-corrected"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Prose Americanisms in the user documentation and API reference were corre"
       & "cted"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to British English (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">behaviour</span></code> -&gt; <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">behaviour</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">analyse</span></code>/<code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">analyse</span></code> -&gt;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">analyse</span><"
       & "/code>) in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs"
       & "/architecture.md</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">docs/proving.md</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/compliance"
       & "/HLR.md</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">docs/api-docs/adacovex-test-format.md</span></code>.  Code"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "identifiers such as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">prefers-color-scheme</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">NO_COLOR</span></code> are untouched.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-dev-dependencies-report-a-real-licence-version-and-source-ur"
       & "l"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: Dev dependencies report a real licence, version and source URL<a cla"
       & "ss=""headerlink"" href=""#h1-dev-dependencies-report-a-real-licence-version-and"
       & "-source-url"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Before this release a dev dependency such as <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatdoc_bin</span></code> appeared in the S"
       & "BOM"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">NOASSERTION<"
       & "/span></code> licence, no version and no source.  <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">show</span><"
       & "/code> now supplies"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GPL-3.0-or-late"
       & "r</span> <span class=""pre"">WITH</span> <span class=""pre"">GCC-exception-3.1</"
       & "span></code>, version <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">26.0.0</span></code> and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">https://github."
       & "com/AdaCore/gnatdoc</span></code> repository, so consumers can identify and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "licence-scan the exact release.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h2-the-dependency-detail-popup-is-reachable-from-the-diagram-vi"
       & "ew"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H2: The dependency detail popup is reachable from the diagram view<a cla"
