       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-3-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.3.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-3-0"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-01</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.1.0 -&gt; 1.3.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-default-target-changed-to-the-current-working-directory"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Default target changed to the current working directory<a class=""hea"
       & "derlink"" href=""#c1-default-target-changed-to-the-current-working-directory"" "
       & "title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Running <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adac"
       & "ovex</span></code> without <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">--target</span></code> now audits the current working"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "directory instead of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">../Ada_CRDT</span></code>. The default target is resolved to an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "absolute path via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">Ada.Directories.Current_Directory</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Impact:</strong> <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">run-self</span></code> no longer "
       & "needs <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--target="
       & ".</span></code>; any directory can"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "be audited by simply running adacovex from it. <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--target=PATH</span></code> still works"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for any other project.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-help-now-exits-cleanly"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--help<"
       & "/span></code> now exits cleanly<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-help-now-exit"
       & "s-cleanly"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--help</span"
       & "></code> prints the usage text and exits with status <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">0</span></code> without scanning or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "assessment. Previously <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">--help</span></code> was parsed but adacovex continued running the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "full pipeline and exited according to the DAL result. A dedicated"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Help_Requested<"
       & "/span></code> field was added to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">CLI_Config</span></code> and handled in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex_main</"
       & "span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-generated-binder-files-removed-from-the-repo"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Generated binder files removed from the repo<a class=""headerlink"" hr"
       & "ef=""#c3-generated-binder-files-removed-from-the-repo"" title=""Link to this he"
       & "ading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The generated <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>b__adacovex_main.*</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">b__test_runner.*</span></code> files were removed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from version control (build artifacts only).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-differential-assessment-compare-base-ref"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Differential assessment (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">--compare-base=REF</span></code>)<a class=""headerlink"" hre"
       & "f=""#c4-differential-assessment-compare-base-ref"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--compar"
       & "e-base=REF</span></code> flag assesses a git base revision in a temporary"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "worktree (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/tmp/"
       & "adacovex-diff-&lt;pid&gt;</span></code>) and prints a side-by-side table aga"
       & "inst"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the current working tree: packages, subprograms, docstring %, HLR traced,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "orphan tags, SPARK level, VCs proved, tests, DAL status. Exit code is <code "
       & "class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">0</span></code> only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "when there is no regression and the current DAL is Achieved.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Implemented in the new non-SPARK <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.Diff</span></code> package (it spawns <code cl"
       & "ass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">git</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GNAT.OS_Lib"
       & "</span></code>), wired into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">adacovex_main</span></code> as <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">Run_Diff</span></code>, with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Compare_Base</s"
       & "pan></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Com"
       & "pare_Base_Len</span></code> added to <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">CLI_Config</span></code>. Rows for proof/test"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "artifacts that the base revision does not commit report <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">N/A</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-hardened-dev-manifest-swap-in-the-makefile"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Hardened dev-manifest swap in the Makefile<a class=""headerlink"" href"
       & "=""#c5-hardened-dev-manifest-swap-in-the-makefile"" title=""Link to this headin"
       & "g"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">_dev_cmd</sp"
       & "an></code> (used by <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">doc</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">fmt</span></code>; <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">prove</span></code> no longer needs it now that"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span"
       & "></code> is a declared dependency of <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">alire.toml</span></code>) snapshots <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.toml</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.lock</spa"
       & "n></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alir"
       & "e.lock.prev</span></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">alire/settings.toml</span></code> into a temp dir,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "swaps in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire-"
       & "dev.toml</span></code>, and restores the snapshots on exit via"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">trap</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">...</span> <span class=""pre"">EXIT</span> <span class=""pre"">IN"
       & "T</span> <span class=""pre"">TERM</span></code>. Interrupted or failed dev com"
       & "mands can no longer"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "leave the manifest or lock files polluted with development dependencies"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(whether or not the lock files are committed). <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">dev-setup</span></code> and <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prod-setup</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "were replaced with guidance stubs. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">alire.toml</span></code> now declares <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code> as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "an explicit dependency (adacovex analyses <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove.out</span></code> and its own"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "self-assessment runs the proof campaign), so <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span><"
       & "/code> works without a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dev-manifest swap; <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">gnatprove</span></code> is the only declared dependency beyond the GNAT"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "runtime (gnatdoc/gnatformat stay dev-only in <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire-dev.toml</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-github-actions-composite-action-ci-pr-gate-and-releases"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: GitHub Actions: composite action, CI, PR gate, and releases<a class="
       & """headerlink"" href=""#c6-github-actions-composite-action-ci-pr-gate-and-releas"
       & "es"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.github/"
       & "actions/adacovex/action.yml</span></code> (install Alire + GNAT toolchain,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cache, build, run the assessment, publish <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">dal-status</span></code>/<code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">spark-level</span></code>/"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test-count</spa"
       & "n></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">cover"
       & "age-pct</span></code> outputs, a Markdown step summary, and SVG badge"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "artifacts), plus three workflows:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.github/"
       & "workflows/ci.yml</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " self-assessment job + build/test job on push"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to main and pull requests.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.github/"
       & "workflows/pr-check.yml</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " runs <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--coverag"
       & "e-delta</span></code> against"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pull_request.ba"
       & "se.sha</span></code> so any PR that drops docstring coverage fails.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.github/"
       & "workflows/release.yml</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " on a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v*</span>"
       & "</code> tag, builds the release binary,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "validates the self-assessment, and creates a GitHub Release with the binary"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tarball (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacov"
       & "ex</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">covex</span></code> alias) and an action"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tarball. The tag itself publishes the action for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">uses:</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">&lt;owner&gt;/adacovex/.github/actions/adacovex&#64;vX.Y.Z</"
       & "span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Alire toolchain is installed from the official"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr-*-bin-x86_6"
       & "4-linux.zip</span></code> release assets, and the GNAT toolchain default is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the index-available <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">15.2.1</span></code>. Dead, build-generated <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">config/covex_config.*</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "files are no longer tracked (gitignored). The release workflow force-pushes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "floating <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vMAJOR"
       & "</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>vMAJOR.MINOR</span></code> tags (e.g. <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">v1</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v1.3</span></code> from <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v1.3.0</span></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plus a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">latest</"
       & "span></code> tag, so the composite action can be consumed as <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;latest</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;v1</span><"
       & "/code>, or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64"
       & ";v1.3</span></code> for the latest matching release; the action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "binary-download step resolves <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">&#64;latest</span></code> (and any floating ref) to the match"
       & "ing"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "release tag, and a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">coverage-pct</span></code> output is also emitted from the docstring"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "percentage in normal mode.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-coverage-gate-coverage-delta-ref"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: Coverage gate (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">--coverage-delta=REF</span></code>)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c7-c"
       & "overage-gate-coverage-delta-ref"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--covera"
       & "ge-delta=REF</span></code> flag for PR-style CI checks: it computes docstrin"
       & "g"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "coverage on a git base ref and the current tree (scan + patches + metrics"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "only, no GNATprove/tests/DAL), prints a compact table and a machine-parseabl"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">coverage_delta:"
       & "</span> <span class=""pre"">base=..</span> <span class=""pre"">current=..</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">regressed=..</span></code> line, and exits <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">1</span></code> when"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "coverage dropped. Works on base refs that do not commit build artifacts and "
       & "is mutually"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "exclusive with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "--compare-base</span></code>. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">release</span></code> now runs "
       & "this"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docstring-coverage gate comparing the last release tag against the current"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tree and aborts if coverage regressed "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the same PR compliance gate, applied"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "between releases.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-binary-named-adacovex-clean-dev-tree"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Binary named <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">adacovex</span></code>, clean dev tree<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c8-"
       & "binary-named-adacovex-clean-dev-tree"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The compiled CLI is now named <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">adacovex</span></code> (via <code class=""docutils literal "
