       & ASCII.LF
       & "        <article role=""main"" id=""furo-main-content"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-30-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.30.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-30-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-26</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.29.0 -&gt; 1.30.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-system-dependencies-get-a-first-class-system-scope"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: System dependencies get a first-class <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">system</span></code> scope<a class=""headerlin"
       & "k"" href=""#c1-system-dependencies-get-a-first-class-system-scope"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dependency graph now models system tools (<code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">python3</span></code>, <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">git</span></code>, <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and more) as a dedicated <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">system</span></code> scope, distinct from <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">base</span></code>, <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">dev</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">transitive</spa"
       & "n></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "vendored</span></code>. The dashboard gives the scope its own filter"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "checkbox, badge colour, and legend entry; the SBOM lists it under <code clas"
       & "s=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">system</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scope; and the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "/api/deps</span></code> JSON reports <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">scope:</span> <span class=""pre"">&quot;system&quot;</sp"
       & "an></code>. A system"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependency"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s detail panel still notes that no external link or licence is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "provisioned "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " only the resolved version is shown. Both the dashboard and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "SBOM run the same <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">Discover_System_Dev_Deps</span></code> discovery, so they show the same"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "system dependencies.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-flexible-ecosystem-licence-resolution"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Flexible ecosystem licence resolution<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2"
       & "-flexible-ecosystem-licence-resolution"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Read_Vendor_"
       & "Manifest</span></code> reads the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">license</span></code> field from each vendored package"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">packa"
       & "ge.json</span></code> for npm/pnpm, <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">Cargo.toml</span></code> for cargo,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pyproject.toml<"
       & "/span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">c"
       & "omposer.json</span></code> for pypi/composer) and carries it onto the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "SBOM component and the dashboard detail panel. When the local manifest carri"
       & "es"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "no licence, the new <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">Resolve_Ecosystem_Metadata</span></code> resolver falls back to the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "package registry. The resolver dispatches on the ecosystem (the PURL type)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "through a single static table, so adding a language is one row rather than a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "new code path:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>npm</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">npm</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">view</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;pkg&gt;</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">license</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>pnpm</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pnpm</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">show</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;pkg&gt;</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">license</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>cargo</strong> (Rust) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">cargo</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">search</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;pkg&gt;</span></code>, "
       & "with the SPDX id read from the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">(license:</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">...)</span></code> token in the output.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>go</strong> and other ecosystems with no portable, reliable r"
       & "egistry query keep"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "an empty licence; the vendored manifest scanner still reads any in-repo"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "licence file.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The fallback runs only when the offline read finds nothing, so a vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "package that ships a licence never touches the network.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The bundled third-party libraries that the dashboard vendors (Charts.css,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "FlexSearch, nomnoml, graphre) now report their known upstream licence (MIT o"
       & "r"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Apache-2.0) from a built-in table. The Credits tab and the SBOM therefore li"
       & "st"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "them with a licence rather than a blank.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-dependency-detail-panel-is-the-single-richer-source-dry"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Dependency detail panel is the single, richer source (DRY)<a class="""
       & "headerlink"" href=""#c3-dependency-detail-panel-is-the-single-richer-source-dr"
       & "y"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dependency detail panel is now the one place that shows a dependency"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "full detail. It adds the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">Language</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">Description</span></code> fields (already present"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/deps</s"
       & "pan></code>) and a per-dependency system-tool note, so the Tree and Diagram"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "views open the same, complete panel instead of each carrying a partial copy."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/deps</"
       & "span></code> JSON gains a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">description</span></code> field to support this.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-e2e-tooling-reorganised"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: e2e tooling reorganised<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-e2e-tooling-r"
       & "eorganised"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The ad-hoc <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">r"
       & "epro*.mjs</span></code> scripts at the root of <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tests/e2e/</span></code> moved into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tests/e2e/repro"
       & "/</span></code> so the suite root holds only the Playwright config, the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "spec, and the server bootstrap. The spec gains assertions for the split-view"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "toggle and the system-dependency badge.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-no-source-file-may-exceed-10-of-the-codebase"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: No source file may exceed 10% of the codebase<a class=""headerlink"" h"
       & "ref=""#c5-no-source-file-may-exceed-10-of-the-codebase"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The complexity gate now rejects any source file that exceeds 10% of the t"
       & "otal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "codebase size (the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Max_File_Pct</span></code> gate in <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">adacovex_main.adb</span></code>), so a single"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "god object"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " can no longer dominate the tree. The gate counts only real"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subprogram-bearing code "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " comments, blanks, and inline specs are excluded "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and fails loudly with the offending file and its share; <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">compl"
       & "exity-check</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "exits non-zero when the cap is breached.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-complexity-report-reads-like-tokei"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: Complexity report reads like tokei<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c6-co"
       & "mplexity-report-reads-like-tokei"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">complexity</span></code> now prints a tokei-style summ"
       & "ary (total files, lines,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "code, comments, blanks, and the codebase loc percentage) followed by a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "per-file table. Each per-file row reports <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">Lines=</span></code>, <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Code=</span></code>, <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Comments=</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Blanks=</span><"
       & "/code>, the loc percentage, and the cyclomatic complexity <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">cx=</span></code>, with a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "legend line <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Per"
       & "-file</span> <span class=""pre"">(Lines</span> <span class=""pre"">/</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">Code</span> <span class=""pre"">/</span> <span class=""pre"">Comme"
       & "nts</span> <span class=""pre"">/</span> <span class=""pre"">Blanks</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">/</span> <span class=""pre"">loc</span> <span class=""pre"">%</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">/</span> <span class=""pre"">cx):</span></code>."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Over-long comment blocks and dash-only separator lines are classified as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "comments, not code, so the counts match a plain <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">wc</span></code>-style read.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-registry-lookups-fetch-version-website-and-licence-in-one-ca"
       & "ll"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: Registry lookups fetch version, website, and licence in one call<a c"
       & "lass=""headerlink"" href=""#c7-registry-lookups-fetch-version-website-and-licen"
       & "ce-in-one-call"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Resolve_Ecos"
       & "ystem_Metadata</span></code> now resolves the version, website, and licence"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for a vendored package from the registry CLI (previously licence-only), and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">show</span></code> is folded into the same dispatch table so t"
       & "he three fields come from"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "one place for every ecosystem. The npm and pnpm rows issue a single"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">view</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">&lt;pkg&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">version</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">license</span> <span class=""pre"">homepage</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "--json</span></code> call and parse the JSON, so they"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "boot node once per component instead of once per field "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a 3x reduction in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subprocess starts that removes the main responsiveness cost the dependency"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "graph build paid on vendored JavaScript trees (and, by extension, on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">prove</span></code>, which builds the graph before gnatprove)"
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-bundled-dashboard-assets-resolve-their-licence-live"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Bundled dashboard assets resolve their licence live<a class=""headerl"
       & "ink"" href=""#c8-bundled-dashboard-assets-resolve-their-licence-live"" title=""L"
       & "ink to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The four vendored dashboard libraries (Charts.css, FlexSearch, nomnoml,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "graphre) no longer carry a hard-coded licence in the SBOM builder.  When a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "loose vendored copy is scanned, the builder resolves the licence (and websit"
       & "e)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from the package registry through <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">Resolve_Ecosystem_Metadata</span></code>, preferring"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pnpm</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">show</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;pkg&gt;</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">license</span></code> and falling back to <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">npm</span></code>, <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">yarn</span></code>, then <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">bun</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "same preference chain used for every JavaScript component.  The SBOM and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Credits tab therefore track the real upstream licence instead of a built-in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "copy that could drift.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c9-registry-metadata-is-cached-per-project-so-warm-runs-skip-no"
       & "de"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C9: Registry metadata is cached per project, so warm runs skip node<a cl"
       & "ass=""headerlink"" href=""#c9-registry-metadata-is-cached-per-project-so-warm-r"
       & "uns-skip-node"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Resolve_Ecos"
       & "ystem_Metadata</span></code> now caches each package"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s licence, version, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "website in a per-project store under the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s result cache (the same"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--cache-dir</sp"
       & "an></code> the scan uses, so a project that sets its own cache gets an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "isolated meta store), keyed by the target directory as well as the ecosystem"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and package name, with the same 7-day TTL as the system-tool probe cache.  T"
       & "he"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "content-addressed result cache does not cover these registry calls (each one"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "boots node for npm/pnpm), so a "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "warm"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span"
       & "></code> run still paid for them "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "residual slowness on <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> after the result cac"
       & "he had already been"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "served.  The meta cache removes that cost: the first run resolves and caches"
       & ","
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and every later run (warm result cache or not) serves the answer from disk w"
       & "ith"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "zero subprocess spawns.  Keying by the target also means two projects that"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "share a cache directory never serve each other"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s resolved licence or version.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-dependency-split-view-detail-panel-works-from-tree-and-diagr"
       & "am"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: Dependency split-view detail panel works from Tree and Diagram<a cla"
       & "ss=""headerlink"" href=""#h1-dependency-split-view-detail-panel-works-from-tree"
       & "-and-diagram"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>1.29.0 claimed the split layout but the activating class was applied to t"
       & "he"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "wrong element (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "#tab-deps</span></code> instead of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">.dep-split</span></code>), so the flex split never"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "engaged and clicking a dependency showed nothing. The class now toggles on t"
       & "he"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.dep-split</spa"
       & "n></code> container, so selecting a dependency from either the Tree or the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Diagram view docks the view on the left and opens the detail card on the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "right. By default (no selection) the view fills the container; the split"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "appears only on selection.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
