       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-32-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.32.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-32-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-28</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.31.0 -&gt; 1.32.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-proof-metrics-synced-to-the-honest-723-vc-count"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Proof metrics synced to the honest 723-VC count<a class=""headerlink"""
       & " href=""#c1-proof-metrics-synced-to-the-honest-723-vc-count"" title=""Link to t"
       & "his heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The self-assessment proof surface had grown to 723 VCs after the <code cl"
       & "ass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">Server.</span> <span class=""pre"">HTTP.</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "Route</span></code> postcondition was converted from a nine-clause implicati"
       & "on chain (which exceeded gnatprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--steps</span"
       & "></code> budget once the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">/docs</span></code> route was added) into an expression function.<"
       & "/p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>An expression function"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s implicit postcondition (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Result</span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;ma"
       & "pping&gt;</span></code>) holds by definition, so the mapping is proved witho"
       & "ut case-analysis steps. All metric anchors across AGENTS.md, README.md, Make"
       & "file, the release manifests, and the Alire index were refreshed to 723 VCs v"
       & "ia <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">proof-status</span></code>. Proof level remains</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Platinum</strong> (723 VCs, 0 unproved, 0 justified under gnatpro"
       & "ve 16.1.0).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-svg-badges-restored-to-shields-io-proportions"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: SVG badges restored to Shields.io proportions<a class=""headerlink"" h"
       & "ref=""#c2-svg-badges-restored-to-shields-io-proportions"" title=""Link to this "
       & "heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The badge renderer had drifted away from the Shields.io style: font-size "
       & "was"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "16px on a 28px-tall badge with 20px side padding, so the label and value tex"
       & "t"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dominated the box. Geometry is now restored to the compact Shields.io"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proportions "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " font-size 11px, badge height 20px, corner radius 3px, text"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "baseline y=14, and 10px side padding (20px total). The pure sizing math"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Glyph_Width</s"
       & "pan></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Te"
       & "xt_Width</span></code>) still bounds every segment at font-size 11, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "badges stay provable and visually consistent with Shields.io.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-nomnoml-dependency-diagram-reads-left-to-right"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: nomnoml dependency diagram reads left-to-right<a class=""headerlink"" "
       & "href=""#c3-nomnoml-dependency-diagram-reads-left-to-right"" title=""Link to thi"
       & "s heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dependency hierarchy diagram rendered root-at-top with children flowi"
       & "ng"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "left-to-right (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "#direction:</span> <span class=""pre"">down</span></code>). It now renders the"
       & " root on the left and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the children stacked top-to-bottom on the right (<code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">#direction:</span> <span class=""pre"">right"
       & "</span></code>), which"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reads as a left-to-right dependency flow. The canvas height now scales with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the child-node count (72px header + 46px per node, 320px minimum) instead of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a fixed 600px, so every box stays large enough to read and click regardless "
       & "of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "graph size.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-charts-tab-label-and-data-overlap-removed"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Charts tab label and data overlap removed<a class=""headerlink"" href="
       & """#c4-charts-tab-label-and-data-overlap-removed"" title=""Link to this heading"""
       & ">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Proof Check Types"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " column chart rotated its category labels vertically"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "into a 96px-tall slot, so long labels ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Termination"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Functional"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ") clipped"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and overlapped their neighbours. The label slot is now 120px (chart height"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "340px) with clipping disabled, giving every rotated label the room it needs."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The bar chart"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s per-row data labels (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">.data</span></code>) now carry a translucent card"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "background and a small horizontal pad, so values on short bars no longer"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "collide with neighbouring rows. Verified against the dashboard e2e layout"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tests.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-overview-tab-adds-a-dependency-scope-polar-chart"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Overview tab adds a dependency-scope polar chart<a class=""headerlink"
       & """ href=""#c5-overview-tab-adds-a-dependency-scope-polar-chart"" title=""Link to"
       & " this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Overview tab"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s collation charts gained a "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Dependency Scope"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " polar area"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "chart. It renders the resolved graph"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s scope split (base / dev / transitive /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vendored / system) as a conic-gradient ring with a centre total count and a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "per-scope legend, giving an at-a-glance view of the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s dependency"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "composition alongside the existing Robustness, SPARK Proof, Tests, and Doc"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Coverage charts. The overview chart-card count in the e2e layout suite was"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "raised from four to five to match.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Test Suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#test-suite"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>973 tests (unchanged). No test logic changed: the proof fix is a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "postcondition-only rewrite, the badge and chart changes are presentational,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the nomnoml direction/height change is client-side JavaScript. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">dashboard.spec."
       & "ts</span></code> overview assertion was updated to expect five chart cards.<"
       & "/p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""proof-results"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Proof Results<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#proof-results"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 723/723 VCs proved across 50 analysed units (was 724 at 1.31.0)"
       & ". The one-VC reduction comes from converting `Adacovex. Server. HTTP.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Route<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">to</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">an</span> <span class=""pre"">expression</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">function:</span> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">exp"
       & "licit</span> <span class=""pre"">nine-clause</span> <span class=""pre"">postcond"
       & "ition</span> <span class=""pre"">(one</span> <span class=""pre"">VC</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">that</span> <span class=""pre"">sat</span> <span class=""pre"">on</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">solver's</span> <span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">step-limit</span> <span class=""pre"">boundary)</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">is</span> <span class=""pre"">replaced</span> <span class=""pre"">by</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">implicit</span> <span class"
