       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-33-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.33.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-33-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-28</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.32.0 -&gt; 1.33.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-test-scope-dependencies-sbom-and-dashboard"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Test-scope dependencies (SBOM and dashboard)<a class=""headerlink"" hr"
       & "ef=""#c1-test-scope-dependencies-sbom-and-dashboard"" title=""Link to this head"
       & "ing"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A new <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test</"
       & "span></code> dependency scope joins <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">base</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">dev</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">transitive</span></code>, <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vendored</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">system</spa"
       & "n></code>.  A dependency is classified <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">test</span></code> when it is used only by the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s tests:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>a crate declared under a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">[[test-depends-on]]</span></code> section of <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.toml</span></code> or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire-dev.toml<"
       & "/span></code> (the manifest label the parser picks up); or</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>a library with-claused only from a <strong>test project file</strong>"
       & ": a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.gpr</span>"
       & "</code> under a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tests/</span></"
       & "code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test/</s"
       & "pan></code> or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "t/</span></code> directory, or a test-named project such as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test_runner.gpr"
       & "</span></code>.  The classification propagates to everything the test"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "project pulls in transitively.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The scope is surfaced everywhere the others are: the SBOM"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex:dep_sc"
       & "ope</span></code> property (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">&quot;test&quot;</span></code>), the dashboard dependency tree"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "badge, the scope filter checkbox, the scope-stack legend, and the polar"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rings on the Overview and Charts tabs.  <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">Collect_GPR_Files</span></code> now collects"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.gpr</span></co"
       & "de> files under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">tests/</span></code>, which it previously skipped, so test harness"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "projects resolve as dependencies in the first place.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-robust-version-probing-go-version-flag-fallbacks"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Robust version probing (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">go</span> <span class=""pre"">version</span></code>, flag fal"
       & "lbacks)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-robust-version-probing-go-version-fla"
       & "g-fallbacks"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The version probe now runs <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">go</span> <span class=""pre"">version</span></code> for the <co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">go</span></code> t"
       & "ool (it accepted no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "flag before, so <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">go</span></code> always reported an empty version).  Probing is robust"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "across tools: the probe tries the tool"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s configured flag first, then falls"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "back through <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--"
       & "version</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">-v</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">version</span></code>, and takes the first successful"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "run.  <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">fossil</s"
       & "pan></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">git-lfs</span></code> keep their <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">version</span></code> subcommand; the fallbacks"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cover any tool whose configured flag fails.  Version tokens are cleaned:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">go</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">version</span> <span class=""pre"">go1.21.5</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">...</span></code> reports <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">1.21.5</span></code> (leading <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">go</span></code> stripped, local"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "build tags cut at <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">:</span></code>), and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">node</span> <span class=""pre"">--version</span></code> reports <cod"
       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">26.7.0</span></code"
       & "> instead of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v26.7.0</span><"
       & "/code>.  The probe-file and tool-set cache namespaces were salted (<code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.v2</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">|tools-v3|<"
       & "/span></code>) so stale 1.32 probe results are never served.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-alire-dependency-versions-resolved-via-alr-show"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Alire dependency versions resolved via <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">show</span></co"
       & "de><a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-alire-dependency-versions-resolved-via-al"
       & "r-show"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">show</span></code> prints the release as <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;crate&gt;=&lt;version&gt;:</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">&lt;description&gt;</span></code> on the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "first line and the licence under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">License:</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " not the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Versio"
       & "n:</span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Licenses:</span"
       & "></code> keys the resolver expected, so manifest-declared Alire crates"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(gnatprove, gnatdoc_bin, gnatformat_bin, and any other <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[[depends-on]]</span></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "always reported an empty version and licence.  The <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire</span></code> ecosystem row now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "parses the first-line <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">&lt;crate&gt;=&lt;version&gt;</span></code> form for the version and "
       & "the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">License:</span>"
       & "</code> line for the licence.  The adacovex self-SBOM now records"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">16.1.0</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatdoc_bin</span> <span class=""pre"">26.0.0</span"
       & "></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gn"
       & "atformat_bin</span> <span class=""pre"">26.0.0</span></code> (all"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">dev</span></cod"
       & "e> scope) instead of empty versions.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-hard-coded-vendored-library-table-removed-from-the-parser"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Hard-coded vendored-library table removed from the parser<a class=""h"
       & "eaderlink"" href=""#c4-hard-coded-vendored-library-table-removed-from-the-pars"
       & "er"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The parser no longer carries a hard-coded table mapping the bundled"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard files to npm package names and versions (flexsearch 0.7.31,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "nomnoml 1.7.0, graphre 0.1.3, charts.css 1.2.0).  Vendored components are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now discovered from the data:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>the component name is the file"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own base name;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>the version is read from the file"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own banner comment when it carries one"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(for example <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Fl"
       & "exSearch.js</span> <span class=""pre"">v0.7.31</span> <span class=""pre"">(Bundl"
       & "e)</span></code>);</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>the licence and website are resolved live from the package registry u"
       & "nder"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that same name when the registry knows it (flexsearch, nomnoml, graphre);"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "an asset the registry does not know keeps a <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">pkg:generic</span></code> PURL and no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "guessed metadata.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The authored dashboard modules under <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">resources/css/</span></code> and <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources/js/</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are never componentised: those directories hold the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own code, not"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vendored packages.  The Credits tab keeps its curated table of the bundled"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "libraries; the SBOM describes what is actually on disk.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-dashboard-search-finds-page-content"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Dashboard search finds page content<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c5-d"
       & "ashboard-search-finds-page-content"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The header search index was case-sensitive: queries were lowercased but t"
       & "he"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "full-text index of each tab"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s rendered content was not, so page text such as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Orphan Tags"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " (or any HLR tag) could not be found.  The index is now folded"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to lowercase, so searching <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">orphan</span></code>, a package name, or an HLR tag finds the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tab that holds it.  Dependency names, versions, scopes, licences and PURLs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stay indexed as before.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-dependency-diagram-rendered-as-svg-with-real-clickable-nodes"
       & """>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: Dependency diagram rendered as SVG with real clickable nodes<a class"
       & "=""headerlink"" href=""#c6-dependency-diagram-rendered-as-svg-with-real-clickab"
       & "le-nodes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The nomnoml dependency diagram is now rendered as SVG (<code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">nomnoml.renderSvg</span></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instead of a bitmap canvas.  Every node is real geometry: each box (and its"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "label) is clickable with its exact hitbox "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no manual canvas hit-testing"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and no zoom-math drift "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " and opens the same split-view detail panel as the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tree.  The diagram scales with its <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">viewBox</span></code>, so boxes are never upside"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "down or clipped, long labels no longer overflow their boxes, and a wide"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "graph scrolls horizontally inside the card.  Hovering a node shows a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tooltip with the dependency name and version.  "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Download SVG"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "serialises the rendered SVG instead of rasterising the canvas.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-hand-rolled-charts-replace-the-vendored-charts-css"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: Hand-rolled charts replace the vendored Charts.css<a class=""headerli"
       & "nk"" href=""#c7-hand-rolled-charts-replace-the-vendored-charts-css"" title=""Lin"
       & "k to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dashboard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s metrics charts no longer depend on the vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://chartscss.org/"">Charts.css</a> f"
       & "ramework (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resou"
       & "rces/charts.min.css</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">charts-"
       & "patch.css</span></code> overlay are deleted).  The Credits tab and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES still credit Charts.css "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " as <strong>inspiration</strong> (MIT,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "not bundled): the dashboard ships its own patched, hand-rolled charts that"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "borrow Charts.css"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s ring-and-segment visual language.  All six chart cards"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are now hand-rolled with plain CSS/SVG, which fixes the rendering problems"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the framework introduced:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Donuts</strong> (SPARK Proof, Tests Pass/Fail, Overview Tests"
       & ", Overview Doc"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Coverage) are conic-gradient rings with a CSS hole "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the same pattern"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "as the polar ring.  The ring colour reflects the covered share: fully"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "green at 100% (previously every slice resolved to the same green,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so partial coverage never showed red), with green + red segments for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "partial coverage.  The centre hole carries the value and caption, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "because the ring is a fixed-size block (not an absolutely positioned"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "table cell) the readout line below never overlaps the chart.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Proof Check Types</strong> and <strong>Test Results by Catego"
       & "ry</strong> are flex rows"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with a fixed, ellipsising label column and a track bar (green proved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "share with a red unproved remainder for proof categories).  The old"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "column chart rotated its labels with a custom <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">rotate-labels</span></code> class"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that Charts.css does not define, which produced overlapping label"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "boxes and text overflow; the new rows never rotate and long category"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "names ellipsise instead of overflowing.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Overview tab"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s Tests donut also keeps its readout line"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">N</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">passed,</span> <span class=""pre"">M</span> <span class=""pre"">fai"
       & "led</span></code> below the ring), so the pass/fail numbers stay"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "visible.  The charts remain dependency-free and follow the theme via CSS"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "variables.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-dashboard-html-css-js-modularised"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Dashboard HTML/CSS/JS modularised<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c8-das"
       & "hboard-html-css-js-modularised"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The single authored <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">dashboard.js</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">dashboard.css</span></code> are split into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "per-concern modules under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">resources/js/</span></code> (theme, tabs, deps, details,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "nomnoml diagram, search) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">resources/css/</span></code> (base styles including the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hand-rolled donut/bar chart styles).  The page shell inlines each module"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "at its own placeholder; <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">tools/gen-dashboard.py</span></code> bundles them in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependency order (vendored libraries first, then authored modules).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c9-test-labelled-vendored-dependencies-across-every-ecosystem"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C9: Test-labelled vendored dependencies across every ecosystem<a class="""
       & "headerlink"" href=""#c9-test-labelled-vendored-dependencies-across-every-ecosy"
       & "stem"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>C1 classifies <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>test</span></code> scope from Alire manifests and test project files."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Vendored components (packages under <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">node_modules</span></code>, <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vendor/</span></code>, and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "other vendored roots) are now classified <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">test</span></code> the same way, across every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "supported ecosystem:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Section labels</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">package.json</span></code> sections whose key conta"
       & "ins <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test</span>"
       & "</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(for example <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">te"
       & "stDependencies</span></code> or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">devTestDependencies</span></code>), Cargo"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[dev-dependenci"
       & "es]</span></code> (Cargo"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s native test-only section) plus any"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "section containing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">test</span></code>, composer"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">require-dev</"
       & "span></code>, Gemfile"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">group</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">:test</span></code> blocks, <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">pom.xml</span></code> <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;scope&gt;test&lt;/scope&gt;</span></"
       & "code> dependencies,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pyproject.toml<"
       & "/span></code> test extras and Poetry <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">[tool.poetry.group.test.*]</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "sections, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">P"
       & "ackage.swift</span></code> dependencies declared inside a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.testTarget(..."
       & ")</span></code> block.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>The name heuristic</strong> (test pre/suffix): a component wh"
       & "ose name starts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "or ends with the literal word <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">test</span></code> is test-labelled.  The heuristic"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now works across every ecosystem "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " not just npm "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " by checking the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "full name and then the last segment after any <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/</span></code> or <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">:</span></code>, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;playwright"
       & "/test</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">test-case</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">github.com/stretchr/testify</span></code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">org.testng:test"
       & "ng</span></code> all match.  Ecosystems without a native test-only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "section (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">go.mod"
       & "</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">requirements*.txt</span></code>) rely on this heuristic.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Lockfiles</strong>: the name heuristic also applies to lockfi"
       & "le-resolved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "names "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pnpm-lock.yaml"
       & "</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>package-lock.json</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">yarn.lock</span></code> next to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "an owner <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">packag"
       & "e.json</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">Cargo.lock</span></code> crate names, and <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.lock</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "crates that the manifest sets leave transitive.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The e2e fixture"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;playwrig"
       & "ht/test</span></code> is the canonical case: it stays a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">devDependencies"
       & "</span></code> entry of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">tests/e2e/package.json</span></code> (and a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pnpm-lock.yaml<"
       & "/span></code> entry) and is classified <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">test</span></code> by name.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c10-overview-pairing-hoverable-scope-ring-scaled-proof-bars-wid"
       & "er-diagram"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C10: Overview pairing, hoverable scope ring, scaled proof bars, wider di"
       & "agram<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c10-overview-pairing-hoverable-scope-ring-"
       & "scaled-proof-bars-wider-diagram"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Four dashboard layout improvements:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Overview row pairing</strong>: the <strong>Doc Coverage</stro"
       & "ng> donut and the"
