       & "with the scope name and its component count (for example <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test:</span> <span class=""pre"">3</"
       & "span></code>), and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the segment"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s opacity rises on hover.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Proof Check Types scaling</strong>: the proof-category bars n"
       & "ow scale with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the category"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s magnitude exactly like the test-category bars "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the"
