       & "the card; deep graphs still scroll.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Test Suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#test-suite"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Native suite grows to 1063 tests (14 categories).  The HTML/Markdown"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "renderer suite adds checks that the dashboard charts are hand-rolled:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "full and partial donut gradients (green at 100%, green+red split for"
