       & ASCII.LF
       & "remains in the served page.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>989 tests (was 973).  The SBOM generator suite gained 16 tests:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[[test-d"
       & "epends-on]]</span></code> crates in the publishing and dev manifests are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "classified <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Scop"
       & "e_Test</span></code> (base deps stay base);</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>a library with-claused only from a <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">tests/</span></code> harness project is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Scope_Test</spa"
