       & "<li><p>lockfile-resolved names: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">&#64;playwright/test</span></code> via <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pnpm-lock.yaml</span></code> and"
