       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-35-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.35.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-35-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-29</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.34.0 -&gt; 1.35.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-configurable-dashboard-worker-count"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Configurable dashboard worker count<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-c"
       & "onfigurable-dashboard-worker-count"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve-work"
       & "ers=N</span></code> sets the HTTP server task-pool size for <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(default 4).  Raise it to serve more concurrent dashboard requests; lower it"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to use less memory.  The value is rejected unless <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code> is also given, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a silent no-op is impossible.  The bound is <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">Positive</span></code>; the pool still caps at"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "its internal maximum.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-css-4px-spacing-gate-and-build-time-minification"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: CSS 4px spacing gate and build-time minification<a class=""headerlink"
       & """ href=""#c2-css-4px-spacing-gate-and-build-time-minification"" title=""Link to"
       & " this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/csslin"
       & "t.py</span></code> enforces the dashboard spacing convention: every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">margin</span></"
       & "code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">padding<"
       & "/span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">gap</span></code> pixel length must be a multiple of 4px.  It runs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "as a cheap static gate inside <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">build</span></code> and <code c"
       & "lass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">check</span></code>.  The authored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "CSS and JavaScript are minified at build time by <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-dashboard.py</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(comments stripped, whitespace collapsed) before they are bundled into the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "served dashboard.  The vendored graph libraries are already minified and are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "inlined byte-for-byte.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-four-sentence-paragraph-gate-for-hand-written-docs"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Four-sentence paragraph gate for hand-written docs<a class=""headerli"
       & "nk"" href=""#c3-four-sentence-paragraph-gate-for-hand-written-docs"" title=""Lin"
       & "k to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/check-"
       & "docs.py</span></code> (wired as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">docs-check</span></code>) fai"
       & "ls when any paragraph"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "in the user documentation, README, or human changelogs exceeds four"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "sentences.  It also rejects em dashes and Latin abbreviations (<code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">i.e.</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">e.g.</span></co"
       & "de>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">etc.</span"
       & "></code>) to keep the prose under Simplified Technical English."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/para-spli"
       & "t.py</span></code> rewraps over-long paragraphs to comply.  The generated"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/api-docs</"
       & "span></code> pages are excluded; their source docstrings carry the same"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rule.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-timezone-support-with-os-aware-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Timezone support with OS-aware default<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c"
       & "4-timezone-support-with-os-aware-default"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--tz</span><"
       & "/code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--time"
       & "zone</span></code> override the display zone for <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">status</span></code> reports."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Accepted forms are an IANA name (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">Asia/Singapore</span></code>) or a fixed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">UTC</span></cod"
       & "e>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GMT</span></"
       & "code> offset (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">U"
       & "TC+8</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">GMT+8</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">UTC+08</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">GMT+08</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">UTC+08:30</span></code>).  With"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "no override, adacovex now honours the operating system"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s wall-clock zone"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "through <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.Cal"
       & "endar.Time_Zones.UTC_Time_Offset</span></code> (which reads the <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">TZ</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "variable and the system timezone) and shows it as <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">UTC+/-HH:MM</span></code>.  A named"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "zone resolves from a built-in table of common IANA names; a zone that may"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "observe daylight saving time, or one the table lacks, is probed against the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "platform tzdata (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>zdump</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">date</span> <span class=""pre"">+%z</span></code>) for the DST-correc"
       & "t current offset,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with the table as the fallback when the probe is unavailable.  <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">status</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">status</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">--export</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">status</span> <span class=""pre"">--metrics</span"
       & "></code> report the resolved zone, the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "current date and time, and the count of dated release changelogs under the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "target.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-complexity-check-extended-to-non-ada-source"">"
       & ASCII.LF
