       & "s=EXT,EXT</span></code> skips listed file extensions and is rejected"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unless the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">comp"
       & "lexity</span></code> subcommand is given, so it can never run on its own."
       & ASCII.LF
