       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-ansi-colour-on-the-terminal-report"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: ANSI colour on the terminal report<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c6-an"
       & "si-colour-on-the-terminal-report"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.Ans"
       & "i</span></code> colours the terminal output (red for failures, green for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "passes, bold for headings).  Colour is disabled automatically inside CI"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">CI</span><"
       & "/code> variable), under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">NO_COLOR</span></code>, or with <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">TERM=dumb</span></code>, so CI logs stay"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plain and machine-readable.  The complexity report and the main header use"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "it.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-agents-md-keeps-documentation-current"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: AGENTS.md keeps documentation current<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c7"
       & "-agents-md-keeps-documentation-current"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A new note in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>AGENTS.md</span></code> states that every change must update the relevant"
