       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">action-parity-c"
       & "heck</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">agents-tree</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">doc-links</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">link-check</span></code>).  This makes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the expectation explicit that LLM-assisted edits keep docs in step with code"
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-status-default-zone-now-follows-the-operating-system"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: Status default zone now follows the operating system<a class=""header"
       & "link"" href=""#h1-status-default-zone-now-follows-the-operating-system"" title="
       & """Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The previous timezone default ignored the system zone and fell back to UT"
       & "C"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unless a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">TZ</sp"
       & "an></code> variable or a Debian <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">/etc/timezone</span></code> file named a zone."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Timezones.Defau"
