       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Test Suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#test-suite"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The native suite grows from 1066 to 1157 tests (16 categories).  The CLI"
