       & "<h1>adacovex 1.37.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-37-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-30</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.36.0 -&gt; 1.37.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-api-playground-tab"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: API playground tab<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-api-playground-tab"
       & """ title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dashboard now has an <strong>API</strong> tab that works as an intera"
       & "ctive REST"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "client. Every endpoint the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">--serve</span></code> server dispatches on is listed as a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "clickable button, grouped by purpose (Metrics, Dependencies, Badges,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Documentation). A filter input searches the endpoints as you type, matching"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the path, description, and group name.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Clicking an endpoint issues a live <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">fetch</span></code> against the serving origin and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "previews the response. JSON endpoints are pretty-printed and syntax"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "highlighted with the vendored yace tokenizer, with object keys coloured"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "separately from string values. SVG badge endpoints show the live image above"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the raw markup. A toolbar offers <strong>Copy</strong> and <strong>Download<"
       & "/strong> for the raw"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "response body, so the playground doubles as a lightweight HTTP client withou"
       & "t"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "leaving the browser.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The first endpoint (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">/api/metrics</span></code>) runs automatically, so the tab always"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "opens with a live preview. The endpoint list is not hardcoded in client"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JavaScript: the playground fetches it from the new <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GET</span> <span class=""pre"">/api/endpoi"
       & "nts</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "endpoint, the single catalog the server declares. Each request is made live"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "against the instance, so what you preview is exactly what <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">curl</span></code> returns.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-charts-tab-is-a-strict-superset-of-the-overview-charts"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Charts tab is a strict superset of the Overview charts<a class=""head"
       & "erlink"" href=""#c2-charts-tab-is-a-strict-superset-of-the-overview-charts"" ti"
       & "tle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <strong>Charts</strong> tab now leads with the same two radars that h"
       & "eadline the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Overview: the <strong>Robustness</strong> five-axis radar with its S/A/B/C/D"
       & " tier rating,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the <strong>SPARK proof-by-check-type</strong> radar. Both are shared wi"
       & "th the Overview"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(one source of truth in the renderer), so every Overview chart appears on th"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Charts tab and the two tabs cannot drift apart. The Charts tab now renders"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "eight cards.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-vendored-yace-for-json-syntax-highlighting"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Vendored yace for JSON syntax highlighting<a class=""headerlink"" href"
       & "=""#c3-vendored-yace-for-json-syntax-highlighting"" title=""Link to this headin"
       & "g"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex vendors the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">code()</span></code> tokenizer highlighter from"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/petersolopov/yace"">pe"
       & "tersolopov/yace</a> (MIT, v1.1.0) as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources/js/ya"
       & "ce.js</span></code>, exposed as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">window.YaceTok</span></code>. The API playground uses"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "it to syntax-highlight the prettified JSON responses of the <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/*</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "endpoints. The tokenizer is adapted from ESM/TypeScript to a single"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plain-script binding so the dashboard needs no build step; the tokenizer"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "logic is unchanged. The dashboard supplies the token colours via theme-aware"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "CSS. yace is credited on the Credits tab and in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-serve-semantics-clarified-and-serve-workers-documented-as-a-"
       & "related-flag"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve"
       & "</span></code> semantics clarified and <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">--serve-workers</span></code> documented as a relate"
       & "d flag<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-serve-semantics-clarified-and-serve-wo"
       & "rkers-documented-as-a-related-flag"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve<"
       & "/span></code> flag description now states clearly that it is a switch: passi"
       & "ng"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span><"
       & "/code> is the only way to start the HTTP dashboard server, and omitting it"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(the default, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">o"
       & "ff</span></code>) renders and exits without serving. There is no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--no-serve</spa"
       & "n></code>, because the flag already controls it. The man page and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Related CLI flags table in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">docs/dashboard.md</span></code> now list <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve-workers</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "alongside <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--por"
       & "t</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">--theme</span></code> as a related <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code> flag, with its own"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "description (default 4, capped at 256, only meaningful with <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code>). The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard docs also note that the server strips query strings and fragments"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "before routing, so <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">/?theme=light</span></code> works.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-more-actionable-information"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: More actionable information<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c5-more-acti"
       & "onable-information"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The API playground gives users an actionable way to inspect the live"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "assessment data: preview every endpoint, copy the exact JSON for scripting,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and download the raw response. Combined with the strict-superset Charts tab,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the dashboard now surfaces the same health data in more explorable and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "machine-consumable forms.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-theme-light-dark-system-on-the-dashboard-url-returned-404"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">?theme="
       & "light|dark|system</span></code> on the dashboard URL returned 404<a class=""h"
       & "eaderlink"" href=""#h1-theme-light-dark-system-on-the-dashboard-url-returned-4"
       & "04"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The HTTP server routed on the raw request path, including the query strin"
       & "g"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and fragment. A browser requesting <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">http://localhost:8080/?theme=light</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "produced a path of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">/?theme=light</span></code>, which did not match any route and served"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">404</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">Not</span> <span class=""pre"">Found</span></code> instead of th"
       & "e themed dashboard. The server now strips the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "query string and fragment before routing (<code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">Strip_Query</span></code>), so <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/?theme=light</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/metrics?x="
       & "1</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">/api/deps#top</span></code> reach the same handlers as <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/metrics</s"
       & "pan></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">/api/deps</span></code>. The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">?theme=</span></code> value is applied client-side as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "before; the fix makes the request reach the dashboard in the first place.</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h2-footer-no-longer-lists-a-redundant-tabs-hint"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H2: Footer no longer lists a redundant tabs hint<a class=""headerlink"" hr"
       & "ef=""#h2-footer-no-longer-lists-a-redundant-tabs-hint"" title=""Link to this he"
       & "ading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dashboard footer carried a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">Tabs:</span> <span class=""pre"">#proof/#deps</span></code>"
       & " hint. Every tab is already"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hash-addressable, so the hint only named two of seven tabs and added nothing"
       & "."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The footer now shows the embed query hint and the JSON API links, and adds a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "link to the new API playground. External docs stopped referencing the remove"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">#proof</span></"
       & "code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">#deps</sp"
       & "an></code> convenience.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Test Suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#test-suite"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The native suite grows from 1157 to 1169 tests (16 categories). The serve"
       & "r"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "routing category adds 12 checks covering <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">Strip_Query</span></code> (the themed root URL,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "query strings and fragments on the JSON API and badge endpoints, the empty"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "path, and unchanged paths with no query) and the new <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/endpoints</span></code> catalog"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "route. All 1169 tests pass.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""proof-results"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Proof Results<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#proof-results"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 0 unproved, 0 justified, 723 VCs unchanged under gnatprove 16.1"
       & ".0."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The dashboard, serve-path, and manifest scanner changes are build-time or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "I/O-bound code that adds no analysed Ada, so the VC total stays at the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Platinum bar. The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">Strip_Query</span></code> server helper is a new spec-declared SPARK"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subprogram and is proved alongside the rest of the server spec.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""traceability"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Traceability<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#traceability"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">HLR-DASH"
       & "</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>HLR-SERVER</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C1 API playground tab, C2 Charts superset, C3"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vendored yace, H1 query-string/fragment route stripping, H2 footer cleanup.<"
