       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-38-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.38.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-38-0"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-30</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.37.0 -&gt; 1.38.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-manual-is-now-an-mdbook-project-with-a-read-the-docs-site"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Manual is now an mdBook project with a Read the Docs site<a class=""h"
       & "eaderlink"" href=""#c1-manual-is-now-an-mdbook-project-with-a-read-the-docs-si"
       & "te"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The user documentation under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">docs/</span></code> is now a proper <strong>mdBook</strong>"
       & " project:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/book.toml<"
       & "/span></code> (with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">src</span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">&quot;.&quot;</"
       & "span></code>) and a root <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">docs/SUMMARY.md</span></code> table of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "contents. Read the Docs builds the public manual from it (<code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.readthedocs.yaml</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">mdbook</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">build</span> <span class=""pre"">docs</span></code>), so the "
       & "deployed site, the repository pages, and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bundled offline manual all share one source of truth. <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">book</s"
       & "pan></code> builds the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "book locally into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">docs/book/</span></code> (a gitignored build product "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " see C13) and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bundles it into the binary; <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">book-serve</span></code> serves t"
       & "he manual locally at"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">http://localhos"
       & "t:8000</span></code>; <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">docs-serve</span></code> keeps serving "
       & "the raw Markdown.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-bundled-offline-manual-served-at-docs"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Bundled offline manual served at /docs<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c"
       & "2-bundled-offline-manual-served-at-docs"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve<"
       & "/span></code> server now serves a <strong>bundled offline manual</strong> at"
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/docs</span></"
       & "code> (both"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "spellings, with and without the trailing slash, reach the same page)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-docs."
       & "py</span></code> runs <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">mdbook</span> <span class=""pre"">build</span></code> over <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/</span></code> at buil"
       & "d time and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bundles the resulting site into the binary as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/adacovex-do"
       & "cs_template.ads</span></code> (regenerated by <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">book</span></co"
       & "de>, which is also"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "part of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">build</span></code>): every page, stylesheet, script,"
       & " and badge is a lookup"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "table entry keyed by book-relative path, so the manual is fully"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "self-contained and navigable offline. Each asset is its own small Ada string"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "constant "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a single multi-megabyte blob would overflow the gnatprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "frontend stack (see H4). External fonts and the PNG screenshots are dropped"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(the screenshots show as notes), and the bundled HTML stays pure ASCII. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "header <strong>Documentation (offline manual)</strong> link and the API play"
       & "ground"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/docs</span></c"
       & "ode> endpoint both open it, so a user on a machine without a network"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "connection can still consult the manual.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-api-playground-endpoints-are-clickable-links"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: API playground endpoints are clickable links<a class=""headerlink"" hr"
       & "ef=""#c3-api-playground-endpoints-are-clickable-links"" title=""Link to this he"
       & "ading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The API playground endpoint buttons now carry a real link on the endpoint"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "path: clicking the path opens the raw URL in a new tab, while clicking the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rest of the button still runs the endpoint live in the playground. JSON"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "responses that reference endpoint paths (for example the <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/...</span></code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/badge/...</spa"
       & "n></code> values in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">/api/endpoints</span></code>) get those paths linkified too, so a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "user can jump straight from a URL in the payload to the live endpoint. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "endpoint catalog now lists <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">/docs</span></code> as an <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">html</span></code> endpoint.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-yace-token-colours-follow-the-pinned-theme"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: yace token colours follow the pinned theme<a class=""headerlink"" href"
       & "=""#c4-yace-token-colours-follow-the-pinned-theme"" title=""Link to this headin"
       & "g"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The vendored yace highlighter"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s token colours are driven by the dashboard"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--tok-*</span><"
       & "/code> CSS variables. The variables had a light default and a dark"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;media</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">(prefers-color-scheme:</span> <span class=""pre"">dark)</"
       & "span></code> block, but no explicit light override,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so a user who pinned the light theme on a dark OS still saw dark token"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "colours. The CSS now defines the token colours explicitly per theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">:root</span></"
       & "code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[data-th"
       & "eme=&quot;light&quot;]</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;]</span></code>), so the "
       & "highlighted"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JSON always matches the active dashboard theme, not the OS.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-complexity-check-skips-the-mdbook-build-output"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: complexity-check skips the mdBook build output<a class=""headerlink"" "
       & "href=""#c5-complexity-check-skips-the-mdbook-build-output"" title=""Link to thi"
       & "s heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">complexi"
       & "ty</span></code> subcommand"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s directory walk now skips <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">book</span></code> directories,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so the mdBook build output (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">docs/book/</span></code>) is excluded from the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "source-quality scan. The build output contains minified single-line"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JavaScript (the search index alone is a 1.4 MB line, far beyond the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Line</span>"
       & "</code> buffer), which printed a spurious "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "line exceeds Max_Line buffer"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "error on every scan and, in constrained environments, could push the scan"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "into heap exhaustion. The gate now scans assessed source only, matching the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "existing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">obj</s"
       & "pan></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">b"
       & "in</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">dist</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">build</span></code> exclusions.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-book-links-check-gate-keeps-the-bundled-manual-sound"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: book-links-check gate keeps the bundled manual sound<a class=""header"
       & "link"" href=""#c7-book-links-check-gate-keeps-the-bundled-manual-sound"" title="
       & """Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A new <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">book-links-check</span></code> gate (wired into <cod"
       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">check</span></code>, via"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/check-boo"
       & "k-links.py</span></code>) verifies that every link inside the bundled"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "offline manual resolves against the bundled assets or the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "deliberately-not-bundled prefixes shared with <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-docs.py</span></code>.  The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "check runs against a <strong>fresh</strong> <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">mdbook</span> <span class=""pre"">build</span></c"
       & "ode> from a temp copy of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">docs/</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so a stale local <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>docs/book</span></code> can never mask a broken link.  The committed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "artifact is the generated spec itself, gated by"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">python3</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">tools/gen-docs.py</span> <span class=""pre"">--check</span><"
       & "/code> (also wired into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">check</span></code>), which"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rebuilds the book and fails when <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">src/adacovex-docs_template.ads</span></code> is stale.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The manual is now <strong>complete</strong>: every page under <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/</span></code> (the 6"
       & "4"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "API-reference pages, the 39 changelogs, the compliance outputs, the proof"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ledger, the test report, credits, and third-party notices) is a book"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "chapter, so the index pages no longer link to pages the book never builds"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(previously 131 broken links in the built site).  Links from the manual to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "repo-root files (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>README.md</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">CONTRIBUTING.md</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">AGENTS.md</span></code>) now point at"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the repository URLs instead of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">../</span></code> paths that cannot resolve inside the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "book.  The tools unit tests grow from 41 to 48.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-dashboard-preview-screenshots-refreshed-and-api-tab-added"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: Dashboard preview screenshots refreshed and API tab added<a class=""h"
       & "eaderlink"" href=""#c6-dashboard-preview-screenshots-refreshed-and-api-tab-add"
       & "ed"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Charts tab preview (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">docs/media/dashboard_preview_charts.png</span></code>) is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "regenerated from the live dashboard, and a new API tab preview"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/media/das"
       & "hboard_preview_api.png</span></code>) is captured and added to the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard walk-through in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">docs/dashboard.md</span></code>. The walk-through now covers"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all eight tabs in header order, and the Charts tab description is corrected"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "six cards"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " to the real eight (the two shared radars, proof and test"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "donuts, proof and test bars, the docstring radial gauge, and the dependency"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scope polar ring). The screenshots are captured with a Playwright script"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tests/e2e/capt"
       & "ure-previews.mjs</span></code>) against the live <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code> dashboard.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-mdbook-search-works-in-the-bundled-offline-manual"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: mdBook search works in the bundled offline manual<a class=""headerlin"
       & "k"" href=""#c8-mdbook-search-works-in-the-bundled-offline-manual"" title=""Link "
       & "to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The bundled manual served at <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">/docs</span></code> is searchable <strong>offline</strong> "
       & "with mdBook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "own search. In 1.38 the mdBook search machinery was dropped from the bundle"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(mdbook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s elasticlunr search index is a multi-MB single blob that would"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "overflow the gnatprove frontend as one Ada string constant) and the search"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "box was hidden, so the manual in the binary had no search. <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-docs.py</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now bundles the whole mdBook search stack "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">elasticlunr</s"
       & "pan></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ma"
       & "rk</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">searcher</span>"
       & "</code>, and the search index itself "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " and keeps the search box visible."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The index is split into fixed-size chunks, each its own Ada constant (so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "no single constant exceeds the gnatprove limit), and the server streams the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "chunks back as one response when the page requests it, so no worker task"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "materialises a multi-megabyte body.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The search index keeps a <strong>stable</strong> <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">searchindex.js</span></code> name in th"
       & "e bundle (the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "content-hashed <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "searchindex-&lt;hash&gt;.js</span></code> is normalised at build time), so t"
       & "he"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "committed spec never churns its asset name or page references on a docs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "edit (see C12). No parallel search index or widget: the search button runs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "mdbook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own code against mdbook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own index, exactly like the online site.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c9-dashboard-shows-obvious-docs-links-and-a-split-api-view"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C9: Dashboard shows obvious docs links and a split API view<a class=""hea"
       & "derlink"" href=""#c9-dashboard-shows-obvious-docs-links-and-a-split-api-view"" "
       & "title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dashboard header gains a prominent <strong>docs links bar</strong> be"
       & "low the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "title/actions and above the tab selection. The API playground is rearranged"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "into a split-screen layout (endpoint nav left, live response preview right),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the footer no longer carries the raw <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/*</span></code> links or the <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">?theme=</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "embed hint "
