       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c13-docs-book-no-longer-committed-the-generated-spec-is-the-art"
       & "ifact"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C13: docs/book no longer committed; the generated spec is the artifact<a"
       & " class=""headerlink"" href=""#c13-docs-book-no-longer-committed-the-generated-s"
       & "pec-is-the-artifact"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The mdBook build output (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">docs/book/</span></code>) is no longer committed.  mdBook"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "content-hashes its assets, so the build churned <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">searchindex-&lt;hash&gt;.js</span></code> a"
       & "nd"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "every page"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s reference to it on each docs edit "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " pure version-control"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "noise.  <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/bo"
       & "ok/</span></code> is now gitignored and regenerated locally by"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">book</span></code>; the committed artifact is the generated s"
       & "pec"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/adacovex-do"
       & "cs_template.ads</span></code>, which is stable (see C8 and C12) and is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gated by <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">python"
       & "3</span> <span class=""pre"">tools/gen-docs.py</span> <span class=""pre"">--chec"
       & "k</span></code> inside <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">check</span></code>.  The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manual"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own search and print work identically offline and online, and a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "fresh clone builds the binary without mdbook (the committed spec is kept"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "until <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">book</span></code> regenerates it).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c12-offline-manual-print-button-works-and-the-search-index-name"
       & "-is-stable"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C12: Offline manual print button works and the search index name is stab"
       & "le<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c12-offline-manual-print-button-works-and-the"
       & "-search-index-name-is-stable"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The offline manual at <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">/docs</span></code> now behaves exactly like the online one when"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "printing.  mdBook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s print view (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">p"
       & "rint.html</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the single-page rendering"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the print button opens and which triggers the print dialog on load) and its"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "print stylesheet are bundled with the rest of the site, so <strong>Print thi"
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "book</strong> works offline instead of returning 404.  The SVG favicon is bu"
       & "ndled"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "too; only the PNG favicon and the PNG dashboard screenshots are dropped.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The bundled search index no longer churns its name on every docs edit."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "mdBook content-hashes the index (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">searchindex-&lt;hash&gt;.js</span></code>), and the hash"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "changes whenever the manual text changes, so each rebuild renamed the asset"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and rewrote the reference on every page.  <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-docs.py</span></code> now normalises"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the index to a stable <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">searchindex.js</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the asset and every page"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reference "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " so a docs edit updates the same entry in place and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "generated spec stops diffing on the file name.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-vendored-yace-js-now-appears-in-the-sbom"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: Vendored yace.js now appears in the SBOM<a class=""headerlink"" href="""
       & "#h1-vendored-yace-js-now-appears-in-the-sbom"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The vendored JavaScript bundles (<code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">graphre.js</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">nomnoml.js</span></code>, <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">flexsearch.js</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">yace.js</span><"
       & "/code>) sat at the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">resources/</span></code> root, but the vendored <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">yace.js</span></code> lived"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources"
       & "/js/</span></code> with the authored dashboard modules. The SBOM asset"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scanner treats <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "resources/js/</span></code> as authored dashboard code and skipped it, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "yace never became a dependency component. <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">yace.js</span></code> now sits at the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources/</spa"
       & "n></code> root with the other vendored libraries, the layout clearly"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "separates dependency JavaScript from dashboard JavaScript, and the SBOM list"
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "yace (MIT, v1.1.0, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">pkg:generic/yace</span></code>) alongside the other bundled libraries.</"
       & "p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h3-docs-subpages-are-served-again"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H3: /docs subpages are served again<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#h3-docs-"
       & "subpages-are-served-again"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Docs_Sub"
       & "path</span></code> slicing assumed the request path started at index 1, but"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Get_Path</span>"
       & "</code> returns a slice of the request line, so every <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/docs/&lt;subpath&gt;</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "kept a leading slash and returned 404 "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " only <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/docs</sp"
       & "an></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "/docs/</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "resolved.  The six-character prefix is now stripped from the slice"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s actual"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "first index, so every page, stylesheet, and badge of the bundled manual"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "serves (an e2e test pins the exact, nested, and extensionless subpaths plus"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a missing-page 404).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h5-idle-connections-no-longer-pin-the-server-worker-pool"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H5: Idle connections no longer pin the server worker pool<a class=""heade"
       & "rlink"" href=""#h5-idle-connections-no-longer-pin-the-server-worker-pool"" titl"
       & "e=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dashboard server"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s fixed-size worker pool (4 workers) blocks each"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "worker on the next request of a keep-alive connection.  Browsers hold"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "several idle connections open, so once all four workers were waiting on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "silent connections, the next request queued forever "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the e2e suite"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "started hitting 60-second timeouts on <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">/docs</span></code> subpages as it grew.  Each"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "accepted socket now carries a 5-second receive timeout, and a timed-out"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(or dropped) connection is closed in the worker"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s error path (which"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "previously leaked the socket).  A worker frees instead of pinning the pool f"
       & "orever,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the request is served.  (The timeout was originally 5s; H10 below"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "shortens it to half a second so a multi-asset docs burst fans out across"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the pool instead of waiting one timeout per queued connection.)  The e2e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "suite returns to 28 passing in ~14 seconds.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h4-bundled-manual-no-longer-overflows-the-gnatprove-frontend"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H4: Bundled manual no longer overflows the gnatprove frontend<a class=""h"
       & "eaderlink"" href=""#h4-bundled-manual-no-longer-overflows-the-gnatprove-fronte"
       & "nd"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The complete-book offline manual is a 4 MB asset set, and <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gen-docs.py</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "emitted it as one giant <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">&amp;</span></code>-concatenation chain (300k+ string literals)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GNAT"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s frontend parses that tree fine, but gnatprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s flow analysis blew"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "its stack (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Stor"
       & "age_Error</span> <span class=""pre"">stack</span> <span class=""pre"">overflow</"
       & "span></code> at <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">adacovex-docs_template.ads</span></code>),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "aborting <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> and therefore <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">che"
       & "ck</span></code> and every release."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Experiments showed the limit is the constant size itself (a single string"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "constant over ~1 MB overflows whatever its structure), so the generated"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "spec now holds one <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">aliased</span> <span class=""pre"">constant</span> <span class=""pre"">Strin"
       & "g</span></code> per asset (the multi-MB"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "search index is split into fixed-size chunks, each its own constant "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " 166"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bodies in all), each well under the limit, never concatenated into one"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "value "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " with an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Asset_Bodies</s"
       & "pan></code> access-to-constant table and an <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">Asset_Index</span></code> subtype so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Content</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">(Idx)</span></code> needs no unchecked bounds reasoning. T"
       & "he served bytes are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unchanged (each asset constant carries the identical content), the server"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "routes through the same <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">Find</span></code> lookup and streams the bodies (see C8), and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the bundle-links check still passes.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h2-dashboard-docs-links-moved-from-the-footer-to-a-top-bar"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H2: Dashboard docs links moved from the footer to a top bar<a class=""hea"
       & "derlink"" href=""#h2-dashboard-docs-links-moved-from-the-footer-to-a-top-bar"" "
       & "title=""Link to this heading"">"
