       & ASCII.LF
       & "checks that a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">-"
       & "-</span> <span class=""pre"">HLR-*</span></code> string literal is not a sourc"
       & "e tag while a real"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "comment tag after a string still is.  H9"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s query-string handling adds no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "native assertions (the routing table already pins <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/docs</span></code> and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Strip_Query</sp"
       & "an></code> path), and H10"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s timeout is timing behaviour the suite"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cannot assert deterministically "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " both are covered manually and by the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard e2e suite.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The tools unit suite grows to 55 tests: the search-index normalisation, t"
       & "he"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "print-view and SVG-favicon bundling rules, the print-asset link check, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the fresh-build link check (docs/book is a gitignored product, so the gate"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rebuilds the book to check it).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>All 1173 tests pass (1176-1181 when mdbook is on PATH, depending on the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "system-tool assertions in the SBOM category).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
