       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-the-manual-now-builds-with-sphinx-and-the-furo-theme"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: The manual now builds with Sphinx and the Furo theme<a class=""header"
       & "link"" href=""#c1-the-manual-now-builds-with-sphinx-and-the-furo-theme"" title="
       & """Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The user documentation under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">docs/</span></code> is now a <strong>Sphinx</strong> projec"
       & "t, not an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "mdBook one. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">doc"
       & "s/conf.py</span></code> selects the <strong>Furo</strong> HTML theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(https://github.com/pradyunsg/furo) and the <strong>MyST Markdown parser</st"
       & "rong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">myst_parser</s"
       & "pan></code>), so the docs stay written in Markdown exactly as they were "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & ASCII.LF
       & "there is no conversion to reStructuredText. Furo is a clean, modern theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with light/dark support and no external assets, so the offline manual stays"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "self-contained. The build dependencies are pinned in a new top-level"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">requirements.tx"
       & "t</span></code> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>sphinx</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">myst-parser</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">furo</span></code>), and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.readthedocs.ya"
       & "ml</span></code> now points at <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">docs/conf.py</span></code> and installs those deps, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the Read the Docs deploy that broke under mdBook builds cleanly again.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-offline-manual-bundling-rebuilt-around-sphinx"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Offline manual bundling rebuilt around Sphinx<a class=""headerlink"" h"
       & "ref=""#c2-offline-manual-bundling-rebuilt-around-sphinx"" title=""Link to this "
       & "heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-do"
       & "cs.py</span></code> (wired as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">book</span></code>, run inside "
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">build</span></code>) now runs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sphinx-build</s"
       & "pan></code> over <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>docs/</span></code> and bundles the built site "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " every page,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stylesheet, script, and badge "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/adaco"
       & "vex-docs_template.ads</span></code> as a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "path-keyed asset table, the bundled offline manual the <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code> server serves"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "at <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/docs</span>"
       & "</code>. The mdBook search/print machinery (<code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">elasticlunr</span></code>, <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">mark</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">print.html</spa"
       & "n></code>) is gone; Sphinx"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own searchable site is bundled instead."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/check-boo"
       & "k-links.py</span></code> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">book-links-check</span></code>) ver"
       & "ifies every link in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the bundle against a fresh <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">sphinx-build</span></code> from a temp copy of <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/</span></code>, so a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stale local Sphinx build product can never mask a broken link.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-navigation-driven-by-hidden-toctrees"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Navigation driven by hidden toctrees<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-"
       & "navigation-driven-by-hidden-toctrees"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Sphinx sidebar navigation comes from <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">:toctree:</span></code> directives, so <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/index.md</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now ends with hidden toctrees that pull in <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">usage/</span></code>, <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">contributing/</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">api-docs/</span"
       & "></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">chang"
       & "elogs/</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">proof/</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">compliance/</span></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">badges/</span></code>. The retired"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "mdBook files <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">do"
       & "cs/book.toml</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">docs/SUMMARY.md</span></code> are deleted, and the old"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/book/</spa"
       & "n></code> build output is no longer tracked (its Sphinx replacement builds"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/_buil"
       & "d/</span></code>, now gitignored). Pages not reachable from a toctree are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "not auto-discovered; new doc pages must be linked from one.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-build-and-source-tooling-updated"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Build and source tooling updated<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-buil"
       & "d-and-source-tooling-updated"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Makefile <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">book</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">book-links-check</span></code> targets, the <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">help</span"
       & "></code> text, the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">complexity-chec"
       & "k</span></code> source-walk excludes (<code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">.venv/</span></code> and <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/_build/</span></code> added), the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest tool registration (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">sphinx-build</span></code> replaces <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">mdbook</span></code>), and the SBOM"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "fixture/tests all reference the Sphinx toolchain. The generated <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom.json</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/api-docs</"
       & "span></code>, the modern-dashboard prose, and <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/agents-tree.map</span></code> were"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "regenerated or updated in step so the tree stays internally consistent.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-python-requirements-resolve-as-pypi-sbom-dependencies"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: Python requirements resolve as pypi SBOM dependencies<a class=""heade"
       & "rlink"" href=""#c7-python-requirements-resolve-as-pypi-sbom-dependencies"" titl"
       & "e=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sphinx-build"
       & "</span></code> is a Python package entry point, not a system binary, so it i"
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "no longer registered as a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">pkg:generic/*</span></code> system-tool dependency. The root"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">requirements*"
       & ".txt</span></code> entries (sphinx, myst-parser, and any others)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now register as <strong>dev-scope <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">pkg:pypi/*</span></code> dependencies</strong> with their"
       & " language"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "set to Python. Versions are resolved from the package registry (<code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pip</span> <span class=""pre"
       & """>index</span> <span class=""pre"">versions</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;pkg&g"
       & "t;</span></code>) when the requirements line pins none; a missing pip or an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "offline machine keeps the name-only entry "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no version or licence is ever"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "guessed. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/"
       & "gen-docs.py</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">tools/check-book-links.py</span></code> also now find"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sphinx-build</s"
       & "pan></code> inside the repo"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.venv/bin"
       & "</span></code> when it is not on PATH, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">check</span></code> runs the docs gates (and the tools unit t"
       & "ests) on any machine"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that has the venv, instead of silently skipping them.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-python-is-now-a-documented-build-time-dependency"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Python is now a documented build-time dependency<a class=""headerlink"
       & """ href=""#c5-python-is-now-a-documented-build-time-dependency"" title=""Link to"
       & " this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The manual is built at compile time and bundled into the released binary,"
       & " so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Python 3 is now a <strong>build-time</strong> requirement: <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-dashboard.py</span></c"
       & "ode> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-docs."
       & "py</span></code> (the latter needing <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">sphinx</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">myst-parser</span></code> + <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">furo</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">requiremen"
       & "ts.txt</span></code>) embed the dashboard and offline manual into the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "binary as generated Ada string constants. The released binary itself still"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "has <strong>no runtime Python dependency</strong>. The README, developer gui"
       & "de,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "requirements table, Makefile help, and <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES</span></code> all state this"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "clearly.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-sphinx-furo-myst-and-read-the-docs-credited"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: Sphinx, Furo, MyST, and Read the Docs credited<a class=""headerlink"" "
       & "href=""#c6-sphinx-furo-myst-and-read-the-docs-credited"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The third-party notices (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</span></code>) and the dashboard <strong"
       & ">Credits</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tab now credit <strong>Sphinx</strong>, <strong>Furo</strong> and <strong>My"
       & "ST-Parser</strong> as the documentation"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "build tools and <strong>Read the Docs</strong> as the online hosting service"
       & ". Furo"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "footer self-promotion block ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Made with Sphinx and &#64;pradyunsg"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s Furo"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ") is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stripped from the bundled manual (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-docs.py</span></code>); the copyright notice"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stays, and Sphinx and Furo are credited in the notices instead.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-read-the-docs-deploy-becomes-reproducible"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: Read the Docs deploy becomes reproducible<a class=""headerlink"" href="
       & """#h1-read-the-docs-deploy-becomes-reproducible"" title=""Link to this heading"""
       & ">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The 1.39 Read the Docs deploy passed validation but still failed to rende"
       & "r."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Migrating the manual to Sphinx fixes the root cause: Read the Docs builds"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/conf.py</s"
       & "pan></code> natively with a pinned Python toolchain and <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">requirements.txt</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "deps, so the site deploys without depending on a separately installed mdBook"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "binary.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Test Suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#test-suite"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The native suite grows to 1186 tests across 16 categories: the SBOM tests"
       & " add"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "assertions that <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">sphinx-build</span></code> is never registered as a system tool, and that"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "root <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">requiremen"
       & "ts*.txt</span></code> entries (sphinx, myst-parser) register as dev-scope"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pkg:pypi/*</spa"
       & "n></code> dependencies with a registry-resolved version.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""proof-results"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Proof Results<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#proof-results"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 0 unproved, 0 justified, 725 VCs (725 proved) under gnatprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "16.1.0. The edited Ada units (the manifest parser and its new subunits) are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "not SPARK-analysed (the package is default-off; only <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Trim</span></code> opts in), so the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "totals are unchanged.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""traceability"">"
