       & "        <article role=""main"" id=""furo-main-content"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-6-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.6.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-6-0"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-05</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.5.0 -&gt; 1.6.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-full-spark-proof-coverage-platinum-0-unproved"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Full SPARK proof coverage (Platinum, 0 unproved)<a class=""headerlink"
       & """ href=""#c1-full-spark-proof-coverage-platinum-0-unproved"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The whole SPARK-on codebase is now fully machine-proved. Previously only "
       & "the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bounded IR types (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">Checked_Add32/64</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">IR_Bounds.Add32/64</span></code>) carried complete"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proofs; every other SPARK unit was analysed but not fully discharged. Now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>all 491 VCs prove</strong> with <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">--prover=z3</span> <span class=""pre"">--timeout=20</"
       & "span></code>, including the run-time"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "range checks, assertions, functional contracts, and loop termination:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Renderers</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">I2S</span></code> (fixed <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">10**Pos</span></code> overflow by replacing ex"
       & "ponentiation"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with a constant <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">Pow10</span></code> power table, loop invariants carrying the digit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "count and value bound, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">Buf</span></code> initialized), <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">Pad2</span></code> and <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Escape_JSON</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(uninitialized-buffer fixes via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">(others</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class="""
       & "pre"">'</span> <span class=""pre"">')</span></code>), and <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ISO_From_Epoch</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(chained <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&amp;<"
       & "/span></code> concatenation upper-bound proofs replaced by a bounded"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Field</span></c"
       & "ode>-copy buffer procedure). Postconditions now document the result"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "lengths (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">I2S'Re"
       & "sult'Length</span> <span class=""pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"">1</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">..</span> <span class=""pre"">10</span></code>, <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Pad2'Result'Length</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"">1</span> <span class=""pre"">..</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">11</span></code>).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Parsers</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">Trim</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">Trim_Left</span></code>, <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Number_After</span></code>, and <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Number_Before_Word</span><"
       & "/code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gained <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Pre</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">S'First</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">&gt;=</span> <span class=""pre"">1</span> <span class=""pre"">and</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">S'Last</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">Natural'Last</span></code> preconditions plus"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "strengthened loop invariants (carried array-index bounds and the digit-run"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "range <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">for</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">all</span> <span class=""pre"">Q</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "in</span> <span class=""pre"">DStart</span> <span class=""pre"">..</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">K</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">S</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">(Q)</span> <span class=""pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"
       & """>'0'</span> <span class=""pre"">..</span> <span class=""pre"">'9'</span></code>"
       & ").</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>IR synthesiser</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">Bits</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">IR_Type_Name</span></code> (<code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Post</span> <span class=""pre"">=&g"
       & "t;</span> <span class=""pre"">'Result'Length</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;=</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">9</span></code>),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Lower_Type_Name"
       & "</span></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">Synthesize_Package</span></code> (buffer bounds, <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Sub</span></code>/<code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Result</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "initialization, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">J</span> <span class=""pre"">&gt;=</span> <span class=""pre"">I</span></cod"
       & "e> for the outer-loop variant) all proved.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Termination</strong>: every <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">while</span></code> loop across the codebase now"
       & " carries an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "explicit <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Loop_V"
       & "ariant</span></code> (increasing or decreasing bound), so the implicit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Always_Terminat"
       & "es</span></code> aspects discharge "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no loop is left as potentially"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "non-terminating.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The self-assessment is now: 26 packages, 59 subprograms, 100% docstrings,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>Platinum (500/500 VCs, 0 unproved)</strong>, 295/295 tests, DAL-C Ac"
       & "hieved.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-host-word-size-auto-detection"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Host word-size auto-detection<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c2-host-wo"
       & "rd-size-auto-detection"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Fixed-size buffers and the IR host model are now derived from the actual "
       & "host"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "word size instead of being hard-coded to 64-bit assumptions:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex"
       & ".Types.Host_Word_Bits</span> <span class=""pre"">:</span> <span class=""pre"">co"
       & "nstant</span> <span class=""pre"">:=</span> <span class=""pre"">System.Word_Size"
       & "</span></code>; the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Path</span>"
       & "</code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_L"
       & "ine</span></code> path and line buffers scale with it"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">64</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">*</span> <span class=""pre"">Host_Word_Bits</span></code> = 4096"
       & ", <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">4096</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">*</span> <span class=""pre"">Host_Word_Bits</span></code> = 2"
       & "62144 on a 64-bit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "host), so builds on narrower hosts use proportionally smaller limits. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "semantic limits (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>Max_Id_Str</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">Max_Desc_Str</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Filename</span></code>) stay fixed.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex"
       & ".Target_Profiles.Host_Word_Size</span></code> auto-detects the host word siz"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(8/16/32/64) from the Ada runtime for <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">Target_Config.Host_Bits</span></code>, with the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dead-branch warning resolved by a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">case</span> <span class=""pre"">System.Word_Size</span></co"
       & "de> structure.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Test suite extended: 6 new checks (Types conversion + IR host-word-si"
       & "ze"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "detection). The suite is now <strong>295 tests</strong>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-conventional-test-result-file-discovery"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: Conventional test-result file discovery<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#"
       & "c3-conventional-test-result-file-discovery"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The test-summary lookup is no longer hard-coded to <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/test_result.md</span><"
       & "/code>. A new <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">P"
       & "arse_Test_Result_From_Project</span></code> searches a conventional list of "
       & "test-result file names at the project root (and under <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/</span></code>) and parses the f"
       & "irst file that exists "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test_result.md"
       & "</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">test_results.md</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">test-result.md</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test_report.md</span></code>, <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test_output.md</span></code>,"
