       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-7-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.7.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-7-0"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-07</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.6.0 -&gt; 1.7.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-explicit-overflow-handling-no-silent-partial-parses"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Explicit overflow handling "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no silent partial parses<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-explicit-overflow-h"
       & "andling-no-silent-partial-parses"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A physical line longer than <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">Max_Line</span></code> (262144 bytes on 64-bit) was previous"
       & "ly"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "silently truncated by the source scanner: the tail of the line was drained a"
       & "nd"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "discarded, and the remaining (partial) line was parsed as if it were the who"
       & "le"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "line. GNATprove, test-result, HLR/LLR, and manifest parsers had a related bu"
       & "g"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a full buffer was drained for the <em>next</em> physical line, misreading t"
       & "he"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "following content. Both behaviours could silently produce wrong metrics.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>All parsers now share an overflow-aware <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">Read_Line</span></code> helper on the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.Parser"
       & "s</span></code> parent package:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Exact detection.</strong> A line that fills the buffer exactl"
       & "y (end-of-line"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reached) parses normally. A line that genuinely exceeds the buffer is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "detected via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">En"
       & "d_Of_Line</span></code>, drained, and reported to stderr as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Error:</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">&lt;path&gt;:&lt;line&gt;:</span> <span class=""pre"">line</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">exceeds</span> <span class=""pre"">Max_Line</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">buffer</span> <span class=""pre"">(&lt;N&gt;</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">bytes)</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Explicit failure, never partial output.</strong> The scanner "
       & "stops parsing the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "offending file (no partial AST), and the GNATprove / test-result / HLR/LLR"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "parsers clear their output and fail. The manifest, lockfile, and GPR"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "parsers abort dependency-graph resolution.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>DAL is forced Unmet.</strong> <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">Scan_Project</span></code> returns a new <code"
       & " class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Skipped_Ct</span></c"
       & "ode>; when any"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "source file is skipped, the assessment appends <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&quot;N</span> <span class=""pre"">source</spa"
