       & "tprove-prove-subcommand-options"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</s"
       & "pan></code> subcommand now forwards parallelism and proof-effort options to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GNATprove instead of running a fixed invocation:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
