       & "        <article role=""main"" id=""furo-main-content"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-8-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.8.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-8-0"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-13</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.7.0 -&gt; 1.8.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-on-disk-result-caching"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: On-disk result caching<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c1-on-disk-result"
       & "-caching"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Analysis results are cached on disk under <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/cache/&lt;version&gt;/</span></cod"
       & "e>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "keyed by the SHA-256 of each input artifact. Unchanged source files serve"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "their parsed <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Pa"
       & "ckage_Info</span></code> from the cache instead of being re-scanned;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unchanged <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatp"
       & "rove.out</span></code> and test-result files likewise serve their parsed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "summaries. Cache effectiveness (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">X</span> <span class=""pre"">hit(s),</span> <span class=""pre"""
       & ">Y</span> <span class=""pre"">miss(es),</span> <span class=""pre"">Z</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">evicted</span></code>) is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reported in the ANSI report. Controlled by <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">--cache</span></code> (default on),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--no-cache</spa"
       & "n></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--ca"
       & "che-dir=PATH</span></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">--cache-max=N</span></code> (default 4096);"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--no-cache</spa"
       & "n></code> forces every run to re-scan / re-parse / re-prove, which is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "useful when artifacts change but keep the same content hash.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-cache-schema-namespace-and-overflow-safe-serialization"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Cache-schema namespace and overflow-safe serialization<a class=""head"
       & "erlink"" href=""#c2-cache-schema-namespace-and-overflow-safe-serialization"" ti"
       & "tle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The default cache root is <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/cache/&lt;version&gt;/&lt;Cache_Schema&gt;</span><"
       & "/code>;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bumping <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Cache_S"
       & "chema</span></code> (in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">src/core/adacovex-cache.ads</span></code>) invalidates blobs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "written by incompatible builds instead of serving them as if valid."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Serialize</span"
       & "></code> returns an empty blob when a payload would exceed <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Cache_Blob</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(callers refuse to store it) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">Deserialize</span></code> rejects empty/oversized input,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so truncated data can never be served as a cache hit.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-target-path-normalization"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--targe"
       & "t</span></code> path normalization<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-target-pat"
       & "h-normalization"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--target</sp"
       & "an></code> is normalised to a canonical absolute path (<code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.</span></code>/<code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">..</span></code> collapsed)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "before scanning, so the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">File_Path</span></code> values stored in cached <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Package_Info</span></code> no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "longer depend on how the target was spelled (e.g. <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--target=../Ada_CRDT</span></code> vs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--target=.</spa"
       & "n></code>). Docstring patches are matched by the package path relative to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the target root, so a cached path spelled through a different relative form"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "silently left those patches unapplied; normalization makes the cache"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "consistent across invocations.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-alire-manifest-compatibility"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Alire manifest compatibility<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-alire-ma"
       & "nifest-compatibility"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">auto-gpr-wit"
       & "h</span></code> is expressed in its boolean form (<code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">true</span></code>); the string form"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">auto-gpr-with</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">&quot;adacovex.gpr&quot;<"
       & "/span></code> is rejected by the released <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span></code> 2.1.1"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Cannot</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">read</span> <span class=""pre"">valid</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">property</span></code>), which blocked <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">build</span></code> "
       & "and therefore"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">build</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">test</span></code> / <co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">run-self</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-hlr-completeness"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: HLR completeness<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c5-hlr-completeness"" ti"
       & "tle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">HLR-CACHE</s"
       & "pan></code> (Result caching) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">HLR-CPU</span></code> (Cross-platform CPU core detection)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are now defined in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">docs/compliance/HLR.md</span></code>, removing the orphan source tags"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and restoring <strong>DAL-C Achieved</strong> in strict mode.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c6-ada-crdt-make-targets"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C6: Ada_CRDT make targets<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c6-ada-crdt-make-t"
       & "argets"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</s"
       & "pan></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pro"
       & "ve</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>badges</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">sbom</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">coverage-gate</span></code> targets resolve the sibling"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">../adacovex</sp"
       & "an></code> binary when present and fall back to <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">exec</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">--</span> <span class=""pre"">adacovex</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "otherwise, so <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">m"
       & "ake</span> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> / <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">badges</sp"
       & "an></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ma"
       & "ke</span> <span class=""pre"">sbom</span></code> work both in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "workspace and on CI.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c7-ci-result-cache-persistence"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C7: CI result-cache persistence<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c7-ci-result"
       & "-cache-persistence"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The composite action gains a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">result-cache</span></code> input (default on) that persists"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/cac"
       & "he</span></code> between workflow runs with <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">actions/cache</span></code>;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "content-addressed entries make restoring a stale cache always safe, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "incremental branches get mostly cache hits.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c8-toolchain-aware-proof-cache-and-standalone-gnatprove-deploym"
       & "ent"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C8: Toolchain-aware proof cache and standalone gnatprove deployment<a cl"
       & "ass=""headerlink"" href=""#c8-toolchain-aware-proof-cache-and-standalone-gnatpr"
       & "ove-deployment"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The GNATprove result-cache key now folds in the resolved prover identity "
       & "(the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest-pinned version for alire-managed deployments, else the resolved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "executable/toolchain path), so a proof produced by one gnatprove is never re"
       & "used"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "after an upgrade or a different on-PATH / cached / downloaded toolchain "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " stale"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "entries simply miss and are transparently re-proved, with no explicit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "invalidation. The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">prove</span></code> subcommand also stops composing the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s entire"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dev-manifest dependency set: instead of <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">exec</span> <span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">--</span> <span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code> (which could"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pull covex / gnatdoc_bin / gnatformat_bin and, for dev-only gnatprove, swap"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifests for the run), it deploys only the self-contained gnatprove binary"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "crate into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.a"
       & "dacovex/toolchain</span></code> via <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">-n</span> <span class=""pre"
       & """>get</span> <span class=""pre"">gnatprove=&lt;version&gt;</span></code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "runs the deployed binary directly. The manifest version set expression"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">^15.1.0</span>"
       & "</code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">~15.1."
       & "0</span></code>, "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(166)
       & ") is reduced to the bare version alr accepts."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "CI proof runs now depend on a single crate download instead of the full"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dev-manifest dependency closure, and the dev-manifest swap machinery is gone"
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""h1-cache-eviction"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>H1: Cache eviction<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#h1-cache-eviction"" title="
       & """Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The cache root is stored without a trailing separator, and the eviction"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "helpers (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Count_"
       & "Files</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">Oldest_File</span></code>) guard on <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.Directories.Kind</span></code> instead"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Exists</span"
       & "></code>, which returns False for a bare directory on some GNAT versions."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Together these make <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">--cache-max</span></code> eviction actually enforce the entry cap"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(previously all entries were retained).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""test-suite"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Test Suite<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#test-suite"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>336/336 native tests passing; counts unchanged (no test files modified in"
       & " this"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "release).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""proof-results"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Proof Results<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#proof-results"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Self-assessment remains <strong>Platinum</strong> (all VCs proved, 0 unpr"
       & "oved, AoRTE-free). <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> re-ran gnatprove 15.1."
       & "0 against the current tree: <strong>503/503</strong> VCs proved across 38 an"
       & "alysed units. The cache, CLI, main-flow, and prove-resolution changes live i"
       & "n non-SPARK units (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Adacovex.</span> <span class=""pre"">Cache</span></code>, <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">CPUs</span></code>, `Adacovex.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Config<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">,</spa"
       & "n> </code>Adacovex. Prove<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">,</span> </code>adacovex_main<code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">),</span> <span class=""pre"">so</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">no</span> <span class=""pre"">SPARK</span> <span class=""pre"">proof</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">metrics</span> <span class=""pre"">regress.</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">Ada_CRDT</span> <span class=""pre"">re-proved</span> <span class=""pre"
       & """>clean</span> <span class=""pre"">too:</span> <span class=""pre"">584/584</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">VCs</span> <span class=""pre"">(44</span> <span class=""pre"
       & """>justified)</span> <span class=""pre"">across</span> <span class=""pre"">34</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">analysed</span> <span class=""pre"">units,</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">Platinum.</span> <span class=""pre"">Proof</span> <span class=""pre"
       & """>runs</span> <span class=""pre"">now</span> <span class=""pre"">deploy</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span> <span class=""pre"">standalone</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">via</span> </code>alr -n get gnatprove=15.1.0<code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">into</span></code>~/.adacovex/tool"
       & "chain` and execute that binary directly; identical inputs hit the newly tool"
       & "chain-aware result cache (verified: 30 hit(s), 0 miss(es) on re-run).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""traceability"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Traceability<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#traceability"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New HLRs: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--"
