       & "        <article role=""main"" id=""furo-main-content"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-1-9-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex 1.9.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-1-9-0"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-14</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.8.0 -&gt; 1.9.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""changes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Changes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#changes"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c1-honest-gnatprove-parse-across-gnatprove-v15-v16"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C1: Honest GNATprove parse across gnatprove v15/v16<a class=""headerlink"""
       & " href=""#c1-honest-gnatprove-parse-across-gnatprove-v15-v16"" title=""Link to t"
       & "his heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">Parsers.</span> <span class=""pre"">GNATprove</span></c"
       & "ode> now reconciles the command-line <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">Summary</span> <span class=""pre"">of</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">SPARK</span> <span class=""pre"">analysis</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Total"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " row between gnatprove 15.x and 16.x: the row layout differs between version"
       & "s (the prover and unproved columns are centered and the "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Justified"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & "/"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & "Unproved"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " columns are blank (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">.</span></code>) in one format and populated in the other). A field-bas"
       & "ed reader (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Get_"
       & "Column_Number</span></code>) extracts each column by its padded column span "
       & "instead of by "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "nth number in the line"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", so a justified-VC percentage that was mistaken for the unproved percentage"
       & " on the shared 15.x/16.x layout no longer corrupts the summary.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This fixes the self-assessment: the previous "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Platinum / all VCs proved"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " report was a parser artifact that read the unproved column as zero. The hon"
       & "est level immediately after this fix was Silver; the proof fixes in C5 then "
       & "closed the real gap, so the self-assessment is genuinely Platinum again (see"
       & " Proof Results).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c2-global-gnatprove-version-pin-adacovex-toml-env"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C2: Global gnatprove version pin (<code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex.toml</span></code> / env)<a class=""headerlin"
       & "k"" href=""#c2-global-gnatprove-version-pin-adacovex-toml-env"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> resolves <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code> as: <strong>manifes"
       & "t pin &gt; global pin &gt; PATH &gt;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cache &gt; download</strong>. A new global pin "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ADACOVEX_G"
       & "NATPROVE_VERSION</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "environment variable or the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">[prove]</span> <span class=""pre"">gnatprove-version</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">&quot;16.1.0&quot;</span></code> key"
       & " in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/ada"
       & "covex.toml</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " deploys the exact gnatprove binary crate"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "standalone via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "alr</span> <span class=""pre"">-n</span> <span class=""pre"">get</span></code> a"
       & "nd runs it directly, with the same"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "authoritative, never-fall-back semantics as a manifest pin. It applies only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to projects whose own manifest does not declare gnatprove (the manifest pin"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "always wins), so a single workstation/CI can fix every proof on one prover"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "without touching each project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s manifest. The provenance and the pin are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "folded into the proof result-cache identity, so proofs from different prover"
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "never mix.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c3-ci-threshold-gates-require-spark-require-docstrings-require-"
       & "tests-require-proof"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C3: CI threshold gates (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">--require-spark</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">--require-docstrings</span></code> / <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--require-tests</span></"
       & "code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--requi"
       & "re-proof</span></code>)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c3-ci-threshold-gates-re"
       & "quire-spark-require-docstrings-require-tests-require-proof"" title=""Link to t"
       & "his heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Four <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--requi"
       & "re-*</span></code> flags add explicit minimum-bar checks on top of the DAL c"
       & "riteria. Off by default; when set, the assessment fails loudly (exit code 1 "
       & "with an explicit <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>CI</span> <span class=""pre"">GATE:</span></code> reason) if the target fall"
       & "s below the required level: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">--require-spark=LVL</span></code> (Stone.. Platinum), <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--require-docstrings=PCT"
       & "</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">--require-proof=PCT</span></code> (percent, 0-100), and <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--require-tests=N</span></code>"
       & " (passing test count). The GitHub Action exposes matching <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">require-spark</span></code>, <cod"
       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">require-docstrings<"
       & "/span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "require-tests</span></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">require-proof</span></code> inputs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Because a stricter gnatprove can legitimately leave more VCs unproved, th"
       & "e gates are designed to be set against the results of the prover actually pi"
       & "nned.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c4-honest-sbom-proof-level"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C4: Honest SBOM proof level<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#c4-honest-sbom-p"
       & "roof-level"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">Renderers.</span> <span class=""pre"">SBOM.</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">Proof_Level_Property</span></code> now reports the assessed le"
       & "vel verbatim (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">S"
       & "tone</span></code>..<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">Platinum</span></code>) instead of collapsing every non-Platinum result"
       & " to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&quot;Gold&"
       & "quot;</span></code>, so an SBOM never overstates assurance (Silver with unpr"
       & "oved VCs is reported as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">&quot;Silver&quot;</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The proof-level postcondition was widened to the full range accordingly.<"
       & "/p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""c5-proof-fixes-to-0-unproved-platinum-under-gnatprove-16-1-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>C5: Proof fixes to 0 unproved (Platinum under gnatprove 16.1.0)<a class="
       & """headerlink"" href=""#c5-proof-fixes-to-0-unproved-platinum-under-gnatprove-16"
       & "-1-0"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Eliminated every unproved VC so the self-assessment reaches <strong>Plati"
       & "num</strong>:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>343 VCs, 343 proved, 0 unproved</strong> across 38 analysed units un"
       & "der gnatprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "16.1.0, with no <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">SPARK_Mode(Off)</span></code> and no justified VCs. The bulk of the debt"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "was solver step-limit timeouts, not genuine proof gaps; the rest needed real"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "contract and structure fixes:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> now passes <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--steps=5000</span></code> by default"
       & " (an explicit <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">-"
       & "-steps=</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "still wins), replacing gnatprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s low default step budget that reported"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "provers reached step limit"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
