       & "          <section id=""high-level-requirements-adacovex"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>High-Level Requirements "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " adacovex<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#high-level-requirements-adacovex"" titl"
       & "e=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""requirement-index"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Requirement Index<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#requirement-index"" title="""
       & "Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-ARCH: Architecture and build system</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-CACHE: Result caching</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-CPU: Cross-platform CPU core detection</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-SCAN: Ada source scanning</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-PROOF: SPARK / GNATprove proof analysis</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-TEST: Test result parsing</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-COMPLIANCE: DO-178C compliance assessment (all DAL levels A-E)</p"
       & "></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DAL-A to E: Per-level DAL criteria (see below)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DAL-A: DAL-A criteria "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all HLRs traced, no orphans, tests pass, Gold SPARK</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DAL-B: DAL-B criteria "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all HLRs traced, no orphans, tests pass, Silver SPARK</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DAL-C: DAL-C criteria "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all HLRs traced, no orphans, tests pass, Bronze SPARK</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DAL-D: DAL-D criteria "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all HLRs traced, tests pass</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DAL-E: DAL-E criteria "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all HLRs traced</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-RENDER-ANSI: ANSI terminal rendering</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-RENDER-SVG: SVG badge generation</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-RENDER-MD: Markdown report generation</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-RENDER-HTML: HTML dashboard and JSON API</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-SERVER: HTTP server</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-ANSI: Terminal colour support</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-TZ: Timezone resolution and local-time formatting</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-CLI: CLI argument parsing</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-COMPLEXITY: Cyclomatic complexity and LOC gating</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DIFF: Differential assessment ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "compare-base)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-METRICS: Docstring coverage metrics</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-MANIFEST: Alire manifest and dependency-graph parsing</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-PROVE: GNATprove subcommand</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-SBOM: Proof-aware SBOM generation</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-IR: IR type profiles, host/target config, and foreign type-name l"
       & "owering</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""requirements"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Requirements<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#requirements"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-ARCH: The tool shall build with <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">build</span></code>"
       & " and support Makefile targets"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for build, prove, fmt, lint, api-docs, changelog, and clean.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-CACHE: The tool shall cache per-file analysis results (source sca"
       & "ns,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GNATprove summaries, test summaries) on disk keyed by the SHA-256 hash of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "each analysed artifact, serve unchanged files from the cache instead of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "re-scanning / re-parsing / re-proving, evict oldest entries first when the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "configured cap is reached, and report cache hits, misses, and evictions;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "behaviour is controlled by <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">--cache</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">--no-cache</span></code> / <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--cache-dir</span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--cache-max</sp"
       & "an></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-CPU: The tool shall detect the host logical CPU count across Linu"
       & "x,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "macOS, FreeBSD, and Windows using only the GNAT runtime (no external tools),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "detect CI environments, and resolve GNATprove parallelism: an auto default"
