       & "in source), no orphan tags, all tests passing, and minimum SPARK Gold level"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(all run-time checks proved, all assertions proved, all functional contracts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proved, all termination proved).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DAL-B: DAL-B assessment shall verify HLR trace coverage, no orpha"
       & "n tags,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all tests passing, and minimum SPARK Silver level (all run-time checks prove"
       & "d,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all assertions proved, AoRTE-free).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DAL-C: DAL-C assessment shall verify HLR trace coverage, no orpha"
       & "n tags,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all tests passing, and minimum SPARK Bronze level (flow analysis passes).</p"
       & "></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DAL-D: DAL-D assessment shall verify HLR trace coverage and all t"
       & "ests"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "passing. No SPARK proof requirement.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-DAL-E: DAL-E assessment shall verify HLR trace coverage only. No "
       & "test or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof requirements.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-RENDER-ANSI: The tool shall render a colour-annotated summary rep"
       & "ort to"
