       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR-PROVE: The tool shall provide a <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> subcommand that runs GNATpro"
       & "ve"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "against the target project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s root .gpr file. gnatprove is not a declared"
