       & "          </div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <label class=""toc-overlay-icon toc-content-icon"" for=""__toc"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "            <span class=""icon""><svg><use href=""#svg-toc""></use></svg></span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "          </label>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "        </div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "        <article role=""main"" id=""furo-main-content"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-architecture-decisions"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex Architecture Decisions<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-arc"
       & "hitecture-decisions"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""dependency-management-alire"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Dependency Management: Alire<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#dependency-mana"
       & "gement-alire"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex uses <a class=""reference external"" href=""https://alire.ada.dev/"""
       & ">Alire</a> as its packaging and delivery mechanism. The publishing manifest "
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.toml</spa"
       & "n></code> declares <strong>zero dependencies</strong>. It declares no librar"
       & "ies beyond the GNAT runtime. It declares no tool dependencies.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>In particular <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>gnatprove</span></code> is <em>not</em> a declared dependency. adacovex an"
       & "alyses <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprov"
       & "e.out</span></code> files produced externally. The <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> subcommand resolves "
       & "a gnatprove executable at run time (per-project manifest, <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">$PATH</span></code>, cached toolc"
       & "hain, or download). Development-only tools (<code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code>, <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatdoc_bin</span></code>, <code clas"
       & "s=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatformat_bin</span></co"
       & "de>) are declared in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">alire-dev.toml</span></code>, which is never published to the Alire co"
       & "mmunity index.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""manifest-distinction-alire-toml-vs-alire-dev-toml"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Manifest distinction (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">alire.toml</span></code> vs <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">alire-dev.toml</span></code>)<a class=""headerlink"" h"
       & "ref=""#manifest-distinction-alire-toml-vs-alire-dev-toml"" title=""Link to this"
       & " heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "alire.toml</span></code></strong>: The clean publishing manifest. Declares n"
       & "o dependencies at"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all, so <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">install</span> <span class=""pre"">covex</span></code> ("
       & "or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">build</span></code> from source) pulls nothing beyond"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the binary and the GNAT compiler. Used for SBOM generation and dependency"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "graph scanning.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "alire-dev.toml</span></code></strong>: The development manifest. Extends <co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.toml</span><"
       & "/code> with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dev-only tools (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">gnatprove</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">gnatdoc_bin</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">gnatformat_bin</span></code>) needed for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">prove</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">doc</span></code>, and <c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">fmt</span></code>. Used for toolchain resolution when"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "running <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">exec</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>When both files exist, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Build_Dependency_Graph</span></code> reads <strong>both</strong>:"
       & " a dependency"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "declared in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ali"
       & "re.toml</span></code> is classified <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">Scope_Base</span></code> (explicit/clean dep) and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "one declared only in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">alire-dev.toml</span></code> is <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">Scope_Dev</span></code>. The scope is surfaced in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the SBOM as the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">adacovex:dep_scope</span></code> property (<code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">base</span></code> / <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">dev</span></code> / <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">transitive</span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vendored</span>"
       & "</code>), so it is always clear which file a dependency came from."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire-dev.toml<"
       & "/span></code> is also consulted for gnatprove detection"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Manifest_Decla"
       & "res_GNATprove</span></code> checks both manifests).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""gnatprove-toolchain-resolution-prove-subcommand"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>GNATprove toolchain resolution (<code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> subcommand)<a class=""headerlink"" hr"
       & "ef=""#gnatprove-toolchain-resolution-prove-subcommand"" title=""Link to this he"
       & "ading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex declares <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">gnatprove</span></code> only in its own <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire-dev.toml</span></code> (keeping the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "publishing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alir"
       & "e.toml</span></code> clean). The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> subcommand resolves the <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "executable in this order:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Per-project manifest (authoritative)</strong>: if <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/alire.toml<"
       & "/span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/"
       & "alire-dev.toml</span></code> declares a <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code> dependency, the pinned"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove binary crate is deployed standalone into <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/toolchain/</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">-n</span> <span class=""pre"">get</span> <span class=""pre"">g"
       & "natprove=&lt;version&gt;</span></code> and executed directly (the version-se"
       & "t"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "expression, for example <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">^16.1.0</span></code>, is reduced to the bare version alr"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "accepts). This isolates the proof run from the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s other dev-manifest"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tools and never swaps manifests. A manifest pin always wins. When the pinned"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "version cannot be deployed, the run fails instead of falling back.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Global version pin</strong>: the <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ADACOVEX_GNATPROVE_VERSION</span></code> en"
       & "vironment"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "variable or the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">[prove]</span> <span class=""pre"">gnatprove-version</span></code> key in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/ada"
       & "covex.toml</span></code>, deployed standalone via"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">-n</span> <span class=""pre"">get</span> <span class=""pre"">gnatp"
       & "rove=&lt;version&gt;</span></code>. It uses the same never-fall-back"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "semantics. It is folded into the proof result-cache identity.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "$PATH</span></code></strong>: a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code> already installed (for example <cod"
       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">install</span> <span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code>).</p></li"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Cached toolchain</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/toolchain/</span></code>. The downloa"
       & "d layout"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;toolchain&"
       & "gt;/bin/gnatprove</span></code>) is used. A previously <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">get</sp"
       & "an></code>-deployed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove_*/</s"
       & "pan></code> crate is also used.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Download</strong>: last-resort platform toolchain bundle.</p>"
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Effective order: <strong>manifest pin &gt; global pin (config/env) &gt; P"
       & "ATH &gt; cache &gt;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "download</strong>. If a project manifest declares <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code> but <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span></code> is missing"
       & ","
       & ASCII.LF
       & "install Alire first. The remaining fallbacks then apply.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">doc</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">fmt</span></code> t"
       & "argets still swap <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">alire-dev.toml</span></code> over"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.toml</spa"
       & "n></code> for the duration of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">gnatdoc</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">gnatformat</span></code> (the <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">_dev_cmd</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Makefile recipe backs up <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">alire.toml</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">alire.lock</span></code> / <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire/</span></code>, swaps, runs,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and restores via a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">trap</span></code>). <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">prove</span></code> does not use that swap. It deploys only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the single gnatprove crate.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The assessment and SBOM pipeline always scans the publishing <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.toml</span></code>, s"
       & "o"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dev-only tool declarations never leak into dependency graphs or SBOMs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""system-tool-dev-dependencies-sbom"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>System-tool dev dependencies (SBOM)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#system-t"
       & "ool-dev-dependencies-sbom"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Beyond the Alire graph, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">Discover_System_Dev_Deps</span></code> adds the system binaries "
       & "a project interacts with at development time (<code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">python3</span></code>, <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">git</span></code>, <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code>, <code cl"
       & "ass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span></code>, and"
       & " more) as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Scope"
       & "_Dev</span></code> SBOM components. It scans the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s dev-facing files (Makefile variants, <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">.sh</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">.py</span></code> / <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.gpr</span></code> / <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.yml</span></code> / <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.toml</span></code> / <code cl"
       & "ass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ads</span></code> / <c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adb</span></code"
       & ">) for a curated toolchain list and registers every referenced tool that is "
       & "actually installed on <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">$PATH</span></code> under a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">pkg:generic/&lt;tool&gt;</span></code> purl. Tools refer"
       & "enced nowhere in the project, or referenced but not installed, are skipped. "
       & "A Makefile at the project root implies <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">make</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The scan runs after the cached manifest graph is resolved (so cache hits "
       & "and misses agree). Each registered tool"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s version is probed by running <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">--version</span></code> (or a tool-specific subcommand such "
       & "as fossil"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">version</span"
       & "></code>) and extracting the version token, so the SBOM records the installe"
       & "d version. A probe that fails or prints no digit token leaves the version em"
       & "pty. The source file declaring the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">System_Tools</span></code> table is skipped by the scan."
       & "</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Otherwise, every installed tool on the list can be registered as a self-r"
       & "eference.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""vendored-components-and-test-labelled-dependencies-sbom"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Vendored components and test-labelled dependencies (SBOM)<a class=""heade"
       & "rlink"" href=""#vendored-components-and-test-labelled-dependencies-sbom"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Discover_Gen"
       & "eric_Vendored</span></code> walks the target tree for vendor roots"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">node_modules</"
       & "span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v"
       & "endor</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">third_party</span></code>, and the other recognised names)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Each directory inside a vendor root that carries an ecosystem manifest"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">package.json</"
       & "span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">C"
       & "argo.toml</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">go.mod</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">pyproject.toml</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">composer.json</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Gemfile</span><"
       & "/code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pom.xml"
       & "</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">Package.swift</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">requirements*.txt</span></code>) becomes one"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "component with its ecosystem purl (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">pkg:npm/...</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pkg:cargo/...</span></code>, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "more).  Its scope defaults to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">vendored</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A component is classified <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">test</span></code> when the project manifest that owns the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vendor root declares it under a test-only label:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">package."
       & "json</span></code> sections whose key contains <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test</span></code> (for example"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">testDependencie"
       & "s</span></code>);</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Cargo <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[d"
       & "ev-dependencies]</span></code> (Cargo"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s native test-only section) and any"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "section containing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">test</span></code>;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>composer <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">require-dev</span></code>;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Gemfile <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "group</span> <span class=""pre"">:test</span></code> blocks;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pom.xml<"
       & "/span></code> dependencies whose <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">&lt;scope&gt;</span></code> is <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test</span></code>;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pyprojec"
       & "t.toml</span></code> test extras and Poetry <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">[tool.poetry.group.test.*]</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "sections;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Package."
       & "swift</span></code> dependencies declared inside a <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.testTarget(...)</span></code> block.</p"
       & "></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <strong>name heuristic</strong> is the fallback for every ecosystem. "
       & " A component"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "whose name starts or ends with the literal word <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test</span></code> is test-labelled."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The check covers the full name and then the last segment after any <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/</span></code> or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">:</span></code>"
       & ", so <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;playw"
       & "right/test</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">test-case</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">github.com/stretchr/testify</span></code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">org.testng:test"
       & "ng</span></code> all match.  Ecosystems without a native test-only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "section (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">go.mod"
       & "</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">requirements*.txt</span></code>) rely on this heuristic.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The heuristic also applies to <strong>lockfile-resolved names</strong>:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pnpm-lock.yaml<"
       & "/span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">package-lock.json</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">yarn.lock</span></code> entries next to an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "owner <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">package.j"
       & "son</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Cargo.lock</span></code> crate names, and <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.lock</span></code> crates"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that the manifest sets leave transitive.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The scope is surfaced as the SBOM <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">adacovex:dep_scope</span></code> property (<code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">test</span></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and in the dashboard dependency badges, scope filter, legend, and rings."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The Alire-side <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "[[test-depends-on]]</span></code> sections and test project files are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the other source of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">test</span></code> scope; see the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference internal"" href=""../usage/sbom.html#test-dependencies""><s"
       & "pan class=""std std-ref"">SBOM reference</span></a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""unix-philosophy"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Unix Philosophy<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#unix-philosophy"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex follows the Unix philosophy of doing one thing well:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Single-purpose pipeline</strong>: Each step (scanning, proof "
       & "parsing, test parsing, DAL assessment, rendering) is a focused, composable u"
       & "nit.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Text-based interfaces</strong>: Input and output are plain te"
       & "xt (Ada source, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">.out</span></code> files, Markdown reports, ANSI terminal output).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>No library dependencies</strong>: Only the GNAT runtime is us"
       & "ed. No external"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "libraries or frameworks. Alire is the packaging/delivery mechanism but adds"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "no runtime dependency. adacovex declares no library or tool dependencies"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(gnatprove is resolved at run time by the <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> subcommand).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Composable tools</strong>: The <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> subcommand runs GNATprove"
       & " and then falls through to the standard assessment pipeline. The <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</span></code> subcomm"
       & "and generates a proof-aware SBOM independently.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Exit codes</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">0</span></code> for success (DAL achieved), <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">1</span></code> for compli"
       & "ance failure. This enables straightforward CI integration.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Minimal user code</strong>: users write as little code as pos"
       & "sible while getting"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "maximum value. The tool accepts third-party and generated code as it is. It "
       & "recognises common docstring conventions (Ada <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">--</span>&#160; <span class=""pre"">&#64;param</"
       & "span></code>, Google <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">Args:</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Returns:</span></code>, Sphinx <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">:param:</span></code>/<code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">:returns:</span></code>). It recognises co"
       & "mmon test-result formats (TAP, Automake, Surefire, Unity).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>It lowers foreign type names (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">int32_t</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">size_t</span></code>, and more) onto bounded Ada t"
       & "ypes. Nothing needs to be rewritten to be assessed.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""zero-library-dependency-design"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Zero-Library-Dependency Design<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#zero-library-"
       & "dependency-design"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex declares no library dependencies beyond the GNAT runtime. All da"
       & "ta structures use either:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>GNAT runtime containers (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">Ada.Containers.Vectors</span></code> for unbounded collecti"
       & "ons)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Fixed-size string buffers (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">Max_Line</span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">262144</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Max_Path</span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">4096"
       & "</span></code>, etc.) for bounded I/O</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Path</sp"
       & "an></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "Max_Line</span></code> scale with the auto-detected host word size"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">System.Word_Si"
       & "ze</span></code>), keeping the classic 4096 / 262144 values on 64-bit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hosts while using proportionally smaller limits on narrower machines. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "semantic limits (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>Max_Id_Str</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">Max_Desc_Str</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Filename</span></code>) are not"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "storage-size dependent and remain fixed.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Line</sp"
       & "an></code> is deliberately generous (256 KiB on 64-bit) so that single-line "
       & "declarations from heavily code-generated projects parse cleanly. When a phys"
       & "ical line <em>does</em> exceed the buffer, adacovex <strong>never truncates "
       & "it and then processes it</strong>. Truncation can silently produce a partial"
       & " (and wrong) result. Instead the parser drains the remainder, reports the fi"
       & "le and line to standard error, and fails that parse explicitly.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The source scanner counts the skipped file in <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Skipped_Ct</span></code>, which forces the"
       & " DAL assessment to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Unmet</span></code> and the exit code to <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">1</span></code> (no compliance claim can be ma"
       & "de for unread code). The same explicit-failure contract applies to every par"
       & "ser: HLR/LLR markdown, GNATprove output (text and JSON), test results, and A"
       & "lire manifest / lockfile / GPR dependency graphs. An exact buffer-length lin"
       & "e is not an overflow (it parses normally), and paths exceeding <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Path</span></code> are l"
       & "ikewise reported and skipped rather than crashing.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Overflow contract (two tiers).</strong> Path and line buffers <em"
       & ">fail loudly</em>. An"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "overlong physical line is drained and reported (<code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">line</span> <span class=""pre"">exceeds</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">Max_Line</span> <span class=""pre"">buffer</span></code>)."
       & " The file is not parsed. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">Skipped_Ct</span></code> increments. DAL becomes <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Unmet</span></code>. An overlong"
       & " path is reported and the file/subtree is skipped.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No partial results ever flow downstream. Semantic text fields (subprogram"
       & " names, HLR/LLR IDs, descriptions, docstring tag names/values, CLI strings) "
       & "are</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><em>clamped</em> to their fixed buffer with the length field (<code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Name_Len</span></code>, <c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Id_Len</span></co"
       & "de>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">D_Len</span></c"
       & "ode>, "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(166)
       & ") recording the recorded prefix, so adversarial or generated"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "input can never raise <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">Constraint_Error</span></code>. Clamping keeps the scan correct."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The full token is still consumed so following tokens are not misparsed.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Why no chunking / LEB128.</strong> adacovex audits in memory. Cou"
       & "nts (packages,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subprograms, HLR tags, tests, SBOM components) are unbounded vectors. Each s"
       & "canned unit is processed line-at-a-time into fixed per-item buffers. A singl"
       & "e Ada declaration does not admit streaming/chunked parsing. Truncating a dec"
       & "laration is worse than a loud failure.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Chunking can gain nothing. LEB128 (variable-length integer encoding) is a"
       & " serialization concern and does not apply to an in-memory CLI audit. The des"
       & "ign therefore scales to arbitrarily large codebases by dynamic allocation, b"
       & "ounded per-item buffers, and explicit overflow handling, without streaming e"
       & "ncodings.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The bounded-buffer constants are tabulated in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/api-docs/a"
       & "dacovex-types.md</span></code> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">Max_Line</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Path</span></code>, <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Desc_Str</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Max_Filename</s"
       & "pan></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ma"
       & "x_Id_Str</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This ensures adacovex can be built and run on any system with a GNAT tool"
       & "chain,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "without requiring any additional package installation beyond Alire for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "toolchain management.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""spark-formal-verification"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>SPARK Formal Verification<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#spark-formal-verif"
       & "ication"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex itself is SPARK-proven at Platinum level (all VCs proved,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "AoRTE-free). The tool analyses GNATprove output (<code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove.out</span></code>) to assess"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "SPARK assurance levels (Stone through Platinum) for target projects.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The tool does not perform verification itself. It parses and reports on p"
       & "roof"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "results produced by GNATprove. This keeps the tool"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s scope narrow and aligns"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with the Unix philosophy of composing specialised tools.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""proof-scope-and-justification-policy"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Proof scope and justification policy<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#proof-s"
       & "cope-and-justification-policy"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Proof scope is the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own units.</strong> adacovex proves the Ada/SPARK"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "code it is run against, never third-party dependencies. GNATprove units that"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are skipped (for example standard-library or vendor code that GNATprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "itself does not analyse) are tracked via <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">Units_Skipped</span></code> and reported in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ANSI and Markdown reports. They are out of proof scope by design, not a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof failure.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Justifications are an accepted discharge mechanism.</strong> "
       & "A <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Total</span><"
       & "/code> row"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Justified</span"
       & "></code> count (GNATprove <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">Annotate</span></code> justificat"
       & "ions for decidedly"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unprovable checks, such as non-functional foreign-language calls) is counted"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "neither as proved nor as unproved: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">Proved</span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">Total</span> <span class=""pre"">-</span> <span class=""pre"">Justified</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">-</span> <span class=""pre"">Unproved</span></code>."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Justified VCs do <strong>not</strong> downgrade the SPARK level. Only unprov"
       & "ed VCs do."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "This is pinned by unit tests.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Gold is the minimum compliance baseline. Platinum is the idea"
       & "l.</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Min_SPARK_For</"
       & "span></code> thresholds (A=Gold, B=Silver, C=Bronze, D/E=Stone) are the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gate for DAL compliance. Platinum is achieved and reported when every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "functional contract is proved, but it is a best-effort target, not a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "compliance requirement at any DAL level.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""ir-synthesiser"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>IR Synthesiser<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#ir-synthesiser"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/ir/<"
       & "/span></code> layer starts an intermediate representation for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cross-compilation assessments, so the tool can reason about types as they"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "exist on a target rather than only as they appear in Ada source:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex"
       & ".Target_Profiles</span></code> defines bounded machine-integer types"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">IR_Int8</span>"
       & "</code>..<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">IR_Int"
       & "64</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">IR_UInt8</span></code>..<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">IR_UInt64</span></code>) with <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">Size</span></code> clauses and a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Target_Config</"
       & "span></code> record (host/target/pointer word sizes). The types are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "SPARK-proved: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">C"
       & "hecked_Add32</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">Checked_Add64</span></code> show overflow is detected,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "not undefined.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex"
       & ".IR_Synthesiser</span></code> lowers foreign type names (<code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">int8_t</span></code>, <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">size_t</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">usize</span></c"
       & "ode>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ptrdiff_t"
       & "</span></code>, "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(166)
       & ") onto the bounded IR types and synthesizes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "package declarations from a comma/whitespace-separated type list.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex"
       & ".IR_Bounds</span></code> is a gnatprove fixture deriving synthesized-style"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">int32_t</span><"
       & "/code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">int64_"
       & "t</span></code> types and proving their <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">Add32</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Add64</span></code> overflow"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "checks, so absence of integer overflow on the lowered types is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "machine-checked.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""do-178c-dal-compliance"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>DO-178C DAL Compliance<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#do-178c-dal-complianc"
       & "e"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The DAL assessment evaluates four criteria:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>All HLRs defined in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">docs/compliance/HLR.md</span></code> are traced by <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "HLR-XXXX</span></code> tags in source</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>No orphan tags (every in-source HLR maps to a defined HLR)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>All tests passing (zero failures in <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">test_result.md</span></code>)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Minimum SPARK proof level met (varies by DAL level)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>DAL-C is the default target level. Higher levels (A, B) require stricter "
       & "proof levels (Gold, Silver respectively).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""source-scanning"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Source Scanning<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#source-scanning"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The scanner walks the target directory tree, skipping always-excluded dir"
       & "ectories (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.git<"
       & "/span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "obj</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">tests</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">config</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">.adacovex</span></code>). For each <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ads</span></code> file found, it extra"
       & "cts:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Package name from filename</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Subprogram declarations (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">procedure</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">function</span></code>, <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">generic</span> <span class=""pre"">procedu"
       & "re</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">generic</span> <span class=""pre"">function</span></code>, and <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">overriding</span></code> / "
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">not</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">overriding</span></code> variants)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Docstring annotations (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">--</span>&#160; </code> prefix with optional <code class=""doc"
       & "utils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;param</span></code>, <code"
       & " class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;return</span></"
       & "code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;fie"
       & "ld</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">&#64;formal</span></code> tags, plus Google <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Args:</span></code>/<code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Returns:</span></code> blocks and Sphin"
       & "x <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">:param:</span"
       & "></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">:retur"
       & "ns:</span></code> fields)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>HLR traceability tags (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">--</span> <span class=""pre"">HLR-XXXX</span></code>)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>In strict mode (default), the scanner also applies docstring patches from"
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacovex/patc"
       & "hes/</span></code> to document vendored/third-party code without modifying t"
       & "he originals.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""patch-system"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Patch System<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#patch-system"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacove"
       & "x/patches/</span></code> directory overlays docstring information onto"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "third-party or vendored code that cannot be modified directly, so strict mod"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "can still reach 100% docstring coverage without touching the originals.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""why-patches-exist"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Why patches exist<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#why-patches-exist"" title="""
       & "Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>In strict mode (default), all directories except <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.git</span></code>, <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">obj</span></code>, <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tests</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">config</span></"
       & "code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ada"
       & "covex</span></code> are scanned. Vendored dependencies (for example a copy o"
       & "f"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vt100 in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">demo/d"
       & "eps/vt100/</span></code>) are scanned, and their undocumented subprograms"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "count against docstring coverage. Patches document them in place.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""patch-file-format"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Patch file format<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#patch-file-format"" title="""
       & "Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A patch file is a valid Ada <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">.ads</span></code> file containing only the subprogram"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "declarations to document, each preceded by a docstring:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""c1"">--  Package-level comment (optional, not used by patch "
       & "engine).</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kd"">package</span> <span class=""nc"">VT100</span> <span class=""k"
       & "r"">is</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""c1"">--  Summary of the procedure.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""c1"">--  @param Name  Description.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""kd"">procedure</span> <span class=""nf"">Some_Procedure</span> "
       & "<span class=""p"">(</span><span class=""nv"">Name</span> <span class=""p"">: </spa"
       & "n><span class=""nv"">in</span> <span class=""nv"">Some_Type</span><span class=""p"
       & """>);</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""c1"">--  Another procedure with no params.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""kd"">procedure</span> <span class=""nf"">No_Param_Proc</span><s"
       & "pan class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kr"">end</span> <span class=""nf"">VT100</span><span class=""p"">;</"
       & "span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Rules:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>File name must match the original <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">.ads</span></code> (for example <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vt100.ads</span></code>).</p></li"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Subprogram names must match the originals exactly.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Only subprograms with preceding docstrings (<code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--</span>&#160; </code> lines) are merge"
       & "d.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Overloaded subprograms: one patch entry per overload. Each patches th"
       & "e next"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "undocumented original with the same name.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The scanner merges <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Has_Docstring</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">Doc_Param_Ct</span></code>, and <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Doc_Return</span></code> into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the matching originals.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""patch-file-location"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Patch file location<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#patch-file-location"" tit"
       & "le=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-default notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span"
       & "></span><span class=""o"">&lt;</span><span class=""n"">target</span><span class="
       & """o"">-</span><span class=""n"">project</span><span class=""o"">&gt;/.</span><span"
       & " class=""n"">adacovex</span><span class=""o"">/</span><span class=""n"">patches</s"
       & "pan><span class=""o"">/&lt;</span><span class=""n"">relative</span><span class="""
       & "o"">-</span><span class=""n"">path</span><span class=""o"">&gt;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;relative"
       & "-path&gt;</span></code> is the path from the target root to the <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ads</span></code> file. Ex"
       & "ample:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to patch <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada_CR"
       & "DT/demo/deps/vt100/vt100.ads</span></code>, create"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada_CRDT/.adaco"
       & "vex/patches/demo/deps/vt100/vt100.ads</span></code>. The <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacovex</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "directory is always excluded from source scanning.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""proof-patches-spark-contracts-over-vendored-dependencies"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Proof patches: SPARK contracts over vendored dependencies<a class=""heade"
       & "rlink"" href=""#proof-patches-spark-contracts-over-vendored-dependencies"" titl"
       & "e=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The same <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ad"
       & "acovex/patches/&lt;relative-path&gt;</span></code> file can carry <strong>SP"
       & "ARK proof aspects</strong> in addition to docstrings, so vendored dependenci"
       & "es participate in the SPARK proof without modifying their sources. A patch f"
       & "ile that includes any of <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">Pre</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span></code>, <code"
       & " class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Post</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">=&gt;</span></code>, or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">Global</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span></code> (dete"
       & "cted by <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacove"
       & "x.</span> <span class=""pre"">Prove_Patch.</span> <span class=""pre"">Has_Proof<"
       & "/span></code>) is a <em>proof patch</em>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A patch with only docstrings remains a docstring overlay and never engage"
       & "s the proof machinery. This section is the design. For the user-facing guide"
       & " "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " how proving works, writing SPARK contracts, and the <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ads</span></code>/<code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adb</span></code> patch files wit"
       & "h worked examples and pitfalls "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " see <a class=""reference internal"" href=""proving.html""><span class=""std std-"
       & "doc"">Proving and writing proofs</span></a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""kd"">package</span> <span class=""nc"">VT100</span> <span clas"
       & "s=""nc"">with</span> <span class=""nc"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""p"">=&gt;<"
       & "/span> <span class=""nc"">On</span> <span class=""kr"">is</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""c1"">--  Scroll a region of the screen up.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""c1"">--  @param From  Starting line of scroll region.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""c1"">--  @param To    Ending line of scroll region.</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""kd"">procedure</span> <span class=""nf"">Scroll_Screen</span> <"
       & "span class=""p"">(</span><span class=""nv"">From</span> <span class=""p"">: </span"
       & "><span class=""nv"">in</span> <span class=""nv"">Natural</span><span class=""p"">;"
       & "</span> <span class=""nv"">To</span> <span class=""p"">: </span><span class=""nv"""
       & ">in</span> <span class=""nv"">Natural</span><span class=""p"">)</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "     <span class=""kn"">with</span> <span class=""n"">Pre</span> <span class=""p"""
       & ">=&gt;</span> <span class=""n"">From</span> <span class=""o"">&lt;=</span> <span"
       & " class=""n"">To</span><span class=""p"">;</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kr"">end</span> <span class=""nf"">VT100</span><span class=""p"">;</"
       & "span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</s"
       & "pan></code> subcommand merges proof patches before running gnatprove:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Count_Pr"
       & "oof_Patches</span></code> scans <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/.adacovex/patches/</span></code> (<code clas"
       & "s=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ads</span></code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adb</span></co"
       & "de> patch files). A target with no proof patches is proved against"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "its own tree exactly as before.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Build_Pa"
       & "tched_Copy</span></code> copies the target tree (excluding <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.git</span></code>, <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">obj</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacovex</"
       & "span></code>) into <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">&lt;target&gt;/obj/adacovex-proof/</span></code> and overwrites each pro"
       & "of-patched source with its merged form "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " package-level aspects spliced onto the package declaration line (for a <cod"
       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">package</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">body</span> <span class=""pre"">...</span> <span class=""pre"">is<"
       & "/span></code> declaration too), and each aspect-carrying subprogram declarat"
       & "ion replaced by the patch"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s declaration block. The merge matches on name <strong>and</strong> normalis"
       & "ed parameter profile (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">Param_Profile</span></code>), so an overloaded subprogram patches its"
       & " exact signature and never a same-named sibling. The default <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">in</span></code> mode is equiv"
       & "alent to a bare mode. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"">out</span></code> and <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">out</span></code> are distinct. A "
       & "spec declaration terminates at its <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">;</span></code>, a body declaration at its <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">is</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " so a patched body declaration is replaced without touching the body proper."
       & "</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The original vendored sources are never touched.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"" start=""3"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>gnatprove runs against the copy"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s root project (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">&lt;copy&gt;/&lt;basename&gt;.gpr</span></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the resulting <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">gnatprove.out</span></code> is copied back to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/"
       & "obj/gnatprove/gnatprove.out</span></code> for the assessment pipeline. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "copy lives under the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">obj/</span></"
       & "code>, so it is excluded from scanning,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest graphs, and the prove input hash.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Proof-patch contents are folded into the prove result-cache key, so a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "patch edit invalidates the cached proof and forces a re-prove.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""the-two-patch-shapes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h4>The two patch shapes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#the-two-patch-shapes"" t"
       & "itle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h4>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A <strong>spec patch</strong> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">.ads</span></code> in the patch directory) re-declares th"
       & "e vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "spec with contracts, exactly as the VT100 example above. gnatprove analyses"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a unit"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s body only when the <em>body itself</em> opts in (<code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt"
       & ";</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></code> on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the package body or a subprogram body), so a SPARK-clean vendored body also"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "needs a <strong>body patch</strong> (<code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">.adb</span></code> in the patch directory) that declar"
       & "es the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "intended mode. The body patch mirrors the body"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s declarations with stub"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bodies that the merge ignores "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the original body proper is preserved:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""c1"">--  .adacovex/patches/demo/deps/vecmath/vecmath.adb</sp"
       & "an>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kd"">package</span> <span class=""kd"">body</span> <span class=""nc"
       & """>Vecmath</span> <span class=""nc"">with</span> <span class=""nc"">SPARK_Mode</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""p"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""nc"">On</span> <span class=""kr"
       & """>is</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""kd"">function</span> <span class=""nf"">Clamp</span> <span clas"
       & "s=""p"">(</span><span class=""nv"">Value</span> <span class=""p"">: </span><span c"
       & "lass=""nv"">in</span> <span class=""nv"">Integer</span><span class=""p"">;</span> "
       & "<span class=""nv"">Lo</span> <span class=""p"">: </span><span class=""nv"">in</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""nv"">Integer</span><span class=""p"">;</span> <span class=""nv"">"
       & "Hi</span> <span class=""p"">: </span><span class=""nv"">in</span> <span class=""n"
       & "v"">Integer</span><span class=""p"">)</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "     <span class=""kr"">return</span> <span class=""kt"">Integer</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""kn"">with</span> <span class=""n"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""p"">=&gt;"
       & "</span> <span class=""n"">On</span> <span class=""kr"">is</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""kr"">begin</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "      <span class=""kc"">null</span><span class=""p"">;</span>  <span class=""c1"""
       & ">--  stub: replaced by the original body's implementation</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "   <span class=""kr"">end</span> <span class=""nf"">Clamp</span><span class=""p"">"
       & ";</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""kr"">end</span> <span class=""nf"">Vecmath</span><span class=""p"">;"
       & "</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A worked example end to end: a vendored <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">Vecmath.Clamp</span></code> whose original"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "spec and body carry no contracts, with the spec patch above declaring"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></code> plus <c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Pre</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">Lo</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;="
       & "</span> <span class=""pre"">Hi,</span> <span class=""pre"">Post</span> <span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">Clamp'Result</span> <span class=""pre"
       & """>in</span> <span class=""pre"">Lo</span> <span class=""pre"">..</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">Hi</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the body patch opting the body into the proof. The merged copy is what"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove sees "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">package</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">body</span> <span class=""pre"">Vecmath</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">with</span> <span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt"
       & ";</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span> <span class=""pre"">is</span></code> with"
       & " the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "original <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">if</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">Value</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">Lo</span> <span class=""pre"">...</span> <span class=""pre"">return</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">Value</span></code> implementation intact "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "contracts prove: 2 VCs (the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">Clamp</span></code> postcondition and its termination"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "check), 0 unproved.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Where the vendored body is SPARK-clean and opted in via a body patch,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove proves the patched contracts. Where it is not (for example bodies"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that call <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.T"
       & "ext_IO</span></code>, which is <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">Off</span></code>), gnat"
       & "prove skips the I/O"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bodies by design and reports the unit out of proof scope "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a proof patch"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "never drags the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s proof level down. The Ada_CRDT dogfood target"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proves the mechanism end to end: its"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.adacovex/patch"
       & "es/demo/deps/vt100/vt100.ads</span></code> declares <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">=&g"
       & "t;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "on the vendored package and pins the <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">Scroll_Screen</span></code> scroll-region"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "contract (its bodies are Text_IO-bound, so gnatprove skips them by design),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">run-ada-crdt</span></code> / Ada_CRDT"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> run through the patched"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "copy, preserving the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s proof.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""output-formats"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Output Formats<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#output-formats"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex supports multiple output formats:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>ANSI terminal report</strong>: Colour-coded summary for inter"
       & "active use."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Colour is suppressed under CI, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">NO_COLOR</span></code>, or <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">TERM=dumb</span></code>, so CI logs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stay plain (see <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">Adacovex.Ansi</span></code> and its pure decision function"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Colour_Allowed<"
       & "/span></code>)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>SVG badges</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">spark.svg</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tests.svg</span></code>, <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs.svg</span></code>, plus <code "
       & "class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">do178c.svg</span></co"
       & "de> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">iso26262.svg</s"
       & "pan></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">i"
       & "ec62304.svg</span></code> compliance badges (<code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard=all</span></code> emits all"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "three) for CI badges</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Markdown reports</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">VERIFICATION.md</span></code> and <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">TRACE.md</span></code> for com"
       & "pliance documentation</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>HTML dashboard</strong>: Interactive web dashboard with JSON "
       & "API (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve</s"
       & "pan></code>)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It is standard-aware (defaults to all standards like <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</span></code>) with light/dark"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "theme support (toggle button, respects <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">prefers-color-scheme</span></code>). The static"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "page shell (CSS, header, theme script) is a real HTML file,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources/dashb"
       & "oard.html</span></code>, bundled into the binary at build time."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-dashb"
       & "oard.py</span></code> assembles the authored CSS (<code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources/css/dashboard.css</span></code>"
       & "),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the authored JS (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>resources/js/*.js</span></code>), and the vendored JavaScript"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "libraries at the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>resources/</span></code> root (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">graphre.js</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">nomnoml.js</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">flexsearch.js</"
       & "span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">y"
       & "ace.js</span></code>) into a single minified page shell. The layout"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "separates dependency JavaScript (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">resources/</span></code> root) from authored dashboard"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JavaScript (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">res"
       & "ources/js/</span></code>), which is also how the SBOM asset scanner"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tells vendored components from the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own modules.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The tool regenerates <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads</span></code> (a String"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "constant, committed and byte-identical when unchanged).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Ada compiler includes that constant in the final binary. Every releas"
       & "ed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "binary - whether a GitHub release artifact or an Alire crate binary - carrie"
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the complete dashboard with no external file dependencies.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>At runtime, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "Adacovex.Renderers.HTML.Render_Dashboard_Internal</span></code> only builds"
