       & ASCII.LF
       & "                              <span class=""n"">the</span> <span class=""n"">JSO"
       & "N</span> <span class=""n"">API</span><span class=""p"">,</span> <span class=""n"">"
       & "the</span> <span class=""n"">SVG</span> <span class=""n"">badges</span><span cla"
       & "ss=""p"">,</span> <span class=""ow"">and</span> <span class=""n"">the</span> <span"
       & " class=""n"">bundled</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                              <span class=""n"">offline</span> <span class=""n"""
       & ">manual</span> <span class=""n"">at</span> <span class=""o"">/</span><span class"
       & "=""n"">docs</span><span class=""p"">)</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""mf"">14.</span> <span class=""n"">Set</span> <span class=""n"">exit<"
       & "/span> <span class=""n"">code</span>            <span class=""o"">-&gt;</span> <"
       & "span class=""mi"">0</span> <span class=""k"">if</span> <span class=""n"">Achieved<"
       & "/span><span class=""p"">,</span> <span class=""mi"">1</span> <span class=""k"">if<"
       & "/span> <span class=""n"">Unmet</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Differential modes (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">--compare-base</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">--coverage-delta</span></code>) run before the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pipeline and snapshot a base revision via <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.VCS</span></code> (git <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">worktree</span> <span class=""pre"
       & """>add</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hg <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">archive</spa"
       & "n></code>, svn <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "export</span></code>, fossil <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">open</span></code> on a copied DB, or a git worktree"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "against the jj store), assess base and current tree, report the delta, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "exit. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">man</span"
       & "></code> installs the generated man page (<code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.Renderers.Man</span></code>) into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the local man database (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">~/.local/share/man</span></code>, Linux/WSL) and refreshes it with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">mandb</span></c"
       & "ode>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""swapping-the-gnat-compiler-llvm-backend"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Swapping the GNAT compiler (LLVM backend)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#sw"
       & "apping-the-gnat-compiler-llvm-backend"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex and Alire both default to the GCC-based <strong>GNAT</strong> (<"
       & "code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnat_native</spa"
       & "n></code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "compiler. No action is needed. Only swap if you specifically want an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "LLVM-backend GNAT (for example GNAT LLVM) for your target project "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "example to exercise dissimilar redundancy via diverse code generation.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>GNAT LLVM is <strong>not</strong> yet packaged as a standard Alire toolch"
       & "ain crate, so two"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "paths exist:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Alire-managed compiler (preferred when available).</strong> I"
       & "f a GNAT LLVM binary"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "release becomes available in the Alire index, declare it in your"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire.toml</spa"
       & "n></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ali"
       & "re-dev.toml</span></code>:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-toml notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
       & "span><span class=""k"">[[depends-on]]</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">gnat_llvm</span><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""o"">=</s"
       & "pan><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""s2"">""*""</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span></"
       & "code> then selects it automatically for that project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s builds. You can also"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pick a default compiler for all projects with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">toolchain</span> <span class=""pre"">--select</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">--disable-assistant</span></code> and choosing the LLVM GNAT.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>System-installed GNAT LLVM.</strong> Install GNAT LLVM on <co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">$PATH</span></code"
       & ">, then force the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Ada toolchain in the root <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">.gpr</span></code> so <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">gprbuild</span></code> does not fall back to the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GCC GNAT:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-gpr notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan>for Toolchain_Name (""Ada"") use ""GNAT_LLVM"";"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>You can confirm which compiler built a given <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ali</span></code> file by its first line"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GNAT</span></c"
       & "ode> vs <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GNAT-LL"
       & "VM</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Notes:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>GNAT LLVM and GCC GNAT are not guaranteed ABI-compatible. Compile all"
       & " Ada in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a project with the same compiler.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>GNAT LLVM"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">-fstack-check"
       & "</span></code> support is partial and some features"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Scalar_Storage"
       & "_Order</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">Convention</span> <span class=""pre"">C++</span></code>) differ from GC"
       & "C GNAT.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>SPARK proof results are compiler-independent, so <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span> <span class=""pre"">prov"
       & "e</span></code> and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "DAL assessment are unaffected by the choice.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
