       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Contributor guide: codebase structure and setup<a class=""headerlink"" hre"
       & "f=""#contributor-guide-codebase-structure-and-setup"" title=""Link to this head"
       & "ing"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This page is a human-readable tour of the adacovex codebase for people wh"
       & "o want"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to build, test, or modify it. It supplements"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/bladeacer/adacovex/bl"
       & "ob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"">CONTRIBUTING.md</a> (process, changelog format, PR "
       & "rules)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "This page is about <strong>how the code is organised and how to get a workin"
       & "g"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "development environment</strong>. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">AGENTS.md</span></code> is the machine-facing version of "
       & "the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "same information.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""setting-up-the-repository"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Setting up the repository<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#setting-up-the-rep"
       & "ository"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Prerequisites:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Alire</strong> &gt;= 2.0 (<code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span></code>) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the Ada package manager. It downloads and manages"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the GNAT toolchain for you.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>GNAT</strong> Ada compiler "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
