       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">requirements.txt</span></code>.  The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pages are never converted to reStructuredText.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The bundled manual is served by <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code> at <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/docs</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">book-links-check</span></code> fails when a link in th"
       & "e bundled manual does not"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "resolve (checked against a fresh <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">sphinx-build</span></code>, so a stale local"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/_build/htm"
       & "l</span></code> cannot mask a broken link);"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">python3</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">tools/gen-docs.py</span> <span class=""pre"">--check</span><"
       & "/code> (also in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">make</span> <span class=""pre"">check</span></code>) fails when the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "committed spec is stale.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""generated-outputs"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Generated outputs<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#generated-outputs"" title="""
       & "Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/com"
       & "pliance/VERIFICATION.md</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">docs/compliance/TRACE.md</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/compliance"
       & "/HLR.md</span></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">docs/compliance/LLR.md</span></code> are generated per"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "target.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/bad"
       & "ges/*.svg</span></code> are regenerated by <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">run-self</span></c"
       & "ode> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/api"
       & "-docs/</span></code> is regenerated by <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">doc</span></code>.</p>"
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/_bu"
       & "ild/</span></code> is the Sphinx build output and is <strong>not</strong> co"
       & "mmitted (it is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gitignored, so the generated <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">_sources/</span></code> copies and <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.doctrees/</span></code> side-car"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "files never pollute git); regenerate it locally with <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">book</sp"
       & "an></code> whenever"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/</span></c"
       & "ode> changes.  The committed artifact is the generated spec"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/adacovex-do"
