       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""testing"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Testing<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#testing"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The test suite is native and zero-dependency. <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/tests/</span></code> holds one file pe"
       & "r category (scanner, config, types, renderers, SBOM, VCS, and more). Each fi"
       & "le exposes a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ru"
       & "n</span> <span class=""pre"">(R</span> <span class=""pre"">:</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"">out</span> <span class=""pre"">Runner'Class)"
       & "</span></code> procedure wired into <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">src/tests/test_runner.adb</span></code>. A test is a <c"
       & "ode class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">R.</span> <span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Check</span> <span class=""pre"">(Condition,</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">&quot;Description&quot;)</span></code> call.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The runner counts them, prints a per-category table, and writes <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/test_result.md</spa"
       & "n></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-ada notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></s"
       & "pan><span class=""c1"">-- src/tests/adacovex_scanner_tests.adb (pattern to fol"
       & "low)</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">Adacovex</span><span class=""p"">.</span><span class=""n"">Parse"
       & "rs</span><span class=""p"">.</span><span class=""n"">Source</span><span class=""p"
       & """>.</span><span class=""n"">Scan_Ads_File</span> <span class=""p"">(</span><span"
       & " class=""n"">Tmp_File</span><span class=""p"">,</span> <span class=""n"">Pkg</span"
       & "><span class=""p"">,</span> <span class=""n"">Success</span><span class=""p"">);</"
       & "span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">R</span><span class=""p"">.</span><span class=""n"">Check</span>"
       & " <span class=""p"">(</span><span class=""n"">Success</span><span class=""p"">,</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""s"">""Test 1: parse succeeded""</span><span class=""p"">);</span"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>After adding or removing tests:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-bash notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
       & "span>make<span class=""w""> </span><span class=""nb"">test</span><span class=""w"""
       & ">          </span><span class=""c1""># rebuild + run; rewrites docs/test_resul"
       & "t.md</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "make<span class=""w""> </span>test-count<span class=""w"">    </span><span class"
       & "=""c1""># sync every anchored count across the repo (AGENTS.md,</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">                   </span><span class=""c1""># README, Makefil"
       & "e, CI workflows, manifests, agents-tree.map)</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The count-sync is enforced by <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">check</span></code>. A test "
       & "change that skips the sync fails the gate. Tests write to <code class=""docut"
       & "ils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/tmp</span></code> scratch dirs a"
       & "nd clean up after themselves. The default on-disk result cache (<code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/cache</span></c"
       & "ode>) is shared.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Tests that exercise caching use content-hashed keys. They never depend on"
       & " each other"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s state.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""documentation-and-dashboard-tooling"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Documentation and dashboard tooling<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#document"
       & "ation-and-dashboard-tooling"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The pure-stdlib Python gates keep the docs and the dashboard in step with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the code.  They are the drop-in replacements for the npm tools (stylelint,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and more) that a JavaScript toolchain would use; adacovex keeps its dev"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tooling Python-only by convention:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/cs"
       & "slint.py</span></code> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">csslint-check</span></code>) enforces"
       & " the 4px spacing rule:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "every <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">margin</s"
       & "pan></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pa"
       & "dding</span></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">gap</span></code> pixel length is a multiple of 4px."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It runs inside <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "make</span> <span class=""pre"">build</span></code> and <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">check</"
       & "span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/ch"
       & "eck-docs.py</span></code> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">docs-check</span></code>) fails wh"
       & "en any paragraph in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "user docs, README, or human changelogs exceeds four sentences, and it"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rejects em dashes and Latin abbreviations (<code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">i.e.</span></code>, <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">e.g.</span></code>, <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">etc.</span></code>)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/para-spli"
       & "t.py</span></code> rewraps over-long paragraphs to comply.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/ge"
       & "n-dashboard.py</span></code> bundles the dashboard resources into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/adacovex-da"
       & "shboard_template.ads</span></code> and minifies the authored CSS and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JavaScript (comments stripped, whitespace collapsed) before inlining.</p></l"
       & "i>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Edit the dashboard under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">resources/</span></code>, never the generated template.  After"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "any docs or resource change, run <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">docs-check</span></code> and"
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">csslint-check</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "before committing.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""spark-proof-discipline"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>SPARK proof discipline<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#spark-proof-disciplin"
       & "e"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> runs gnatprove through the <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> subcom"
       & "mand and enforces the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Platinum gate: <strong>0 unproved VCs and 0 justified VCs</strong>. The rule"
       & "s that keep the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof tractable:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Every user assertion and every runtime check must be proved.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>No <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pragm"
       & "a</span> <span class=""pre"">Assume</span></code> / <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">Annotate<"
       & "/span></code> justifications.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>No <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pragm"
       & "a</span> <span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">(Off)</span><"
       & "/code> anywhere except <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">Types.Implementation</span></code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Complexity</spa"
       & "n></code> (the two non-formal-<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">Ada.Containers</span></code> packages. Non-formal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.Containers<"
       & "/span></code> are illegal in SPARK_Mode-On code "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " gnatprove rejects"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "them; the evidence is in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">docs/proof/16.1.0-ledger.md</span></code>. <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">spark-of"
       & "f-check</span></code> enforces this.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>I/O- and container-heavy units are default-off bodies or carry per-su"
       & "bprogram"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></code> aspects"
       & ". They never carry an explicit Off pragma.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The proof result is anchored in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">docs/proof/</span></code> (the per-version VC ledger)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">proof-status</span></code> syncs the VC count and SPARK level"
       & " into the docs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""common-workflows"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Common workflows<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#common-workflows"" title=""Li"
       & "nk to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Assess another project</strong>: <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">--target="
       & "PATH</span> <span class=""pre"">--dal=C</span></code> (see"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference internal"" href=""../usage/target-projects.html""><span cla"
       & "ss=""std std-doc"">Target projects</span></a>).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Dogfood</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">run-self</span></code> (adac"
       & "ovex against itself) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">run-ada-crdt</span></code> (against "
       & "the sibling <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">../"
       & "Ada_CRDT</span></code> checkout, strict mode). Both"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "must stay green.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Coverage gate between releases</strong>: <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">cover"
       & "age-gate</span></code> compares docstring"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "coverage between the latest two release tags.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Prepare a release</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">bump-version</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">VERSION=x.y.z</span></code>, write the changelog"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/changelog"
       & "s/adacovex-x.y.z.md</span></code>, canonical format enforced by <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">changelog-check</span></code>), then <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">release</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">VERSION=x.y.z</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Keep docs current</strong>: every code change updates the rel"
       & "evant user docs,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the Ada docstrings that feed <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">docs/api-docs</span></code>, and the changelog, then"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "re-runs the sync gates (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">docs-check</span></code>, <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">action-parity-check</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">agents-tree</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">doc-links</span></c"
       & "ode>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">link-check</span></code>).  Stale docs are a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "release blocker.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Debug</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">--verbose</span></code> pr"
       & "ints pipeline step diagnostics. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">status</span></code> repo"
       & "rts toolchain + platform state. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">--no-cache</span></code> bypasses the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "on-disk result cache when inputs changed without content changing.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
