       & "caller instantiates"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "with actual parameters. Used with the nouns package, subprogram, or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "procedure.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Approved Form:</strong> Generic (as modifier only)</p></li>"
