       & "<li><p><strong>Incorrect Example:</strong> <em>The source is written in Spar"
       & "k and proved with gnatprove.</em></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""category-domain-and-mathematical-terms"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Category: Domain and Mathematical Terms<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#cate"
       & "gory-domain-and-mathematical-terms"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""technical-name-verification-condition-vc"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h4>Technical Name: Verification Condition (VC)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#"
       & "technical-name-verification-condition-vc"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h4>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Part of Speech:</strong> Noun</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Definition:</strong> A logical statement that a proof tool mu"
       & "st prove. gnatprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reports VCs per check category, for example flow, run-time, and assertion.</"
       & "p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Approved Form:</strong> Verification Condition (singular), Ve"
       & "rification"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Conditions (plural), VC (singular), VCs (plural)</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Do Not Use:</strong> Proof goal, Proof obligation, Test case<"
       & "/p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Correct Example:</strong> <em>The proof proves all 722 <stron"
       & "g>VCs</strong>.</em></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Incorrect Example:</strong> <em>The proof proves all 722 proo"
       & "f obligations.</em></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""technical-name-assertion"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h4>Technical Name: Assertion<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#technical-name-ass"
       & "ertion"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h4>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Part of Speech:</strong> Noun</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Definition:</strong> A user-written property that must hold a"
       & "t a point in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "program. In Ada, an assertion is a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">Assert</span></code>.</p"
       & "></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Approved Form:</strong> Assertion (singular), Assertions (plu"
