       & "proves that the index is in range.</em></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Incorrect Example:</strong> <em>The assumption proves that th"
       & "e index is in range.</em></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""technical-name-proof"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h4>Technical Name: Proof<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#technical-name-proof"" "
       & "title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h4>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Part of Speech:</strong> Noun</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Definition:</strong> A formal demonstration, produced by a pr"
       & "oof tool, that a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "property of the program holds.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Approved Form:</strong> Proof (singular), Proofs (plural)</p>"
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Do Not Use:</strong> Verification (when the proof result is m"
