       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""adacovex-proof-debt-ledger-gnatprove-16-1-0"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>adacovex proof debt ledger "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " gnatprove 16.1.0<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-proof-debt-ledger-gna"
       & "tprove-16-1-0"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-14</em> (baseline), <em>2026-08-15</em> (resolution), <"
       & "em>2026-08-24</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(extension), <em>2026-08-28</em> (1.32.0: Route expression-function conversi"
       & "on)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Prover: gnatprove 16.1.0 (deployed crate <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove_16.1.0_82528bef</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Status: <strong>0 unproved</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <strong>725 VCs total, 725 proved, 0 unproved</strong>, 54 analysed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "units, no <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK"
       & "_Mode(Off)</span></code> and no justified VCs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""the-509-168-baseline-was-a-false-count"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>The 509/168 baseline was a false count<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#the-5"
       & "09-168-baseline-was-a-false-count"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The earlier baseline quoted <strong>509 VCs total, 168 unproved</strong> "
       & "(Silver). That"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "figure does not reproduce on this codebase:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>A fresh gnatprove 16.1.0 run on the pre-audit code reports <strong>36"
       & "9 total"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "checks</strong> (55 flow / 255 proved / 59 unproved at gnatprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s default step"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "budget, 303 proved / 11 unproved at <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">--level=4</span></code>).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "509"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " figure was never produced by a documented invocation; it was a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stale/aggregated count, so every number derived from it (Silver level,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "168 unproved, 65% proof gate) was a false positive.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The honest count at the standard invocation (<code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">prove</sp"
       & "an></code>, which now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "passes <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--steps="
       & "10000</span></code> by default) is <strong>725 VCs, 0 unproved</strong>, i.e"
       & ". the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "self-assessment level is <strong>Platinum</strong>, not Silver.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""baseline-current-head-before-fixes-gnatprove-default-steps"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Baseline (current HEAD before fixes, gnatprove default steps)<a class=""h"
       & "eaderlink"" href=""#baseline-current-head-before-fixes-gnatprove-default-steps"
       & """ title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>110 unproved VCs split across three packages:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>Package</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Unproved</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Check kinds</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">adacovex-ir_synthesiser.adb</span></code></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>53</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>concat length ranges, loop invariant/overflow on cursor arithmetic</p"
       & "></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">adacovex-parsers-tests.adb</span></code></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>30</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>cursor-loop overflow/array-index, digit-accumulation overflow</p></td"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">adacovex-renderers-sbom.adb</span></code></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>26</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>calendar-loop overflow, string-concat bounds, length-sums</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">adacovex-types.adb</span></code></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>1</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>function-contract context</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The bulk were solver step-limit timeouts ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "provers reached step limit before"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "completing the proof"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & "), not genuine proof gaps: bumping the step budget from"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s default to 5000 discharges them. A handful needed real contract"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and structure fixes.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""fixes-applied-per-package"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Fixes applied (per package)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#fixes-applied-pe"
       & "r-package"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""adacovex-renderers-sbom-adb-iso-from-epoch-i2s-pad2"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-re"
       & "nderers-sbom.adb</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " ISO_From_Epoch, I2S, Pad2<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#adacovex-renderers-sb"
       & "om-adb-iso-from-epoch-i2s-pad2"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "I2S</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">Pad2</span></code> contracts strengthened</strong> (<code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ads</span></code> + <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Refined_Post</span></code> in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "body): added <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Re"
       & "sult'First</span> <span class=""pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"">1</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">..</span> <span class=""pre"">10</span></code> and <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Result'Last</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">in</span> <span class=""pre"">1</span> <span class=""pre"">..</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">10</span> <span class=""pre"">/</span> <span class=""pre"">11</"
       & "span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bounds so caller-side string-concatenation and length-sum overflow checks"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "can be discharged against the function contracts instead of the full"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "calendar-math context.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Year loop</strong>: restructured <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">exit</span> <span class=""pre"">when</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">...</span></code> into an explicit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">if</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">Din</span> <span class=""pre"">&gt;=</span> <span class=""pre"">Day"
       & "s_In_Year</span> <span class=""pre"">(Yr)</span> <span class=""pre"">then</span>"
       & "</code> guard, and hoisted the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">Days_In_Year</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "call into a constant so the subtraction overflow check sees the guard"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "directly.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Month loop</strong>: same <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">if</span> <span class=""pre"">...</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">then</span></code> guard + constant hoist, and added the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Din</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">&lt;</span> <span class=""pre"">Days_Remaining</span> <span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">(Mo)</span></code> loop invariant (a case-expression table of the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "days left in the year from month <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">Mo</span></code>) so <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">Assert</span> <span class=""pre"">(Din</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">&lt;</span> <span class=""pre"">31)</span></code> after the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "loop is provable on both exit paths.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "Dy</span> <span class=""pre"">+</span> <span class=""pre"">1</span></code></stro"
       & "ng>: guarded with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">Assert</span> <span class=""pre"">(Dy</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;=</span>"
