       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">Assert</span> <span class=""pre"">(Din</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">&lt;</span> <span class=""pre"">31)</span></code>).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Removed dead initializers</strong> on <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Mo</span></code>/<code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Dy</span></code> (flagged as "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "initialization has"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "no effect"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ").</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "Proof_Level_Property</span></code> postcondition</strong>: changed from a fi"
       & "ve-way"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "string-equality disjunction (which timed out because the body delegates to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Types.To_String"
