       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""default-off-pure-logic-bodies-provable-in-principle-expanded-20"
       & "26-08-22"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Default-off pure-logic bodies (provable in principle, expanded <em>2026-"
       & "08-22</em>)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#default-off-pure-logic-bodies-provab"
       & "le-in-principle-expanded-2026-08-22"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>These bodies contain only string/int manipulation and no I/O, so they are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "candidates for per-subprogram <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">On</span></code>.  The <em>2026-08-22</em> expansion"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "opted nine of them in with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">Pre</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">Post</span></code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">Global</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">null</span></code> contracts and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "necessary <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Loop_"
       & "Invariant</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">Loop_Variant</span></code> annotations:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "adacovex-renderers-sbom.adb</span></code></strong>: <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Escape_JSON</span></code> (1 function) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " body"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "annotated <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK"
       & "_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></cod"
       & "e>; the 6x-per-byte output buffer bound"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">1</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">..</span> <span class=""pre"">6*S'Length</span></code>) and the <"
       & "code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Len</span> <span"
       & " class=""pre"">&lt;=</span> <span class=""pre"">(I</span> <span class=""pre"">-</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">S'First)*6</span></code> invariant discharge the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hex-escape and concatenation checks.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "adacovex-cpus.adb</span></code></strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">Jobs_Justification</span></code> (1 function) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " pure string"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "concatenation over <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">Integer'Image</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">Natural'Image</span></code>; <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Global</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">null</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "suffices.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "adacovex-vcs.adb</span></code></strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">First_Line</span></code>, <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Field_Value</span></code>, <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">UX_Note</span></code> (3 fu"
       & "nctions)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">First_Line</sp"
       & "an></code> is a two-loop LF scan with <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">Loop_Invariant</span> <span class=""pre"">(Start</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">&gt;=</span> <span class=""pre"">Buf'First)</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Loop_Varian"
       & "t</span> <span class=""pre"">(Increases</span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">Start)</span></code>; <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">Field_Value</span></code> is a keyword-search"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "outer loop plus two inner blank/LF scans, all bounded by <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Buf'First</span> <span class=""pre"""
       & ">..</span> <span class=""pre"">Stop</span></code>"
