       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""spark-mode-off-exceptions-verified-irreducible-2026-08-24"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>SPARK Mode Off exceptions verified irreducible (<em>2026-08-24</em>)<a c"
       & "lass=""headerlink"" href=""#spark-mode-off-exceptions-verified-irreducible-2026"
       & "-08-24"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>1.26.0 restricted <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">(Off)</span></code> to three docum"
       & "ented exceptions: the non-formal-<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">Ada.</span> <span class=""pre"">Containers</span></code> ins"
       & "tantiations in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "Adacovex.</span> <span class=""pre"">Complexity</span></code> and `Adacovex. T"
       & "ypes.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Implementation<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>,</span> <span class=""pre"">and</span> </code>Adacovex. CPUs. Get_Temp_Dire"
       & "ctory<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""> <span class=""pre"">(</span><"
       & "/code>Ada. Environment_Variables`).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>In 1.27.0 each exception was re-tested against gnatprove 16.1.0 with mini"
       & "mal <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode<"
       & "/span> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></code> scr"
       & "atch units.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""empirical-result-containers-are-irreducible"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Empirical result: containers are irreducible<a class=""headerlink"" href="""
       & "#empirical-result-containers-are-irreducible"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A scratch spec/body pair instantiating <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.Containers.Vectors</span></code> under"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">=&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">On</span></code> fails g"
       & "natprove 16.1.0 flow analysis with:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-default notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span"
       & "></span><span class=""n"">error</span><span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""s2"
       & """>""Vector""</span> <span class=""ow"">is</span> <span class=""ow"">not</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""n"">allowed</span> <span class=""ow"">in</span> <span class=""n"">SPARK"
       & "</span> <span class=""p"">(</span><span class=""n"">due</span> <span class=""n"">t"
       & "o</span> <span class=""n"">entity</span> <span class=""n"">declared</span> <span"
       & " class=""k"">with</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""n"">Off</span><span class=""p"">"
       & ")</span>   <span class=""p"">[</span><span class=""n"">violation</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""n"">of</span> <span class=""n"">aspect</span> <span class=""n"">SPARK_Mode</"
       & "span><span class=""p"">]</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The GNAT 16.2.1 runtime specs (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">ada-containers.ads</span></code>, <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">a-cforio.ads</span></code>) carry no <"
       & "code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span"
       & "></code> pragma, but gnatprove treats the non-formal containers as not-allow"
       & "ed in On code. The formal containers (<code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.</span> <span class=""pre"">Containers.</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">Formal_*</span></code>) would need a different hybrid API (cur"
       & "sor-less iteration) across the whole codebase; the proof surface would grow "
       & "far beyond the fixed-buffer logic this ledger tracks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Both container exceptions therefore stay <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">SPARK_Mode</span> <span class=""pre"">(Off)</span"
       & "></code> by design: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">Adacovex.</span> <span class=""pre"">Complexity</span></code> (private co"
       & "ntainer-based metrics) and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">Adacovex.</span> <span class=""pre"">Types.</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">Implementation</span></code> (the shared container store).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Makefile <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">spark-off-check</span></code> gate now allows exactly these two packages.</"
       & "p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""empirical-evidence-env-var-reads-analyse-on"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Empirical evidence: env-var reads analyse on<a class=""headerlink"" href="""
