       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""formal-containers-experiment-the-complexity-exception-stays-202"
       & "6-08-25"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Formal-containers experiment: the Complexity exception stays (<em>2026-0"
       & "8-25</em>)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#formal-containers-experiment-the-comp"
       & "lexity-exception-stays-2026-08-25"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>1.28.0 attempted to prove <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">Adacovex.Complexity</span></code> by switching its private"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vectors to the formal (SPARK-approved) containers.  The attempt fails on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "two grounds, both recorded here so the decision is not re-litigated:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>The GNAT 16.2.1 runtime formal containers are stubs.</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">Containers.</span> <span class=""pre"">Formal_Vectors</span></c"
       & "ode> in the installed adainclude is a <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">pragma</span> <span class=""pre"">Compile_Time_Error</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">(True,</span> <span class=""pre"">&quot;This</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">package</span> <span class=""pre"">has</span> <span class=""pre"""
       & ">been</span> <span class=""pre"">moved</span> <span class=""pre"">to</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">the</span> <span class=""pre"">SPARK</span> <span class=""pre"">li"
