       & "          <section id=""proof-records"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Proof Records<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#proof-records"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This directory holds the record of every SPARK proof run for adacovex.</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""reading-the-ledger"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Reading the ledger<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#reading-the-ledger"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <a class=""reference internal"" href=""16.1.0-ledger.html""><span class="""
       & "std std-doc"">gnatprove 16.1.0 ledger</span></a> documents the current"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "verified surface:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>the VC counts (currently 724 VCs, 0 unproved, 0 justified, Platinum);"
       & "</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>the audit of the skipped units and the reason each stays SPARK_Mode O"
       & "ff;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>the empirical evidence that the non-formal <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Ada.Containers</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instantiations in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">Adacovex.Types.Implementation</span></code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.Comple"
       & "xity</span></code> are the only irreducible SPARK_Mode (Off)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "packages;</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">[ass"
       & "umed-global-null]</span></code> warnings that the SPARK_Mode On"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.CPUs.G"
       & "et_Temp_Directory</span></code> carries.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""how-to-verify-the-numbers"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>How to verify the numbers<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#how-to-verify-the-"
       & "numbers"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Run <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> at any time.  It runs gnatprove th"
       & "rough the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove"
       & "</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subcommand and enforces the Platinum gate: 0 unproved VCs and 0 justified"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "VCs.  <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</spa"
       & "n> <span class=""pre"">proof-status</span></code> then syncs the measured coun"
       & "ts into the docs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The full proving workflow, including proof patches over vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependencies, lives in <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../contributing/p"
       & "roving.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">Proving and writing proofs</span></a>"
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Documentation in this directory uses British English and ASD-STE100"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Simplified Technical English.  See the <a class=""reference internal"" href=""."
       & "./contributing/ste100-technical-names.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">STE100"
       & " Technical Names"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dictionary</span></a> for the approved terms about"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof, verification condition, and SPARK.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
