       & "<p>The composite action at <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">./action.yml</span></code> mirrors the base CLI. CI can drive ev"
       & "ery"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "assessment feature the same way the binary does.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""quick-start"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Quick start<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#quick-start"" title=""Link to this"
       & " heading"">"
