       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The action restores <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">~/.adacovex/cache</span></code> before running adacovex. It saves th"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cache when the job finishes (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">result-cache</span></code>, default <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">true</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Every entry is keyed by its artifact"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s SHA-256 content hash. Restoring a cache"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from an earlier run or commit is always safe. Only files that are byte-for-b"
       & "yte"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unchanged are served from it. The remaining files are rescanned and re-parse"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "automatically.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
