       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""markdown-summaries-and-loud-failures"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Markdown summaries and loud failures<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#markdow"
       & "n-summaries-and-loud-failures"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Every CI run leaves a <strong>Markdown summary at the bottom of the job p"
       & "age</strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">$GITHUB_STEP_S"
       & "UMMARY</span></code>):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The composite action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s assessment step writes an <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">##</span> <span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">a"
       & "ssessment</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "table. The table shows target, bundled version, compliance label, SPARK"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "level, tests, and coverage. It also writes the full raw output.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>An <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">if:</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">always()</span></code> <strong>Write run summary</st"
       & "rong> step appends a run-overview table."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The table shows version, target, standard, DAL, and job result.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Each workflow adds a <strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">summary</span></code> job</strong> (<code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">if:</span> <span class=""pre"">alway"
       & "s()</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">needs:</span></code> all other"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "jobs) that aggregates every job result into one table at the bottom of the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "run.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Diagnostics are layered so a failure is debuggable from the Actions UI wi"
       & "thout"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "re-running locally:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The assessment output is folded into a GitHub <strong>log group</stro"
       & "ng>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">::group::</spa"
       & "n></code>). The step result stays visible. The detail stays one click"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "away.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">WARNING<"
       & "/span></code> lines are re-surfaced as <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">::notice::</span></code> annotations.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>An <strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">adacovex-assessment</span></code> artifact</strong> (uploaded <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">if:</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">always()</span></code>) carries the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "full, untruncated assessment output. It also carries the <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--emit-metrics</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JSON export when <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>emit-metrics</span></code> is set. A flaky or unmet gate never requires"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a re-run to reproduce.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Badge and SBOM artifacts are uploaded even when the step failed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">if:</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">always()</span></code>). Partially produced reports stay insp"
       & "ectable.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Threshold failures <strong>fail loudly</strong> at every layer:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>Unmet <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--"
       & "require-*</span></code> gates make the adacovex binary exit non-zero.</p></l"
       & "i>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The assessment step re-surfaces each <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">CI</span> <span class=""pre"">GATE:</span></code>"
       & " line as a GitHub"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">::error::</span"
