       & ASCII.LF
       & "failed job result.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The workflow <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">summary</span></code> job exits <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">1</span></code> when any dependency failed. The whole"
