       & "run is red even if the failing job was retried. An <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">if:</span> <span class=""pre"">always()</s"
       & "pan></code> cleanup"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "step does not mask this.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
