       & "span> <span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">assessment</span><"
       & "/code> Markdown table in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adac"
       & "ovex-assessment</span></code> artifact (full untruncated <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex.out</span></code> +"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-metric"
       & "s.json</span></code> when <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span c"
       & "lass=""pre"">emit-metrics</span></code> is set).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>When the gate is flaky, start from the artifact, not a local repro.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""release-version-bundling"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Release version bundling<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#release-version-bun"
       & "dling"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The release workflow builds the binary from the <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vX.</span> <span class=""pre"">Y.</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">Z</span></code> tag. It <strong>bundles that version into t"
       & "he binary</strong>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s build step sets <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">ADACOVEX_VERSION</span></code> (from <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">github.ref_name</span></code>). It regenerates <cod"
       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/adacovex_versio"
       & "n_info.ads</span></code> before <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">build</span></code>. The shipp"
       & "ed <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">--version</span></code> reports exactly the tag.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The download step of the published action verifies this with <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">--version</span></code> after unpacking the release bundle. Maintaine"
       & "rs reproduce the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "release locally with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">release</span> <span class=""pre"">VERSION"
       & "=x.y.z</span></code> (see the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference internal"" href=""../contributing/developer-guide.html""><s"
       & "pan class=""std std-doc"">developer guide</span></a>); a normal source build"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reads the version from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">alire-dev.toml</span></code> instead.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""id1"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>PR coverage gate<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#id1"" title=""Link to this he"
       & "ading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Gate every pull request so docstring coverage does not regress against th"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "base branch. This is exactly what <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">--coverage-delta</span></code> was built for:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-yaml notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
       & "span><span class=""c1""># .github/workflows/pr-check.yml</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""nt"">on</span><span class=""p"">:</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">  </span><span class=""nt"">pull_request</span><span class=""p"""
       & ">:</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""nt"">jobs</span><span class=""p"">:</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">  </span><span class=""nt"">coverage-delta</span><span class="""
       & "p"">:</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">    </span><span class=""nt"">runs-on</span><span class=""p"">:<"
       & "/span><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain"">ubuntu"
       & "-latest</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">    </span><span class=""nt"">steps</span><span class=""p"">:</s"
       & "pan>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">      </span><span class=""p p-Indicator"">-</span><span class"
       & "=""w""> </span><span class=""nt"">uses</span><span class=""p"">:</span><span class"
       & "=""w""> </span><span class=""l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain"">actions/checkout@v7</sp"
       & "an>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">        </span><span class=""nt"">with</span><span class=""p"">:"
       & "</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">          </span><span class=""nt"">fetch-depth</span><span cl"
       & "ass=""p"">:</span><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Pla"
       & "in"">0</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">      </span><span class=""p p-Indicator"">-</span><span class"
       & "=""w""> </span><span class=""nt"">uses</span><span class=""p"">:</span><span class"
       & "=""w""> </span><span class=""l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain"">bladeacer/adacovex@v1</"
       & "span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">        </span><span class=""nt"">with</span><span class=""p"">:"
       & "</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">          </span><span class=""nt"">target</span><span class="""
       & "p"">:</span><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain"">."
       & "</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">          </span><span class=""nt"">standard</span><span class"
       & "=""p"">:</span><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain"""
       & ">all</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""w"">          </span><span class=""nt"">coverage-delta</span><span"
       & " class=""p"">:</span><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""l l-Scalar l-Scalar-"
       & "Plain"">${{ github.event.pull_request.base.sha }}</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The action exits non-zero when coverage drops, failing the check. This"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "workflow ships in the repo at <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">.github/workflows/pr-check.yml</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""release-bundling"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Release bundling<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#release-bundling"" title=""Li"
       & "nk to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Every <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vX.</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">Y.</span> <span class=""pre"">Z</span></code> tag trigg"
       & "ers <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.github/wor"
       & "kflows/release.yml</span></code>. The workflow calls the composite action wi"
       & "th <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">build</span>"
       & "</code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">releas"
       & "e-build</span></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">prove</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>It builds the release binary, runs GNATprove, and validates the self-asse"
       & "ssment. Then it packages and publishes:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex"
       & "-vX.Y.Z.tar.gz</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the version-matched binary (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">adacovex</span></code> plus the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span></c"
       & "ode> alias). The action downloads this asset for the tag it is referenced"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "by, so <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;v1."
       & "9.0</span></code> runs adacovex <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">v1.9.0</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex"
       & "-action-vX.Y.Z.tar.gz</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a copy of the composite action itself for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vendoring or air-gapped use.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Both bundles are attested with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/actions/attest""><code"
       & " class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">actions/attest</span"
       & "></code></a>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "on every tag. OIDC attestations appear under the release"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s attestations tab."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The release notes link the signed attestation via the action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">attestation-url"
       & "</span></code> output. They also link a <em>Git Changelog</em> compare link"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">compare/v1.9.0"
       & "...v1.14.0</span></code>) and the human-readable changelogs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Changelog listing.</strong> The <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">Create</span> <span class=""pre"">GitHub</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">Release</span></code> step derives the changelog"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "list from the available <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">docs/changelogs/adacovex-*.md</span></code> entries. The entries"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are between the previous release tag and the released version.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>It resolves the previous three-component release tag"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">git</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">tag</span> <span class=""pre"">--sort=-version:refname</span></"
       & "code>, for example <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">v1.9.0</span></code> when releasing"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v1.14.0</span><"
       & "/code>). Then it lists every changelog whose version is strictly above the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "previous release and at or below the released version. Releasing <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v1.14.0</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "after <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v1.9.0</s"
       & "pan></code> links the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">1.10.0</span></code>..<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">1.14.0</span></code> changelogs in one release.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The list is emitted <strong>newest-first</strong> (version-sorted, not sh"
       & "ell glob order)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The entries read <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>1.14.0</span></code> down to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">1.10.0</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The list is derived from the changelog files present in the tree, not fro"
       & "m"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tags. A version that was never released has no entry. A release that skips"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "versions still links every changelog in the range. Each entry links the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "release"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s changelog page on the deployed <strong>Read the Docs</strong> site"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">https://adacov"
       & "ex.readthedocs.io/en/latest/changelogs/adacovex-&lt;v&gt;.html</span></code>"
       & "),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "not a GitHub blob URL: the manual is a Sphinx project and the changelogs are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "part of the published book.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>The CI release binary is Linux x86-64 only for now.</strong> The "
       & "release workflow"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "runs on <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ubuntu-"
       & "latest</span></code>. It packages the Linux binary and the prebuilt"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GNATprove toolchain bundle for that target. macOS, FreeBSD, Windows, and Lin"
       & "ux"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "aarch64 build adacovex from source via Alire instead. See"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference internal"" href=""platforms.html#release-binaries""><span c"
       & "lass=""std std-ref"">Platforms</span></a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Maintainers reproduce the release locally with <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <span class=""pre"">release</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">VERSION=x.y.z</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(see the <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../contributing/developer-guide"
       & ".html""><span class=""std std-doc"">developer guide</span></a>): it builds"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--release</span"
       & "></code>, generates proofs, validates DAL-C, and bundles <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">dist/</span></code>, then"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tags and pushes to trigger the workflow. The bundled version is always the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "build"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s version (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">src/"
       & "adacovex_version_info.ads</span></code> comes from <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire-dev.toml</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ADACOVEX_VER"
       & "SION</span></code> at build time).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""floating-tags"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Floating tags<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#floating-tags"" title=""Link to "
       & "this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The release workflow force-pushes the floating tags <code class=""docutils"
       & " literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vMAJOR</span></code>, <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vMAJOR.</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">MINOR</span></code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">latest</span></code>. For example: <code class=""docutils liter"
       & "al notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v1</span></code>, <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v1.3</span></code>, and <code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">latest</span></code> from <cod"
       & "e class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">v1.3.0</span></code"
       & ">. Reference <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#"
       & "64;latest</span></code> to always get the newest published release.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Use <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&#64;v1<"
       & "/span></code> or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>&#64;v1.3</span></code> for the latest release within a major or minor ver"
       & "sion. Pin an exact <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">&#64;vX.</span> <span class=""pre"">Y.</span> <span class=""pre"">Z</span></"
       & "code> for a fixed version.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Once the action is listed on the GitHub Actions marketplace, each <code c"
       & "lass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vX.</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">Y.</span> <span class=""pre"">Z</span></code> tag auto-publishes that v"
       & "ersion.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""consumer-manifest-prerequisites-avoid-a-broken-ci"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Consumer manifest prerequisites (avoid a broken CI)<a class=""headerlink"""
       & " href=""#consumer-manifest-prerequisites-avoid-a-broken-ci"" title=""Link to th"
       & "is heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</span><"
       & "/code> subcommand and the GitHub Action resolve <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "through the <em>target project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s</em> manifest. The pinned gnatprove crate is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "deployed via <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">al"
       & "r</span> <span class=""pre"">-n</span> <span class=""pre"">get</span> <span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">gnatprove=&lt;version&gt;</span></code>. It is run directly, with no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">exec</span></code> over the whole workspace.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>For the command to succeed in a clean checkout or on CI, the consumer"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifests must follow two rules:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "alire.toml</span></code> must be the clean publishing manifest.</strong> It "
       & "must contain no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dev tooling (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gn"
       & "atprove</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">gnatdoc_bin</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">gnatformat_bin</span></code>, <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span></code>). It must"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "contain <strong>no <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">[[pins]]</span></code></strong>. Alire reads this manifest when the acti"
       & "on runs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">build</span></code>. It must resolve with nothing but Alire + "
       & "GNAT.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "alire-dev.toml</span></code> must declare <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span></code> as a normal index dependency<"
       & "/strong>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">&quot;*&quot;</span></code>). It"
       & " must never be pinned to a local path such as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">{</span> <span class=""pre"">path</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class=""pre"">&quot;../adacovex&quot;</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">}</span></code>. A path pin resolves only on the mac"
       & "hine"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that has the sibling checkout. In a consumer workspace or on CI, Alire"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "fails the whole workspace load with a confusing error. This happens before"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr"
       & "</span></code> runs:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-default notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span"
       & "></span><span class=""n"">ERROR</span><span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""n"""
       & ">Failed</span> <span class=""n"">to</span> <span class=""n"">load</span> <span c"
       & "lass=""n"">alire</span><span class=""o"">.</span><span class=""n"">toml</span><spa"
       & "n class=""p"">:</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">ERROR</span><span class=""p"">:</span>    <span class=""n"">pins"
       & "</span><span class=""p"">:</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">ERROR</span><span class=""p"">:</span>    <span class=""n"">cove"
       & "x</span><span class=""p"">:</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">ERROR</span><span class=""p"">:</span>    <span class=""n"">Pin<"
       & "/span> <span class=""n"">path</span> <span class=""ow"">is</span> <span class=""o"
       & "w"">not</span> <span class=""n"">a</span> <span class=""n"">valid</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""n"">directory</span><span class=""p"">:</span> <span class=""o"">/</span><sp"
       & "an class=""n"">home</span><span class=""o"">/</span><span class=""n"">runner</span"
       & "><span class=""o"">/</span><span class=""n"">work</span><span class=""o"">/&lt;</s"
       & "pan><span class=""n"">repo</span><span class=""o"">&gt;/&lt;</span><span class="""
       & "n"">repo</span><span class=""o"">&gt;/../</span><span class=""n"">adacovex</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
