       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--serve<"
       & "/span></code> server also serves the <strong>bundled offline manual</strong>"
       & " at <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/docs</span"
       & "></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(both spellings, with and without the trailing slash, reach the same page)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The manual is the same Markdown source that powers the Read the Docs site"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">docs/</span></"
       & "code>, a Sphinx project with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">docs/conf.py</span></code> + MyST); at build"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "time <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">tools/gen-"
       & "docs.py</span></code> runs <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">sphinx-build</span></code> and bundles the resulting site"
