       & "split into chunks and the server streams them).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Sphinx"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own search machinery (searchindex.js, searchtools.js, the"
