       & "the fixed label column instead of overflowing).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Docstring Coverage</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <em>radial gauge</em> (half-circle SVG arc) of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "documented vs total subprograms.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Tests Pass/Fail</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <em>donut</em> of passed vs failed tests (fully green"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "when every test passes).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Dependencies by Scope</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <em>polar ring</em> of base / dev / transitive /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vendored / system / test components (conic-gradient + CSS hole,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--scope-*</span"
       & "></code> theme variables) with a legend. Skipped when the graph is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "empty.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Each card is a different type (radar / radar / donut / bars / bars / radi"
       & "al / donut / polar) so the tab reads at a glance without duplicating a data "
       & "story. The two radars are shared with the Overview, so the Charts tab contai"
       & "ns every Overview chart. No JavaScript is required for the charts (pure CSS/"
       & "SVG). The radial gauge, the scope ring, and the radars follow the light/dark"
       & " theme automatically via CSS variables.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The surrounding grid (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">chart-grid</span></code>) is responsive and the page container is "
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">max-width:1180p"
