       & " a part-to-whole distribution is the point. Bars are used where a max-normal"
       & "ised comparison across categories is the point.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""robustness-tier"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Robustness tier<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#robustness-tier"" title=""Link"
       & " to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Overview tab leads with a <strong>Robustness</strong> radar spider an"
