       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>On-disk, the same export is available via <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">--emit-metrics=PATH</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">{&quot;metrics"
       & "&quot;:</span> <span class=""pre"">{...},</span> <span class=""pre"">&quot;depen"
       & "dencies&quot;:</span> <span class=""pre"">[...]}</span></code> after any asses"
       & "sment).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""api-playground"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>API playground<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#api-playground"" title=""Link t"
       & "o this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <strong>API</strong> tab turns the dashboard into a small interactive"
       & " REST client."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Every route the server dispatches on is listed as a clickable button,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "grouped by purpose:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Metrics</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GET</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">/api/metrics</span></code> (JSON).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Dependencies</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GET</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">/api/deps</span></code> (JSON).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Badges</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " each <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GET</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">/badge/*.svg</span></code> endpoint (SVG).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Documentation</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GET</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">/docs</span></code>, the bundled offline manual (HTML).</p></"
       & "li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>API</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">GET</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">/api/endpoints</span></code>, the endpoint catalog the playgr"
       & "ound is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "built from.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The playground uses a <strong>split-screen layout</strong>: the clickable"
       & " endpoints,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "grouped by purpose, sit in a left-hand nav, and the live response preview"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docks on the right "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the same pattern as the Dependencies tab"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tree/diagram + detail panel. On narrow screens the panes stack vertically."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "A filter input searches the endpoint nav as you type (matching path,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "purpose, and group name), so you can jump straight to <code class=""docutils "
       & "literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">metrics</span></code> or <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">badge</span></code>."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Clicking an endpoint issues a live <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">fetch</span></code> against the serving origin and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "previews the response:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>JSON endpoints are pretty-printed (two-space indent) and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>syntax-highlighted</strong> with the vendored <a class=""reference ex"
       & "ternal"" href=""https://github.com/petersolopov/yace"">yace</a>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tokenizer (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">wind"
       & "ow.YaceTok</span></code>). A JSON-key rule colours object keys"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "separately from string values, so the payload reads like an IDE view."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Endpoint paths that appear inside the JSON payload (for example the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/api/...</span>"
       & "</code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/ba"
       & "dge/...</span></code> values in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">/api/endpoints</span></code>) become clickable"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "links to the live endpoints, and every endpoint button"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s path is itself a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "link that opens the raw URL in a new tab.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>SVG badge endpoints show the live image above the raw markup.</p></li"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">/doc"
       & "s</span></code> endpoint shows the bundled offline manual (the same page the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "footer <strong>Manual</strong> link opens).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A toolbar on the result offers <strong>Copy</strong> (clipboard) and <str"
       & "ong>Download</strong> (saves"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the raw response body to a file) for the JSON API response, so the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "playground doubles as a lightweight HTTP client without leaving the browser."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The first endpoint (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">/api/metrics</span></code>) runs automatically so the tab always"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "opens with a live preview. The endpoint list is <strong>not hardcoded</stron"
       & "g> in client"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JavaScript: the playground fetches it from <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">GET</span> <span class=""pre"">/api/endpoints</spa"
       & "n></code>, the single"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "source of truth the server declares. Each request is made live against the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instance, so what you preview is exactly what <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">curl</span></code> returns.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""themes"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Themes<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#themes"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dashboard supports <strong>light</strong>, <strong>dark</strong>, and"
       & " <strong>system</strong> themes. Colours are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "driven by CSS custom properties, and a header dropdown switches live between"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "them. <strong>Save settings</strong> persists the current selection in <code"
       & " class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">localStorage</span><"
       & "/code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(no cookies, key <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>adacovex-theme</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Theme resolution on page load:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">?theme"
       & "=light|dark|system</span></code> query parameter on the dashboard URL."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It always wins. This is the supported way to pin the theme when embedding"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the dashboard in an iframe. The server strips the query string before"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "routing, so <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">htt"
       & "p://localhost:8080/?theme=light</span></code> (and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">?theme=dark</sp"
       & "an></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">?t"
       & "heme=system</span></code>) serves the themed dashboard instead of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "404ing.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>otherwise the explicit CLI theme (<code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">--theme=light</span></code> / <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--theme=dark</span></code>).</p></l"
       & "i>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>otherwise the saved <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">localStorage</span></code> choice, if one was saved.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>otherwise the system theme (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">prefers-color-scheme</span></code>).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--theme</spa"
       & "n></code> only sets the <em>initial</em> selection. The dropdown and Save se"
       & "ttings"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "still override it afterwards in the browser.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""related-cli-flags"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Related CLI flags<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#related-cli-flags"" title="""
       & "Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
