       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">--serve</span></code></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>off</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Run the pipeline, then spawn the HTTP dashboard server (blocking) on "
       & "the port. It is a switch: passing <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">--serve</span></code> is the only way to start the server"
       & ", and omitting it (the default, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">off</span></code>) renders and exits without serving. There"
       & " is no <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--no-ser"
       & "ve</span></code>, because a flag already controls it</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
