       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""installing-adacovex"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Installing adacovex<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#installing-adacovex"" tit"
       & "le=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""quick-start"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Quick start<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#quick-start"" title=""Link to this"
       & " heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Install</strong> via Alire: <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">install</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">covex</span> <span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span> <span class=""p"
       & "re"">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=""pre"">export</span> <span class=""pre"">PATH"
       & "=&quot;$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH&quot;</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Assess</strong> your project: <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">--target=.</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">--dal=C</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Serve</strong> the dashboard: <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">--target=.</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">--serve</span> <span class=""pre"">--port=8080</span><"
       & "/code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>That is all you need for a local compliance assessment. For CI or release"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "workflows, see <a class=""reference internal"" href=""ci-cd.html""><span class="""
       & "std std-doc"">CI/CD</span></a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex is distributed as the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">covex</span></code> Alire crate, a release bundle on"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GitHub, or a source build. All three routes produce the same binary"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span"
       & "></code>, with a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>covex</span></code> alias on Linux).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""option-1-declare-it-in-your-project-s-alire-manifest-recommende"
       & "d"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Option 1: declare it in your project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s Alire manifest (recommended)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#option-1-declare-"
       & "it-in-your-project-s-alire-manifest-recommended"" title=""Link to this heading"
       & """>"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Put <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</s"
       & "pan></code> in your project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire-dev.tom"
       & "l</span></code> (never <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">alire.toml</span></code>, so release"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "builds stay clean), alongside <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code>:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-toml notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
       & "span><span class=""c1""># &lt;project&gt;/alire-dev.toml</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""k"">[[depends-on]]</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">covex</span><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""o"">=</span>"
       & "<span class=""w""> </span><span class=""s2"">""*""</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""n"">gnatprove</span><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""o"">=</s"
       & "pan><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""s2"">""^16.1.0""</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Then <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">build</span></code> produces <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">bin/adacovex</span></code> inside the pr"
       & "oject. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "deploys the pinned gnatprove crate standalone via <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"">-n</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">get</span></code> and runs it"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "directly. Each project pins its own exact toolchain version. No global insta"
       & "ll"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "is needed:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-bash notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
       & "span>alr<span class=""w""> </span>build"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "./bin/adacovex<span class=""w""> </span>--target<span class=""o"">=</span>.<span"
       & " class=""w""> </span>--dal<span class=""o"">=</span>C"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "./bin/adacovex<span class=""w""> </span>prove<span class=""w""> </span>--target<"
       & "span class=""o"">=</span>.<span class=""w"">   </span><span class=""c1""># deploys"
       & " gnatprove via alr get, then runs it</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""option-2-alr-install-global-to-path"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Option 2: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">a"
       & "lr</span> <span class=""pre"">install</span></code> (global, to <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">$PATH</span></code>)<a class="
       & """headerlink"" href=""#option-2-alr-install-global-to-path"" title=""Link to this"
       & " heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-bash notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
       & "span>alr<span class=""w""> </span>install<span class=""w""> </span>covex<span cl"
       & "ass=""w""> </span>gnatprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""nb"">export</span><span class=""w""> </span><span class=""nv"">PATH<"
       & "/span><span class=""o"">=</span><span class=""s2"">""</span><span class=""nv"">$HOM"
       & "E</span><span class=""s2"">/.local/bin:</span><span class=""nv"">$PATH</span><sp"
       & "an class=""s2"">""</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span>"
       & "</code> is the Alire crate name for adacovex"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://alire.ada.dev/crates/covex"">cra"
       & "te page</a>). Once on <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">$PATH</span></code>, it scans"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the current directory by default. A <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">gnatprove</span></code> installed this way is picked up"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">$PATH</spa"
       & "n></code> by <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">co"
       & "vex</span> <span class=""pre"">prove</span></code> when the target project dec"
       & "lares no manifest"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependency of its own.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""option-3-download-a-release-bundle-from-github"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Option 3: download a release bundle from GitHub<a class=""headerlink"" hre"
       & "f=""#option-3-download-a-release-bundle-from-github"" title=""Link to this head"
       & "ing"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Every <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">vX.</s"
       & "pan> <span class=""pre"">Y.</span> <span class=""pre"">Z</span></code> tag publi"
       & "shes `adacovex-vX. Y.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Z.tar.gz` on the <a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/b"
       & "ladeacer/adacovex/releases"">GitHub Releases page</a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-bash notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
       & "span>curl<span class=""w""> </span>-fsSL<span class=""w""> </span>https://raw.gi"
       & "thubusercontent.com/bladeacer/adacovex/main/install.sh<span class=""w""> </spa"
       & "n><span class=""p"">|</span><span class=""w""> </span>bash"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Bundles are attested with <a class=""reference external"" href=""https://git"
       & "hub.com/actions/attest""><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">actions/attest</span></code></a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div><p>Release binaries are <strong>Linux x86-64 only</strong>. Other platf"
       & "orms build from source"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "via Alire (see <a class=""reference internal"" href=""platforms.html""><span cla"
       & "ss=""std std-doc"">Platforms</span></a>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div></blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""building-from-source"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Building from source<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#building-from-source"" t"
       & "itle=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-bash notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span></"
       & "span>git<span class=""w""> </span>clone<span class=""w""> </span>--depth<span cl"
       & "ass=""w""> </span><span class=""m"">1</span><span class=""w""> </span>https://gith"
       & "ub.com/bladeacer/adacovex.git"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<span class=""nb"">cd</span><span class=""w""> </span>adacovex<span class=""w""> <"
       & "/span><span class=""o"">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=""w""> </span>alr<span clas"
       & "s=""w""> </span>build<span class=""w"">   </span><span class=""c1""># or: --branch"
       & " vX.Y.Z for a released tag</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">build</span></code> produces <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">bin/adacovex</span></code> (with a <code clas"
       & "s=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">bin/covex</span></code> a"
       & "lias). A stock Alire"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "toolchain (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gnat"
       & "_native</span></code> + <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cla"
       & "ss=""pre"">gprbuild</span></code>) plus the standard GNAT runtime is all"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "that is needed. No other dependencies. (Contributors use the richer"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">make</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">build</span></code> workflow; see the <a class=""reference int"
       & "ernal"" href=""../contributing/developer-guide.html""><span class=""std std-doc"""
       & ">developer guide</span></a>.)</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""version-source-per-installation-method"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Version source per installation method<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#versi"
       & "on-source-per-installation-method"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">--version</span></code> (and the man page, the SBOM to"
       & "ol version, and the result"
       & ASCII.LF
