       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""platform-support"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Platform support<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#platform-support"" title=""Li"
       & "nk to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex is a zero-dependency Ada/SPARK binary. It uses only the GNAT run"
       & "time and the standard library. As a result, any platform with a working GNAT"
       & "/Alire toolchain can build and run it.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex makes no OS-specific assumptions beyond the CPU-core and CI dete"
       & "ction described below. These features fall back to single-core operation whe"
       & "n the host cannot be probed.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""supported-platforms"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Supported platforms<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#supported-platforms"" tit"
       & "le=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>Platform</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Status</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Notes</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Linux x86-64</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p><strong>Primary</strong></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>CI, releases, and the proof toolchain bundle all target it.</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p><strong>WSL</strong></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p><strong>Supported</strong></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Runs on the Linux/WSL targets below: <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">man</span></code> installs to the WSL man root "
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">mandb</span"
       & "></code> refreshes it; VCS snapshot commands run via <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sh</span> <span class=""pre"">-c</span><"
       & "/code>.</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>Linux aarch64</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Supported</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Builds from source; the prebuilt toolchain bundle is x86-64 only.</p>"
       & "</td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>macOS</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Supported</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Builds from source (Intel and Apple Silicon).</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p>FreeBSD</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Supported</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Builds from source.</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><td><p>Windows</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Supported</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>Builds from source; core detection uses the Windows env var + PowerSh"
       & "ell fallback.</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""release-binaries"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Release binaries<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#release-binaries"" title=""Li"
       & "nk to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The CI release binary is Linux x86-64 only. The <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex-vX.</span> <span class=""pre"">Y."
       & "</span> <span class=""pre"">Z.tar.gz</span></code> bundle (<code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span></code> and the <co"
       & "de class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">covex</span></code"
       & "> alias) and the prebuilt GNATprove toolchain asset are built on <code class"
       & "=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ubuntu-latest</span></code"
       & ">.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Every other platform builds adacovex from source via Alire (<code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alr</span> <span class=""pre"""
       & ">build</span></code>). See <a class=""reference external"" href=""https://githu"
       & "b.com/bladeacer/adacovex/blob/main/README.md#installing-adacovex"">Installing"
       & " adacovex</a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""cpu-core-count-detection"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>CPU core-count detection<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#cpu-core-count-dete"
       & "ction"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.CPU"
       & "s.Detect_Core_Count</span></code> returns the number of logical processors o"
       & "n the host. It falls back to <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">1</span></code> when the host cannot be probed. Detection orde"
       & "r (pure GNAT runtime, no external library):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ol class=""arabic simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Linux</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " count <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">processo"
       & "r</span></code> entries in <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">/proc/cpuinfo</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>macOS / FreeBSD</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sysctl</span> "
       & "<span class=""pre"">-n</span> <span class=""pre"">hw.ncpu</span></code>.</p></li"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Linux fallback</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">nproc</span></"
       & "code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Windows</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">NUMBER_OF_"
       & "PROCESSORS</span></code> environment variable.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Windows fallback</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a PowerShell CIM query (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">Get-CimInstance</span> <span class=""pre"">Win32_ComputerSystem</spa"
       & "n></code>).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ol>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Each stage falls through to the next on failure. If all stages fail, the "
       & "function returns <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>1</span></code>. adacovex still runs when this happens. It runs single-thr"
       & "eaded.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""ci-detection-and-prove-parallelism"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>CI detection and prove parallelism<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#ci-detect"
       & "ion-and-prove-parallelism"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Adacovex.CPU"
       & "s.Is_Running_In_CI</span></code> detects the CI markers set by GitHub Action"
       & "s, GitLab CI, Azure Pipelines, Buildkite, CircleCI, Travis CI, AppVeyor, Jen"
       & "kins, and the generic <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">CI</span></code> variable.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>GNATprove parallelism resolves as:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--jobs=N"
       & "</span></code> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">N</span> <span class=""pre"">&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">0</span></code>) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " exactly <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">N</spa"
       & "n></code> jobs.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--jobs=0"
       & "</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>-j0</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " all cores (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">gna"
       & "tprove</span> <span class=""pre"">-j0</span></code>).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>default (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">--jobs</span></code> omitted) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <strong>all cores inside CI</strong>. Otherwise it uses <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">max(1,</span> <span class=""pre"">co"
       & "res</span> <span class=""pre"">-</span> <span class=""pre"">2)</span></code>. As"
       & " a result, a developer machine keeps two cores free for the system.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The chosen basis is printed in the verbose log (<code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Jobs_Justification</span></code>) and in"
       & " the <a class=""reference internal"" href=""#status-subcommand""><code class=""do"
       & "cutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">status</span></code></a> repor"
       & "t. As a result, a proof run is auditable.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""status-subcommand"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">status</spa"
       & "n></code> subcommand<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#status-subcommand"" title=""L"
       & "ink to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">status</span></code> reports the toolchain and platfor"
       & "m state without running any assessment and <strong>without downloading or de"
       & "ploying anything</strong>:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-default notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span"
       & "></span><span class=""n"">adacovex</span> <span class=""n"">status</span> <span "
       & "class=""o"">--</span><span class=""n"">target</span><span class=""o"">=</span><spa"
       & "n class=""n"">PATH</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>It checks and prints:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Alire</strong> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">alr</span></code>) is installed on <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">$PATH</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>gnatprove</strong> is dependency-managed (target manifest pin"
       & ") or detectable (global pin, on <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">$PATH</span></code>, or cached in <code class=""docutils lit"
       & "eral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">~/.adacovex/toolchain</span></code>). Se"
       & "e <a class=""reference internal"" href=""../contributing/architecture.html#gnat"
       & "prove-toolchain-resolution-prove-subcommand""><span class=""std std-ref"">Archi"
       & "tecture "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " toolchain resolution</span></a>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The <strong>logical CPU count</strong>, <strong>CI status</strong>, a"
       & "nd the resulting default <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">-j</span></code> parallelism are reported.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>A <strong>VCS report</strong> lists the VCS command-line tools availa"
       & "ble on <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">$PATH</s"
       & "pan></code> for the differential modes. The tools are git, mercurial/<code c"
       & "lass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">hg</span></code>, subv"
       & "ersion/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">svn</spa"
       & "n></code>, fossil, jj, and the man-page tool <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">mandb</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The VCS report shows the VCS detected for the target repository.</p><"
       & "/li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The VCS report notes when the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s VCS tool is missing.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The VCS report notes when man-db (<code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">mandb</span></code>) is absent. You then know that"
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">man</span></code> can install the page but cannot refres"
       & "h the man database.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p>The release note states that the CI binary is Linux x86-64 only.</p><"
       & "/li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Base adacovex functionality does not require a version control system. Th"
       & "e functionality includes scanning, proof analysis, test parsing, compliance "
       & "assessment, SBOM generation, dashboards, and caching. A VCS is only needed f"
       & "or the differential modes (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">--compare-base</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">--coverage-delta</span></code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The status command returns exit code <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">0</span></code> when a usable gnatprove is detectab"
       & "le without a download. <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">alr</span></code> must be present when the deploy path is the only o"
       & "ption. Otherwise, the command returns exit code <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">1</span></code>. The VCS report is informat"
       & "ional and does not affect the exit code.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""local-man-page-linux-wsl"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Local man page (Linux/WSL)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#local-man-page-li"
       & "nux-wsl"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">man</span></code> installs the man page into the local"
       & " man database without root. The default root is <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">$XDG_DATA_HOME/man</span></code> when set. "
       & "Otherwise it is <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">~/.local/share/man</span></code>. This is the standard Linux/WSL per-user m"
       & "an tree.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The index is refreshed with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">mandb</span></code> when <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">mandb</span></code> is present. Ubuntu and WSL shi"
       & "p <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">mandb</span><"
       & "/code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>When man-db is not installed, or when <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">mandb</span></code> fails, adacovex prints a warni"
       & "ng. The warning states that the database was not refreshed. The page is stil"
       & "l installed. You can read it with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">man</span> <span class=""pre"">-l</span> <span class=""pre"">"
       & "~/.local/share/man/man1/adacovex.1</span></code>. <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span class=""pre"">status<"
       & "/span></code> reports whether <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">mandb</span></code> is on <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">$PATH</span></code> up front.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--dir=PATH</"
       & "span></code> overrides the root. The page embeds the binary version. <code c"
       & "lass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</span> <span "
       & "class=""pre"">man</span> <span class=""pre"">--check</span></code> compares it t"
       & "o the installed page and exits <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">0</span></code> or <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">1</span></code>. As a result, a prompt hook can auto-ins"
       & "tall when a newer version is available. See <a class=""reference internal"" hr"
       & "ef=""cli-reference.html#man""><span class=""std std-ref"">CLI reference</span></"
       & "a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""vcs-support-linux-wsl"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>VCS support (Linux/WSL)<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#vcs-support-linux-ws"
       & "l"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--compare-ba"
       & "se</span></code> and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">--coverage-delta</span></code> snapshot a base revision across git, Me"
       & "rcurial, Subversion, Fossil, and jj. See <a class=""reference internal"" href="
       & """vcs.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">VCS support</span></a>. The snapshot co"
       & "mmands run through <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""p"
       & "re"">sh</span> <span class=""pre"">-c</span></code>, which WSL provides. All te"
       & "mporary snapshots live under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">/tmp/adacovex-diff-&lt;pid&gt;</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>For VCS with poor snapshot UX (Subversion and Fossil), adacovex prints a "
       & "note. The note recommends conversion to git.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>See the <a class=""reference internal"" href=""cli-reference.html""><span cla"
       & "ss=""std std-doc"">CLI reference</span></a> for the full flag surface.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
