       & ASCII.LF
       & "          <section id=""the-sbom-subcommand"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</s"
       & "pan></code> subcommand<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#the-sbom-subcommand"" titl"
       & "e=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""when-and-why-to-generate-an-sbom"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>When and why to generate an SBOM<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#when-and-wh"
       & "y-to-generate-an-sbom"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) is a structured inventory of every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "component in your project, plus its provenance, licence, and (in adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "case) its SPARK proof level and compliance context. Generate one in these"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cases:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Auditing or certifying</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " an SBOM is a standard artifact for safety"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "certification (DO-178C, ISO 26262, IEC 62304). It shows the auditor exactly"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "which Ada/Alire components are in scope and which are proved / not proved.</"
       & "p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Shifting left on supply-chain security</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the dependency graph exposes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "transitive dependencies, their licences, and their PURLs so you can review"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "them before a release.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Embedding in CI</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the proof-aware SBOM carries the assessed standard and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "level, so downstream tooling (policy engines, compliance dashboards) can"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "consume it without re-parsing markdown reports.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Reproducible builds</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " adacovex honours <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH</span></code>, so the SBOM"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "timestamp is deterministic when tied to a git commit.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex</sp"
       & "an> <span class=""pre"">sbom</span></code> resolves the target project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s dependency graph from its Alire"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire"
       & ".toml</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class"
       & "=""pre"">alire-dev.toml</span></code>), the solved-crate list in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">alire/alire.loc"
       & "k</span></code>, and the root <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">.gpr</span></code> <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">with</span></code> clauses, then writes a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof-aware software bill of materials in CycloneDX 1.5 JSON, SPDX 2.3 JSON,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "or Markdown.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""how-to-read-the-output"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>How to read the output<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#how-to-read-the-outpu"
       & "t"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Choose the format that matches your toolchain:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>CycloneDX 1.5 JSON</strong> (<code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">--format=cyclonedx-json</span></code>) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " drop into any CycloneDX"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "consumer (Dependency-Track, OWASP Dependency-Check, and more). The root"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "component"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "carries <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacove"
       & "x:proof_level</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">adacovex:standard</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal"
       & " notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex:dal_target</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex:le"
       & "vel</span></code>. Every dependency has a <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">language</span></code> field inferred from"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "file extensions or declared ecosystems.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>SPDX 2.3 JSON</strong> (<code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">--format=spdx-json</span></code>) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " compatible with SPDX-aware tools"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(FOSSA, Snyk, ScanCode). The adacovex properties appear as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">attributionText"
       & "s</span></code> on the root package.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Markdown</strong> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">--format=md</span></code>) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " human-readable table, useful for audits and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reports. Default path is <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/docs/compliance/SBOM.md</span></code>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""key-fields"">"
