       & "<td><p>Package URL for registry linking</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Dependencies report <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">adacovex:proof_level</span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <span class="""
       & "pre"">&quot;Not</span> <span class=""pre"">proved&quot;</span></code> because a"
       & "dacovex only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proves the target itself. The SBOM is mutually exclusive with <code class=""d"
       & "ocutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--compare-base</span></code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--coverage-"
       & "delta</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""usage"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Usage<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#usage"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""highlight-default notranslate""><div class=""highlight""><pre><span"
       & "></span><span class=""n"">adacovex</span> <span class=""n"">sbom</span> <span cl"
       & "ass=""p"">[</span><span class=""o"">--</span><span class=""nb"">format</span><span"
       & " class=""o"">=</span><span class=""n"">cyclonedx</span><span class=""o"">-</span><"
       & "span class=""n"">json</span><span class=""o"">|</span><span class=""n"">spdx</span"
       & "><span class=""o"">-</span><span class=""n"">json</span><span class=""o"">|</span>"
       & "<span class=""n"">md</span><span class=""p"">]</span> <span class=""p"">[</span><s"
       & "pan class=""o"">--</span><span class=""n"">out</span><span class=""o"">=</span><sp"
       & "an class=""n"">PATH</span><span class=""p"">]</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "           <span class=""p"">[</span><span class=""o"">--</span><span class=""n"">"
       & "standard</span><span class=""o"">=</span><span class=""n"">NAME</span><span clas"
       & "s=""o"">|--</span><span class=""n"">dal</span><span class=""o"">=</span><span clas"
       & "s=""n"">LEVEL</span><span class=""o"">|--</span><span class=""n"">asil</span><span"
       & " class=""o"">=</span><span class=""n"">LEVEL</span><span class=""o"">|--</span><sp"
       & "an class=""n"">class</span><span class=""o"">=</span><span class=""n"">LEVEL</span"
       & "><span class=""p"">]</span>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</pre></div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Default output</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/sbom.json</span></code> for <code cl"
       & "ass=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">cyclonedx-json</span></"
       & "code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/"
       & "sbom.spdx.json</span></code> for <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">spdx-json</span></code>, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;target&gt;/"
       & "docs/compliance/SBOM.md</span></code> for <code class=""docutils literal notr"
       & "anslate""><span class=""pre"">md</span></code>. The containing directory is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "created automatically.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Exit code</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">0</span></code> when the SBOM was written, <code class="""
       & "docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">1</span></code> otherwise. I"
       & "f the target"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "has no Alire manifest the SBOM cannot be generated (the GitHub Action"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reports this as a warning without failing the job).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""standard-awareness"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Standard-awareness<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#standard-awareness"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</sp"
       & "an></code> subcommand accepts the same standard flags as the assessment"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard</sp"
       & "an></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--d"
       & "al</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">--asil</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">--class</span></code>) and <strong>defaults to all"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "standards</strong>: without an explicit standard flag the SBOM carries the j"
       & "oined"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "DO-178C / ISO 26262 / IEC 62304 properties at the shared DAL tier."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--standard=iso2"
       & "6262</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="
       & """pre"">--asil=B</span></code> narrows it to ISO 26262 at ASIL B, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--class=A</span"
       & "></code> to IEC 62304 at Class A. See <a class=""reference internal"" href=""st"
       & "andards.html""><span class=""std std-doc"">Standards</span></a> for the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cross-standard tier mapping.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""properties"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Properties<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#properties"" title=""Link to this h"
       & "eading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Only the root component "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the project adacovex actually assessed "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " carries:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex"
       & ":proof_level</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Stone</span></"
       & "code>..<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Platinum"
       & "</span></code>, the honest assessed level.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex"
       & ":standard</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">DO-178C</span>"
       & "</code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">ISO</"
       & "span> <span class=""pre"">26262</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">IEC</span> <span class=""pre"">62304</span></co"
       & "de>.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex"
       & ":dal_target</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">DAL-A</span></"
       & "code>..<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">DAL-D</s"
       & "pan></code> (omitted for <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">DAL-E</span></code>).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">adacovex"
       & ":level</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the standard-specific label (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">DAL-C</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">ASIL</span> <span class=""pre"">B</span></code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Class</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">A</span></code>, omitted for <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">DAL-E</span></code>).</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Dependency components report <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">adacovex:proof_level</span> <span class=""pre"">=</span> <spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">&quot;Not</span> <span class=""pre"">proved&quot;</span></code> "
       & "(adacovex"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "only proves the target itself, never third-party dependencies). Properties a"
       & "re"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "encoded as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">attr"
       & "ibutionTexts</span></code> in SPDX.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""determinism"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Determinism<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#determinism"" title=""Link to this"
       & " heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">metadata"
       & ".timestamp</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">creationInfo.created</span></code> field honors the <code class="
       & """docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH</span></c"
       & "ode> environment variable (reproducible-builds convention). When set to a Un"
       & "ix epoch second count, the timestamp is derived from it in UTC via pure inte"
       & "ger math. As a result, SBOM output is byte-for-byte deterministic across run"
       & "s and machines. To tie it to a specific git commit, run <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">export</span> <span class=""pre"">SOU"
       & "RCE_DATE_EPOCH=$(git</span> <span class=""pre"">-C</span> <span class=""pre"">&l"
       & "t;target&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">log</span> <span class=""pre"">-1</span>"
       & " <span class=""pre"">--format=%ct)</span></code> before adacovex.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The bundled <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">"
       & "make</span></code> targets (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">run-self</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">run-ada-crdt</span></code>, <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</span></code>, <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">release</span></code>, and Ada_CRDT"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">prove</span><"
       & "/code>/<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">badges</"
       & "span></code>) already set it from the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s git <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">HEAD</spa"
       & "n></code> commit time.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""exclusivity-and-ordering"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Exclusivity and ordering<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#exclusivity-and-ord"
       & "ering"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">sbom</span><"
       & "/code> is mutually exclusive with <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">--compare-base</span></code> and <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--coverage-delta</span></code>. It"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scans sources, parses proof/test results, and assesses DAL first. As a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "result, the emitted properties reflect the real assessment state.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Both formats validate against the official"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://github.com/CycloneDX/specificati"
       & "on"">CycloneDX 1.5</a> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference external"" href=""https://spdx.dev"">SPDX 2.3</a> JSON sche"
       & "mas (see"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a class=""reference internal"" href=""../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.html""><span class"
       & "=""std std-doc"">THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</span></a>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""language-detection"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Language detection<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#language-detection"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Every dependency component carries a <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">language</span></code> field (CycloneDX JSON /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">components[].pr"
       & "operties</span></code> under <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">&quot;name&quot;:</span> <span class=""pre"">&quot;adacovex:lang"
       & "uage&quot;</span></code>, or the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Markdown table"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Language</spa"
       & "n></code> column) describing the implementation language(s)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "of that dependency.  Detection follows the component"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s origin, most specific"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "first.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""manifest-declared-ecosystems"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Manifest-declared ecosystems<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#manifest-declar"
       & "ed-ecosystems"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A vendored manifest maps directly onto its language and PURL type:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table class=""docutils align-default"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-odd""><th class=""head""><p>Manifest file</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>PURL type</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<th class=""head""><p>Language</p></th>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr class=""row-even""><td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">package.json</span></code></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pkg:npm<"
       & "/span></code></p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<td><p>JavaScript</p></td>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tr>"
