       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""extension-based-inference"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3>Extension-based inference<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#extension-based-in"
       & "ference"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>For every other component "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " vendored trees, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"
       & """>vendor/</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span cl"
       & "ass=""pre"">node_modules</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "resources, loose source drops, and individual files inside <code class=""docu"
       & "tils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">resources/</span></code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">assets/</span><"
       & "/code>, and <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.ad"
       & "acovex/patches/</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " adacovex infers the language from the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>file extensions actually present</strong>.  The extension is the sou"
       & "rce of truth: a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.py</span></cod"
       & "e> file reports Python even when a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">Cargo.toml</span></code> sits next to it, and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest language only breaks ties.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Supported extensions:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Ada</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">.ads</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">.adb</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notrans"
       & "late""><span class=""pre"">.ada</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal no"
       & "translate""><span class=""pre"">.gpr</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>JavaScript</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">.js</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">.mjs</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal n"
       & "otranslate""><span class=""pre"">.cjs</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>TypeScript</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">.ts</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notran"
       & "slate""><span class=""pre"">.tsx</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>CSS</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">.css</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>HTML</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">.html</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">.htm</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Python</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">.py</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Go</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">.go</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Rust</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">.rs</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>C</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">.c</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">.h</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>C++</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">.cpp</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">.cc</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">.cxx</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">.hpp</span></code>, <code class=""docutils litera"
       & "l notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.hh</span></code>, <code class=""docutils li"
       & "teral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.hxx</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>C#</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
