       & """><span class=""pre"">.mli</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Lua</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">.lua</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Perl</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
