       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Haskell</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">.hs</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Elixir</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">.ex</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">.exs</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Erlang</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><"
       & "span class=""pre"">.erl</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">.hrl</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Clojure</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">.clj</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransl"
       & "ate""><span class=""pre"">.cljs</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Dart</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">.dart</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Shell</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">.sh</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">.bash</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>PowerShell</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">.ps1</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>SQL</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">.sql</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Fortran</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">.f</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslat"
       & "e""><span class=""pre"">.f90</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notra"
       & "nslate""><span class=""pre"">.f95</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal "
       & "notranslate""><span class=""pre"">.f03</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Assembly</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"""
       & "><span class=""pre"">.s</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notransla"
       & "te""><span class=""pre"">.asm</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>R</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span "
       & "class=""pre"">.r</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Julia</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">.jl</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Zig</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">.zig</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>VHDL</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">.vhd</span></code>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">.vhdl</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>Tcl</strong>: <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><spa"
       & "n class=""pre"">.tcl</span></code></p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A directory that mixes languages reports its <strong>top 3</strong> langu"
       & "ages by file count"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(for example <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&q"
       & "uot;Ada;</span> <span class=""pre"">C;</span> <span class=""pre"">C++&quot;</spa"
       & "n></code>), so a mixed-language vendored drop is summarised"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "by what it actually contains rather than by a single guess.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
