       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""licence-resolution"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>Licence resolution<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#licence-resolution"" title"
       & "=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Vendored manifest ecosystems report their licence from the local manifest"
       & ":"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">package.json</s"
       & "pan></code> (<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">li"
       & "cense</span></code>) for npm/pnpm, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"
       & """><span class=""pre"">Cargo.toml</span></code> for cargo,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pyproject.toml<"
       & "/span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"""
       & ">composer.json</span></code> for pypi / composer. When the local"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest carries no licence, adacovex resolves the version, website, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "licence from the package registry as a best-effort, online fallback. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "resolver dispatches on the ecosystem (the PURL type) through a single static"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "table, so adding a language is one row rather than a new code path:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul class=""simple"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>npm</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">npm</span> <sp"
       & "an class=""pre"">view</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;pkg&gt;</span> <span class="
       & """pre"">version</span> <span class=""pre"">license</span> <span class=""pre"">home"
       & "page</span> <span class=""pre"">--json</span></code>, parsed for the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "three fields from one JSON object.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>pnpm</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pnpm</span> <s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">show</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;pkg&gt;</span> <span class"
       & "=""pre"">version</span> <span class=""pre"">license</span> <span class=""pre"">hom"
       & "epage</span> <span class=""pre"">--json</span></code>, likewise.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>cargo</strong> (Rust) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">cargo</span> <"
       & "span class=""pre"">search</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt;pkg&gt;</span></code>, "
       & "with the SPDX id read from the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">(license:</span"
       & "> <span class=""pre"">...)</span></code> token in the output.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><p><strong>go</strong> and other ecosystems with no portable, reliable r"
       & "egistry query keep"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "an empty licence; the vendored manifest scanner still reads any in-repo"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "licence file for them.</p></li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The npm and pnpm rows answer for all three fields with a single <code cla"
       & "ss=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--json</span></code> cal"
       & "l,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so each component boots node once instead of once per field "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " a 3x reduction"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "in subprocess starts that keeps the graph build responsive on vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JavaScript trees. The fallback runs only when the offline read finds nothing"
       & ","
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so a vendored package that ships a licence never touches the network. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "resolved licence flows into every SBOM format (CycloneDX <code class=""docuti"
       & "ls literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">licenses</span></code>, SPDX"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">licenseConclude"
       & "d</span></code> / <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pr"
       & "e"">licenseDeclared</span></code>, Markdown <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">License</span></code> column) and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard detail panel; the resolved version and website appear in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard detail panel and the <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><s"
       & "pan class=""pre"">/api/deps</span></code> JSON.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The resolver caches each answer in a per-project store under the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "result cache (the same <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span clas"
       & "s=""pre"">--cache-dir</span></code> the scan uses), keyed by the target"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "directory as well as the ecosystem and package name, with a 7-day TTL, the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "same scheme as the system-tool version probes.  The content-addressed result"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cache does not cover these registry calls (each one boots node for npm/pnpm)"
       & ","
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so without this layer a warm run still re-paid them; the meta cache makes ev"
       & "ery"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "repeat run serve the licence, version, and website from disk with no subproc"
       & "ess"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "spawn, and two projects that share a cache directory never serve each other"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "resolved licence or version.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Bundled dashboard assets (FlexSearch, nomnoml, graphre) resolve"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "their licence and website live from the package registry when a loose vendor"
       & "ed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "copy is scanned, preferring <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span"
       & " class=""pre"">pnpm</span> <span class=""pre"">show</span> <span class=""pre"">&lt"
       & ";pkg&gt;</span> <span class=""pre"">license</span></code> and falling back to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">npm</span></cod"
       & "e>, <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">yarn</span>"
       & "</code>, then <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">b"
       & "un</span></code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the same preference chain as every JavaScript"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "component (see <a class=""reference internal"" href=""#licence-resolution"">Lice"
       & "nce resolution</a>).  The SBOM and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Credits tab therefore track the real upstream licence instead of a hard-code"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "copy.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</section>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""system-dependencies"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>System dependencies<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#system-dependencies"" tit"
       & "le=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Discover_Sys"
       & "tem_Dev_Deps</span></code> scans the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s build and dev files (Makefiles,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "shell scripts, Python tools, CI workflows, GPR files, Ada sources) for a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "curated set of known system binaries, then keeps only the tools that are"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "installed on <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">PA"
       & "TH</span></code>. Each becomes a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate"">"
       & "<span class=""pre"">system</span></code>-scope component of the root with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">pkg:generic/&"
       & "lt;name&gt;</span></code> PURL, a resolved <code class=""docutils literal not"
       & "ranslate""><span class=""pre"">version</span></code> (from <code class=""docutil"
       & "s literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">&lt;tool&gt;</span> <span class=""pr"
       & "e"">--version</span></code>),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and no external link or licence "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " by design adacovex provisions only the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "version for system tools and never guesses a repository or licence for them."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">system</span></"
