       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>You can also use <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class="""
       & "pre"">--standard=iso26262</span> <span class=""pre"">--dal=C</span></code> to g"
       & "et the same result as"
