       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h1>Target project requirements<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#target-project-r"
       & "equirements"" title=""Link to this heading"">"
       & Character'Val(194)
       & Character'Val(182)
       & "</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex assesses an <strong>Ada/SPARK project</strong>. The target root "
       & "can be the repository root or a subdirectory (via <code class=""docutils lite"
       & "ral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">--target=PATH</span></code>). For a meani"
       & "ngful report, the target must provide the items that follow. Any missing ite"
       & "m shows as <code class=""docutils literal notranslate""><span class=""pre"">N/A<"
       & "/span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>DAL checks that depend on the missing item report <code class=""docutils l"
       & "iteral notranslate""><span class=""pre"">Unmet</span></code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<section id=""what-the-target-provides"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2>What the target provides<a class=""headerlink"" href=""#what-the-target-pro"
